MuscleBlaze L-Glutamine- Speeds up post-workout Recovery _x000D_
Sore muscles and fatigue? Probably youâ€™re not the only one whoâ€™s ever experienced or experiencing it. It is an inseparable part of the journey towards attaining a sculpted physique. Following the right supplement strategy, you can fuel your muscles with all the required nutrients, enabling them to perform to their maximum potential. _x000D_
L-Glutamine is an essential nutrient that helps in speedy recovery of muscles post-workout. Nuts. milk, eggs, meat, and red cabbage are a great source of L-Glutamine. But, to get the required amount of L-Glutamine from these foods, you need to prepare multiple meals which can be very tiring and even impossible for people leading a hectic life. _x000D_
To provide you a hassle-free L-glutamine intake, MuscleBlaze has invented MuscleBlaze L-Glutamine that helps in boosting your glutamine intake without any badger. _x000D_
It offers 5g of pure L-Glutamine per serving that fuels muscle recovery. It helps in delaying muscle fatigue and slows down muscle breakdown. MuscleBlaze L-Glutamine is also a great option to boost your immunity levels. It helps in enhancing blood and oxygen supply to your muscles to give you more stamina. It is a pure glutamine source with no added sugar to ensure that you donâ€™t get any purposeless calories. _x000D_
Product features and benefits _x000D_
5g glutamine per serving _x000D_
MuscleBlaze L-Glutamine fuels you with 5g of micro-ionized L-Glutamine per serving. It is highly absorbable and enhances the glutamine uptake of your muscles. L-Glutamine is an exuberant amino acid present in the skeletal muscles. MuscleBlaze L-Glutamine helps in soothing muscle soreness and boosts recovery. This results in enhanced performance. _x000D_
Muscle recovery _x000D_
MuscleBlaze L-Glutamine helps in soothing muscle soreness and boosts recovery. This results in enhanced performance. L-Glutamine maintains a positive nitrogen balance that helps in building muscles. It repairs the damaged tissues and helps in building new and stronger muscles. _x000D_
Boost immunity _x000D_
L-Glutamine is also helpful in boosting the immunity levels and also is responsible for vasodilation which enables enhanced blood flow to your muscles and boosts oxygen supply. By supplementing yourself with glutamine, you can enhance your health and experience a reduced rate of infections. _x000D_
Authentication guaranteed _x000D_
To verify your purchase, MuscleBlaze L-Glutamine comes with a unique authentication code that is pasted on the wad. You can SMS the code on the given number or email it at the give email id to authenticate your purchase. This ensures that the product you have received is original. _x000D_
Flexibility of consumption _x000D_
MuscleBlaze L-Glutamine is available in invigorating Fruit Punch flavor and also comes handy in an unflavored format which gives you the flexibility of consumption. To tantalize your taste buds and get a refreshing experience after an intense workout session, sip up MuscleBlaze L-Glutamine Fruit Punch flavor. Mix MuscleBlaze L-Glutamine Unflavored with a beverage of your choice to fuel muscle recovery.",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/ead84e91-0215-43b1-bd08-b91fd8cb54f7.__CR81,0,2680,829_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/9d4331b3-07f1-4cba-8071-5f8e69446c99.__CR0,0,576,576_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/efc71248-28fd-45eb-bc60-dfe41de756d3.__CR0,0,576,576_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/b66b2080-13a6-4bbc-91ee-866d149213f8.__CR0,0,576,576_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/0a18b45b-6d52-4357-8fcf-cab990a5915f.__CR1,0,576,576_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/6282b3ef-f111-444f-8596-0f137b4ea079.__CR1,0,576,576_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",module-12,,i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/ead84e91-0215-43b1-bd08-b91fd8cb54f7.__CR81,0,2680,829_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",basic-module-13-text,,"Sore muscles and fatigue? Probably youâ€™re not the only one whoâ€™s ever experienced or experiencing it. It is an inseparable part of the journey towards attaining a sculpted physique. Following the right supplement strategy, you can fuel your muscles with all the required nutrients, enabling them to perform to their maximum potential. _x000D_
