Frequently Asked Questions _x000D_
What is MuscleBlaze T-Surge Black?_x000D_
MuscleBlaze T Surge Black is an all-natural testo support supplement that helps you boost your t-levels, performance, endurance & strength. _x000D_
Are all the ingredients ayurvedic?_x000D_
Yes, All 12 ingredients in the product are ayurvedic. _x000D_
Any side effects of using it?_x000D_
No _x000D_
Will this help me with muscle gain and muscle strength?_x000D_
Yes, combination herbs like ashwagandha, mucuna pruine, tribulus, shilajit & yashad bhasam will help you to gain muscle mass and strength. _x000D_
Who should consume this?_x000D_
Fitness enthusiasts, gym goers & weight lifters can consume MB T-Surge Black to level up their overall performance with enhanced endurance. _x000D_
How and when to consume this?_x000D_
