/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/58ab481c-e7c6-404a-a158-de9883fee06e.__CR0,18,650,350_PT0_SX650_V1___.jpg",,This 45-litre MuscleBlaze Training Bag has two hand straps and adjustable shoulder straps for comfortable & easy handling,gym bag duffle bag gym men women training bag net pouch shoulder strap travel bag,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/a372874d-63c6-48c7-b69e-45a406903c66.__CR0,5,650,350_PT0_SX650_V1___.jpg",,,,,premium-module-4-two-column-images,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"Customers find the duffel bag spacious and appreciate its well-designed compartments, with one mentioning it keeps gear separate and organized. The bag looks good and has smooth zippers, though opinions on durability are mixed, with some reporting multiple damages in a month of use. The quality receives mixed feedback, with some finding it good while others describe it as poor, and value for money opinions are divided between those who find it worth the price and those who consider it not worth the money. The stitching quality is particularly concerning, with multiple customers reporting that the stitches come off eventually.",Size,positive,"Customers find the duffel bag spacious and appreciate that it fits all their gym gear, including shoes.",36.0,30.0,6.0,"nice, spacious, material and stitching are good the only issue is if you want it to look like showing in the picture you have to fill it to the neck",spacious,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3PLKQ3BCZVZZV,Amazing bag. Can also be used for travelling. Big size. ðŸ˜‚,Big size,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2CPCDOW2WMU4I,...quality gym bag for daily use and i love the product ðŸ˜Š . Size is perfect and spacious enough to fit my gym clothes and other essentials easily...,Size is perfect,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R11Z3YWVT806M0,Good and spacious bag,spacious bag,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RC1F7ABRLRQIA,Storage c