nor but still good product..,good product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2YM2C1GSQTIDE,"Poor quality, the straps started coming off within less than a month of use. Not worth for money.",Poor quality,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1P0BKTH8XF647,Bag itself is of good quality. But it lacks multiple pockets for storage....,good quality,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R31W8CFU2RUD37,"Stitched came oÃºt in a month, poor stich quality.",poor,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R238JTBIF7HC9G,Value for money,mixed,"Customers have mixed opinions about the duffel bag's value for money, with some finding it a value-for-money product while others feel it's not worth the price.",36.0,25.0,11.0,It looks good. It can fit Weightlifting lever belt. Durable. Value for money.,Value for money,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R11L6T5EQ237R2,"WORTH THE MONEY, GREAT PRODUCT!!!! the weight distribution is great....",WORTH THE MONEY,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RXVP4ZA07LNX2,Waste of money. Please donâ€™t buy. For this price we can get better and best product. I ll give negative review.,Waste of money,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2OBIC4L1CVKYS,Its a value for money product,value for money product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R32Q2I8384GA3A,,Cherry,amzn1.account.AGD2X7Q4TPVZUEHTLNQUONALQH2A,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGD2X7Q4TPVZUEHTLNQUONALQH2A?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,"Perfect Gym Companion â€“ Strong, Spacious & StylishPerfect Gym Companion â€“ Strong, Spacious & Stylish","I recently purchased the MB Gym Bag, and Iâ€™m genuinely impressed with the quality.The material feels strong, durable, and premium, not cheap at all.It has enough space to carry all my gym essentials comfortably.My shoes, clothes, towel, shaker, and accessories fit perfectly.The separate compartments are very well designed and useful.Zippers are smooth and strong, which adds to the overall quality.The stitching is neat and solid, showing good craftsmanship.The bag is lightweight yet sturdy, making it easy to carry daily.The shoulder strap is comfortable and doesnâ€™t dig into the skin.It also looks stylish and modern, suitable for both gym and travel.Iâ€™ve been using it regularly, and it still looks brand new.No bad smell or material issues even after continuous use.The size is perfectâ€”not too big and not too small.Itâ€™s ideal for daily workouts, weekend trips, and sports use.Considering the price, the quality is excellent.Definitely a value-for-money product.I would highly recommend the MB Gym Bag to anyone looking for a reliable gym bag.",2026-01-09,1.0,Reviewed in India on 9 January 2026Reviewed in India on 9 January 2026,R9XZ22C9KO4GA,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R9XZ22C9KO4GA/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,One person found this helpful,0.0,0.0,,"Colour: Black, Size: 45 L, Colour: Black, Size: 45 L",rashmi,amzn1.account.AESJRF2V7OSFKAYCPH2UNAEN2QRA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AESJRF2V7OSFKAYCPH2UNAEN2QRA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,The perfect gym bagThe perfect gym bag,"Iâ€™m really happy with this bag. The build quality feels strong and premium, and the material is durable enough for daily use. It has good storage space with well-designed compartments, making it easy to organize essentials. The zippers are smooth, and the stitching looks solid.Comfort-wise, itâ€™s easy to carry and doesnâ€™t feel bulky even when loaded. Overall, itâ€™s a great value for the quality offered and works perfectly for travel, gym, or everyday use. Would definitely recommend it.",2026-01-11,2.0,Reviewed in India on 11 January 2026Reviewed in India on 11 January 2026,R2IP8KR35EY4XJ,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2IP8KR35EY4XJ/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dYn615t7L._SY500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MSQnIGLYL._SY500_.jpg,One person found this helpful,0.0,0.0,,"Colour: Black, Size: 45 L, Colour: Black, Size: 45 L",Colour,Black,Size,45 L,Colour,Black,Size,45 L,Jabbar Khan,amzn1.account.AH76DBSSWV2JN2MQIKBF65VMD7XA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AH76DBSSWV2JN2MQIKBF65VMD7XA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,Good to have one,"Good quality gym bag with enough space for gym essentials. Sturdy material, comfortable to carry, and looks premium. Could have a few more compartments, but overall great value for money.",2026-06-18,3.0,Reviewed in India on 18 June 2026,R230ODNRRJ9K0J,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R230ODNRRJ9K0J/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/7ae20295-6955-4806-9881-a87f93652868._CR84%2C0%2C331%2C331_SX460_SX48_.jpg,"Colour: Black, Size: 45 L",Ravi Bhardwaj,amzn1.account.AEBZ3ILC52W2SC67AX3Y3B34VA3A,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEBZ3ILC52W2SC67AX3Y3B34VA3A?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,1.0,Poor quality,Quality is not good and damage in 1 month,2026-06-12,4.0,Reviewed in India on 12 June 2026,RKOUFI2XOKPSN,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RKOUFI2XOKPSN/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,,"Colour: Black, Size: 45 L",Colour,Black,Size,45 L,Dhruva K.,amzn1.account.AFYMMWNRUFFZATY35HJKYH6VXYRQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFYMMWNRUFFZATY35HJKYH6VXYRQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,if you are looking for a durable and spacious bag go with this one,"very good bag and spacious too, the quality is good and you should definitely go with it. just take care of the strap",2026-05-19,5.0,Reviewed in India on 19 May 2026,R3RTM29C2BGTYD,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3RTM29C2BGTYD/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,,"Colour: Black, Size: 45 L",Colour,Black,Size,45 L,Tanzim,amzn1.account.AE5M2JEVNFRB2NGEGZKRNZ4Z