lase, Protease, Lactase, Lipase & Cellulase.",,Directions:,Add 1 Level Scoop in 300mL milk and Blend vigorously till uniform mixing in a Blender. Recommended 3 servings a day or as suggested by your dietitian.,,,,HIGH PROTEIN: MB Weight Gainer provides 19.5 g of protein in every 100 grams serving with milk to help build lean muscle mass. This special formula enables your body to gain and maintain a healthy weight,"FUEL FOR YOUR WORKOUTS: This weight gainer supplement for men and women helps to deliver optimum energy to the body. With 72 g of complex carbohydrates per serving, this weight gain supplement helps refill the glycogen reserves in the body which are used as fuel during intense workouts","27 VITAMINS & MINERALS BLEND & DIGESTIVE ENZYMES BLEND: This weight gainer protein supplement is fortified with 27 vitamins & minerals to help bridge the nutrient gaps, boost immunity and performance. It also supports the synthesis of new muscle build-up. The blend of digestive enzymes helps in improving digestion and absorption of healthy nutrients",474 CALORIES: MuscleBlaze Weight Gainer is a simple and effective healthy weight gain supplement in India for any adult looking to gain weight. It is crafted to fuel your muscles with 474 calories per serving with milk to promote faster muscle synthesis and prevent post-workout muscle loss,"SCRUMPTIOUS FLAVOURS: This bodybuilding supplement is available in scrumptious flavours like Chocolate, Kesar Pista Badam, Banana, and Kulfi to make a tasty and nutritious health drink. Item form: Powder. Material features: Vegetarian. Container type: Jar. Product benefits: Energy management",,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Primary Supplement Type,Protein,Item Form,Powder,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,Mass Gainer,Age Range Description,Adult,Container Type,Bag,Dosage Form,Powder,Country of Origin,India,Manufacturer,"Sapiens Labs, Twilight Litaka Pharma Ltd., Village Dhana, Bagbania, Post Office Manpura, tehsil Baddi, Distt Solan (HP)-17410",Globa