 Limited,ARU24JXUG3S4L,https://www.amazon.in/sp?seller=ARU24JXUG3S4L,,,2117.0,Health & Personal Care,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/ref=pd_zg_ts_hpc,6.0,Mass & Weight Gainers,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/14095357031/ref=pd_zg_hrsr_hpc,False,,,,Product Description,"Product Description_x000D_
MuscleBlaze Weight Gainer â€“ Advanced Formula for Healthy Gains! _x000D_
This unique weight gain formula is crafted exclusively to support healthy weight gain in lean individuals and all those who want to bulk up in a healthy way. It contains a blend of 5 digestive enzymes to ease the digestion & absorption of nutrients. With every serving of this advanced formula when consumed with milk, you get 19.5 g protein to help you build muscles and 474 calories derived from clean sources to boost weight gain and boost muscle protein synthesis to build new muscles. This product offers a healthy balance of carbohydrates, protein, and vitamins & minerals. It is packed with 27 vitamins and minerals and helps in fulfilling your micronutrient needs. _x000D_
Product Features _x000D_
474 kcal _x000D_
Every serving of this powerful weight gain formula fuels you with 474 calories when consumed with milk. It is packed with high-quality carbohydrates and has an ideal blend of fat and slow-metabolizing carbs. Fast-acting carbs fuel you with instant calories while slow-acting carbs help in maintaining a sustained calorie supply throughout the day. _x000D_
19.5g Protein _x000D_
Each serving of this weight gain powder delivers 19.5 g protein to fuel you with enough energy to carry out your exercises and build lean muscle mass. This special formula helps you in maintaining a healthy weight and keeps you energized all day long. _x000D_
27 Vitamins & Minerals _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Weight Gainer is packed with 27 vital vitamins and minerals to bridge any dietary gaps and fulfil micronutrient deficiencies. It helps in promoting the synthesis of new muscles and fulfils your daily micronutrient needs. _x000D_
Zero Added Sugar _x000D_
MB Weight Gainer contains no added sugar and all the calories are derived from clean sources. It is ideal for all those who are looking forward to putting on a healthy weight without consuming futile calories. _x000D_
Authentication Guaranteed _x000D_
