eat very light and low carb at evening. Give some time to show results it take 25-45 days to show results. The tag line is eat wisely n workout a bit. U ll get results for sure.,2021-06-07,1.0,Reviewed in India on 7 June 2021,R25TK3U1XBSIRZ,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R25TK3U1XBSIRZ/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,62 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Burner Pro, Size: 60 count (Pack of 1)",Milton,amzn1.account.AG3LM3UOY5SPCSAJFIKKIVM4ACMQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AG3LM3UOY5SPCSAJFIKKIVM4ACMQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,"It's good, but...","WEIGHT MANAGEMENT SUPPLEMENT- The new & improved MuscleBlaze MB-Burner PRO comprises super ingredients in potent quantities that will help accelerate your weight management goalsSUPER EFFECTIVE FORMULA- This weight loss supplement contains 400 mg Garcinia Cambogia, 240 mg green tea, & 100 mg green coffee bean extract to suppress appetite & promote healthy weight managementFAT BURNER TABLETS FOR MEN AND WOMEN- MB-Burner PRO contains 1000 mg L-carnitine that helps in transporting fatty acids from foods to mitochondria and in burning fatCALORIE-BURNING- This weight loss supplement for men and women is enriched with 270 mg of caffeine that helps in increasing thermogenesis, burns more calories and enhances energy levelsBOOSTS METABOLISM- These fat burner tablets contain Coleus Forskohlii, Chromium Picolinate, & Black Pepper to help build lean body mass, oxidate fatty acids & boost metabolism.But I find it slow in results, unlike others. and the tablet design is absurd....it should have been a capsule/ soft-get type. Since, in the morning, when your mouth is sry and all...it difficult to chug in this turd!",2023-02-22,2.0,Reviewed in India on 22 February 2023,R3GI3OOIZ8H1QJ,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3GI3OOIZ8H1QJ/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,,31 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/a