.account.AEETF2TGSEXZRQJ3SRJOYUJKWHRQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,1.0,Quality compromised since last 4 years,"I was one of an ardent user of mb fat burner extreme, earlier it use to come in 90 capsule, later they changed to 60 tablets, capsule was super effective, from uplifting the mood to workout duration,When they changed from capsule to tablets, it lost all its effectiveness, severe stomach pain followed by headache started to persist, i called the head office of muscle blaze and enquired, they said they have rebranded it, and capsule is replaced with tablets, and they canâ€™t do nothing about it,I informed them about the sudden side effects i am faceing, they replied rudely, buy or donâ€™t buy, its not their problem,So I replaced this with muscle tech hydroxycut elite capsules, its not as effective as mb 90 capsules, but better then mb 60 tablets,U can buy muscle tech or choose some other brand, but donâ€™t use this tablets,Hope it helps, good day ðŸ‘ðŸ»",2024-11-05,5.0,Reviewed in India on 5 November 2024,R358AXWMAD34UV,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R358AXWMAD34UV/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,24 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/f3884704-d49c-4cbb-9d71-863a2d762b7c._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_SX48_.jpg,"Flavour Name: Burner Pro, Size: 60 count (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Burner Pro,Size,60 count (Pack of 1),Manoj Acharya,amzn1.account.AGZAPZTI6YHEJWR37UL56C4K6ERQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGZAPZTI6YHEJWR37UL56C4K6ERQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Seems to work,"I think that the product did support my weight loss program, although I cannot say this for sure since I was already on low calorie intake and weight training routine. There is a lot of research saying L-carnitine supports fat loss",2025-12-04,6.0,Reviewed in India on 4 December 2025,R2DD4XD0UL11UJ,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2DD4XD0UL11UJ/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,One person found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Burner Pro, Size: 60 count (Pack of 1)",Avinash,amzn1.account.AF6S4JSXD4JFIDKDIY7VHICISGBA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AF6S4JSXD4JFIDKDIY7VHICISGBA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,2.0,One of the least effective caffeine supplementsOne of the least effective caffeine supplements,"One of the weaker caffeine supplements .. 135 mg that's low .. and You barely even feel it working because it's not effective as a fat burner . There's no thermogenic effect .You need minimum 200-300mg caffeine in order to feel it . L carnitine basically allows for  fat breakdown and transport.  Meaning a higher lipids flowing through the blood .So all in all its a very mild appetite suppressant  and NOT A FAT BURNER BY ANY MEANS . A black coffee would work better than this ..  I have used a lot of caffeine supplements and this is the weakest .don't know why people have comments like feeling headaches , insomnia , feeling jittery and stuff.To these people these are common side effects of high caffeine. So do some research before you buy such stuff  .  but 135 mg caffeine is barely anything .  So you guys must really have low tolerance to caffeine",2021-11-23,7.0,Reviewed in India on 23 November 2021Reviewed in India on 23 November 2021,RHNPA1L9VN1N5,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RHNPA1L9VN1N5/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,16 people found this helpful,0.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/14d7bdcf-51fc-4397-9ecd-bb8536d2151a._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_SX48_.jpeg,"Flavour Name: Burner Pro, Size: 60 count (Pack of 1), Flavour Name: Burner Pro, Size: 60 count (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Burner Pro,Size,60 count (Pack of 1),Amazon Customer,amzn1.account.AGODCGDVO326E2Z3KIDV4OMTLB3A,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGODCGDVO326E2Z3KIDV4OMTLB3A?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Received 15 tablet less,The bottle says 60 tablets. But there are o