Features of MuscleBlaze Whey Gold _x000D_
Labdoor, USA Tested & Certified- For Accurate Claims _x000D_
MuscleBlaze is Indiaâ€™s first brand to have its multiple health supplements rigorously tested & certified by Labdoor in California, USA for Accuracy. MB Whey Gold is one of them- meaning its label claims (including protein content) have been proven to be accurate by one of the worldâ€™s most reputed independent testing labs. This Certificate of Analysis is publicly available on Labdoorâ€™s official website for consumers all over the world to view. _x000D_
100% Protein from Whey Isolate _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Whey Gold provides 100% of the whey protein from Whey Protein Isolate with no compromise on quality. _x000D_
Labdoor, USA Tested & Certified- For Purity _x000D_
MuscleBlaze with its cutting-edge formulations and technology aims to provide you with the best sports nutrition you can have to succeed in your fitness journey. To ensure the purity of MB health supplements, they have been rigorously tested & certified by Labdoor in California, USA for Purity making MuscleBlaze Indiaâ€™s first brand to have its multiple supplements rigorously tested & certified by Labdoor. Whey Gold protein powder is completely free from any harmful heavy metals (Lead, Arsenic, etc) or biological contaminants. This Certificate of Analysis is publicly available on Labdoorâ€™s official website for global consumers to view. _x000D_
Enriched With Digestive Enzymes _x000D_
This protein powder is packed with DigeZyme, a superior multi-enzyme blend including Amylase, Protease, Lactase, Lipase, and Cellulase that not only enhance the digestibility of protein but also increase the bioavailability of other nutrients. It enhances the fast absorption of Whey Protein Isolate to improve muscle synthesis. _x000D_
30g Protein Per Serving _x000D_
Get 30g of whey protein in each scoop of Whey Gold, delivering 82% protein content. It is an arduous task to extract enough protein from our regular diets, hence we need to power our muscles with bodybuilding supplements. This whey protein isolate gets absorbed quickly in the gut to help you prevent post-workout fatigue and enriches muscles with protein in an anabolic state even before your muscles begin to undergo catabolism for the ultimate muscle gain for a lean and athletic body. _x000D_
Scrumptious Flavours _x000D_
Connoisseurs of Whey Gold have the option to choose from a multitude of delicious flavour options such as Rich Milk Chocolate, Mocha Cappuccino, Strawberry Shake, Dark Choco Passion, & Gourmet Vanilla. Try these flavours in a chilled protein shake for the best taste. _x000D_
Authenticity Assured: Experience Protein With 100% Transparency _x000D_
MuscleBlaze was the global pioneer in introducing the technology-enabled feature of product Authenticity-Check for its consumers. Whey Gold comes with a unique authenticity code to help customers verify the genuineness of the product. Not only that, each product comes with a NABL-accredited 3rd party lab-test report wherein you can check the protein content of your product with a batch number on MuscleBlazeâ€™s official website. This ensures complete peace of mind! _x000D_
14.1 g Natural EAAsâ€™, 6.62 g Natural BCAAsâ€™ Per Serving _x000D_
These naturally occurring essential amino acids (EAA) and branched-chain amino acids (BCAA) enable fast post-workout recovery by directly getting absorbed in the muscles. We need to consume them through supplements as the human body canâ€™t produce them naturally. MuscleBlaze Whey Gold contains three vital BCAAs Leucine, Isoleucine & Valine in a 2:1:1 ratio respectively. These amino acids reach the muscles undergoing repair & boost protein synthesis leading to faster recovery and reduced muscle soreness. _x000D_
International-Grade Whey Imported From USA & Europe _x000D_
Each unit of MB Whey Gold is manufactured using Whey Isolate imported from either the United States of America (USA) or Western Europe as raw material. The manufacturing process is done in a HACCP, FSSAI certified facility with more than 200 quality checks in place to ensure that only the best international-grade protein, surpassing world-beating standards, reaches MuscleBlaze consumers.",whey gold protein standard supplement kg on nitrotech isolate bodybuilding health,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/b6bb5c3f-f6e3-46f1-8713-992117ce311b.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",whey gold protein standard supplement kg on nitrotech isolate bodybuilding health,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/1d277c2d-4e03-4cf2-8df3-58eab63133d6.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",whey gold protein standard supplement kg on nitrotech isolate bodybuilding health,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/b3634269-aadb-43e8-af13-d27398bac965.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",whey gold protein standard supplement kg on nitrotech isolate bodybuilding health,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/8a64770a-4520-4554-8f6e-7acd0c108985.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",whey gold protein standard supplement kg on nitrotech isolate bodybuilding health,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/ce133045-a0c5-40cf-ab19-2000c4fa0813.__CR0,1,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",whey gold protein standard supplement kg on nitrotech isolate bodybuilding health,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/1c961175-adba-45b0-aabe-6a019e3771df.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",module-9,Features of MuscleBlaze Whey Gold,,,module-9,,,module-9,,Authenticity Assured: Experience Protein With 100% Transparency,"MuscleBlaze was the global pioneer in introducing the technology-enabled feature of product Authenticity-Check for 