amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AF3JTL3KFMWI3YX3JYD5D4CDTZHQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,Product quality,Using this product since 2-3 years. But this time I found the thickness of the shake is thin compared to previous.,2025-10-28,2.0,Reviewed in India on 28 October 2025,R1GD1P1FZND3DR,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1GD1P1FZND3DR/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,,,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Rich Milk Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Rich Milk Chocolate,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),,,,,Amazon Customer,amzn1.account.AFIDCHZNDKM7657XV7J4FMROLCNQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFIDCHZNDKM7657XV7J4FMROLCNQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,"Genuine product, affordable, tastes good.","The product is 100 % genuine. One: it is sold on Amazon by Muscleblaze itself  , this is head turner as very few companies sell their products directly with no third party inclusion. Two: I cross checked the authenticity by the code given on the box on muscleblaze.com/genuine and as expected the product proved it's authenticity. Also I checked the font type given on the box and on the Amazon; that was also same. Three: it is manufactured in INDIA itself so the chances of fake product from international market also get reduced, though I am not saying that it can't be fake due to local manufacturing, it can be, but chances get reduced. It tastes good and affordable as compared to others. You can bet your money on it but be careful about fake products check everysingle detail.",2019-09-14,3.0,Reviewed in India on 14 September 2019,RX4ONRYGMHYL8,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RX4ONRYGMHYL8/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,2 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Rich Milk Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",balram gupta,amzn1.account.AGHL6NG2JRSAYO6DSBQQIAYAYVBQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGHL6NG2JRSAYO6DSBQQIAYAYVBQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,3.0,Contamination,"Taste mixability  good, no lump but I found thick hairsecond time in drink I don't know where it came from?",2025-04-18,4.0,Reviewed in India on 18 April 2025,R1VIIH1QTWCBJL,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1VIIH1QTWCBJL/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,One person found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Rich Milk Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Rich Milk Chocolate,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),Rupinder Bhatty,amzn1.account.AHSCNOXTNX4YMGKE3J6LF5SODXSQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHSCNOXTNX4YMGKE3J6LF5SODXSQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Awesome protien,"I've been using Muscle Blaze for some years, and it's my favorite. It suits my body best. It's very effective for me and I can feel the increase in energy and power within a week of its consumption. I've tried other reputed brands but none are as effective as Muscleblaze. I'm not looking at weight gain and only want to gain lean muscle, hence it suits me best. In case you are looking for bulking up, try other whey concentrates. This is best for maintaining weight and gaining strength.",2024-02-20,5.0,Reviewed in India on 20 February 2024,R35PJVPAHCW6HX,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R35PJVPAHCW6HX/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,2 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Rich Milk Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Rich Milk Chocolate,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),Mohinish,amzn1.account.AFL6VT7QTS5B3X7L76LJOZYGRW4Q,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFL6VT7QTS5B3X7L76LJOZYGRW4Q?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Good enough and ordered another 2 Kgs,"This is my first real protein. The last one I purchased had ""0.97%"" protein (another brand).While there are some concerns that this protein doesn't have 80% protein content but even if it has 70% proven protein content (as given by another reviewer) I believe even then it's good enough. Other foreign brands which are almost double the price can't justify the difference. For 10% more protein I can't imagine myself paying exorbitant amounts. So instead, I take this protein almost 10% more... I read about a recent study that we can absorb 400-500 gms of protein at a time (I can imagine our ancestors making a big killing and having a big party with all the extra protein)... So considering all these facts I think this is good enough for amateurs like me who are not bothered about grams or milligram of stuff.Of course, the taste is extremely good. And I've now ordered 2 Kg pack (I hope they had 5 Kg ones). The only thing that's bothering is gas... and you should take more fiber (like cucumber etc) for combat that...",2017-07-15,6.0,Reviewed in India on 15 July 2017,R2H2NJ8BJ9CK91,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2H2NJ8BJ9CK91/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,8 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Rich Milk Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Supriy bhagat,amzn1.account.AHAUVYJUF52MBEQDWQNTVQWLWSYQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHAUVYJUF52MBEQDWQNTVQWLWSYQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,100% pure whey isolate!! ðŸ‘Œ ðŸ‘,This is the best protein that Mb has to offer!! See it has 100% whey isolate as promised unlike other rangers for ex: The Biozyme performance range ir the Biozyme whey range this one has a little precisely 2 gms less Protein per serving but that's not an issue because this one is the gold one cuz if it were to be the same as the other ranges then it wouldn't be more expensive and wouldn't then come with a gold labeling!! Not for beginners though cuz it's pure whey isolate people who haven't tried whey ever in the lives should try normal whey first and then move on to the more conc. Forms!! And I only recommend MB because even though this one is 4500 rs MRP and you can get it at around 3300-3500 rs it's still cheaper than a lot of other isolate protein providing brands but this is the only Indian brand that does that so very proud of MB and it also comes with a disclaimer warning âš ï¸  not to be used as a product for normal consumption!! And I am sure if you weren't getting results from your previous proteins then you surely would this time with this beast!! Thanks to amazon and MB once again for this wonderful creation!! And helping millions like me reach their goals!!,2023-08-16,7.0,Reviewed in India on 16 August 2023,R2V74ABK98C4H9,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2V74ABK98C4H9/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,2 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/a96c9eef-e475-4e0c-a3a4-a3fd82e20b54._CR0%2C0%2C449%2C449_UX460_SX48_.jpg,"Flavour Name: Rich Milk Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Rich Milk Chocolate,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),Anil kumar,amzn1.account.AE5I3YTR3RFNLUNWJDNVHQI4VUMA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AE5I3YTR3RFNLUNWJDNVHQI4VUMA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,1.0,à¤à¤²à¤°à¥à¤œà¥€ reaction,Mujhe ye pani k sath lene se à¤à¤²à¤°à¥à¤œà¥€ reaction ho rha hai. Ye product accha nhi h,2026-06-21,8.0,Reviewed in India on 21 June 2026,R2PQULPPO8C4KG,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2PQULPPO8C4KG/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/18a9efc4-96cb-4239-b2ce-b992fa3f68dc._CR0%2C0%2C480%2C480_SX460_SX48_.jpg,"Flavour Name: Rich Milk Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Rich Milk Chocolate,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),Delivering to New Delhi 110002 Update location,IN,https://www.amazon.in/s?k=Muscleblaze&crid=2JII973B9FZAX&sprefix=muscleblaze%2Caps%2C253&ref=nb_sb_noss_2&s=popularity-rank,1,,False,,33,https://www.amazon.in/s?k=Muscleblaze&crid=2JII973B9FZAX&sprefix=muscleblaze%2Caps%2C253&ref=nb_sb_noss_2,,,,,,,,whey gold protein standard supplement kg on nitrotech isolate bodybuilding health,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/ece5ed9d-62de-4d22-91b9-0a96f58b486a.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_S