_SX300_V1___.jpg",,Scrumptious Flavours,,"Connoisseurs of Whey Gold have the option to choose from a multitude of delicious flavour options such as Rich Milk Chocolate, Mocha Cappuccino, Strawberry Shake, Dark Choco Passion, & Gourmet Vanilla. Try these flavours in a chilled protein shake for the best taste.",whey gold protein standard supplement kg on nitrotech isolate bodybuilding health,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/1c961175-adba-45b0-aabe-6a019e3771df.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",,,,,,,,,Taste,mixed,"Customers have mixed opinions about the protein powder's taste, with some finding it awesome while others say it's not good and too sweet.",174.0,105.0,69.0,Good mix ability Good taste Good result Authentic product by muscleblaze,Good taste,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2BHJEL6104A0F,"...kg reading the product details but found of highly lower grade, it's too sweet that it is difficult to consume it tastes like we are eating sugar...",too sweet,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2RZ2449X5NLBP,...It tastes good and affordable as compared to others. You can bet your money on it but be careful about fake products check everysingle detail.,tastes good,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RX4ONRYGMHYL8,"Taste is good. There remains some granules after shake, may be issue of specific bottle but need to be addressed.",Taste is good,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3I12NMA4RDKKU,Mixability,mixed,"Customers have mixed opinions about the protein powder's mixability, with some reporting it mixes well with water and milk, while others find it doesn't mix properly.",46.0,28.0,18.0,Good mix ability Good taste Good result Authentic product by muscleblaze,Good mix ability,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2BHJEL6104A0F,Not mixing well...,Not mixing well,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1LT6AKNTDHMDN,"Product is very good in quality,mixability and taste.my only regret is that please bring different flavours available in all variants of the product",mixability,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3BKOK0ODWU3IL,"Quality At par with muscletech, great mixability... Got a whey isolate after 5 years...",great mixability,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2I2X695GA2YJR,Digestive effects,mixed,"Customers have mixed experiences with the protein powder's digestive effects, with some reporting good digestion and the use of digestive enzymes, while others mention issues like bloating, gas problems, and severe vomiting.",21.0,10.0,11.0,"Worst product,causes stomach pain and it taste different from product bought from shop",causes stomach pain,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2J75SU4EWF9JZ,...less calories that makes it great post workout and plus you have digestive enzymes that help in absorbing all that protein....,digestive enzymes,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RX6C4X9CKUEKC,"...the 2kg whey...Although it contains whey protein isolate, it causes digestive issues, which was not the case for the 1kg product(previously bought)...",causes digestive issues,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2O65HSY2WIYST,"...concentrate as well as isolate which is best for recovery, no digestive issues while using this, must buy for the guys who is looking to put on some...",no digestive issues,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R358PNXITK7019,,,,,,,,,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),,,,,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,B0721745M1,,Rich Milk Chocolate 1 kg (Pack of 1),https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kE5N2601L._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616vusyNNhL._SL1500_.jpg,B0721745M1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lQ0TIa1HL._SL1500_.jpg,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,