Features of MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil 1000mg _x000D_
1000mg Omega 3 Fatty Acids _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil Capsules 1000mg are enriched with top-grade Omega 3, sourced from anchovies. _x000D_
180 mg EPA & 120 mg DHA _x000D_
These omega 3 capsules are enriched with 180mg EPA & 120mg DHA. The combination of these two fatty acids provides multiple health benefits. These have a positive impact on the brain, heart, eye functions. _x000D_
Trustified Certified _x000D_
MB Omega 3 Fish Oil 1000mg is tested & certified by Trustified for EPA/DHA accuracy & purity (heavy metals and rancidity). _x000D_
No Fishy Aftertaste _x000D_
Many consumers avoid taking omega 3 fish oil capsules because of the fishy aftertaste. These high-quality fish oil capsules donâ€™t have a fishy aftertaste that spoils the taste of the mouth. _x000D_
Choose MuscleBlaze Fish Oil 1000mg for Better Health! _x000D_
Heart Health _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil 1000mg contains omega 3 fatty acids that help in minimizing inflammation levels throughout the body. It helps in decreasing the levels of triglycerides, controlling irregular heartbeats, and maintaining healthy cholesterol levels. _x000D_
Joint Flexibility _x000D_
Bodybuilders are involved in heavy lifting that can trigger soreness, joint stiffness, and inflammation. This omega 3 fish oil 1000mg contains EPA & DHA that helps in making the joints more flexible. _x000D_
Brain Function _x000D_
These omega 3 fish oil capsules help in improving brain function. Low levels of DHA are closely related to smaller brain size and may hinder learning and memory. MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil 1000mg is fuelled with 120mg DHA to enhance brain function. _x000D_
Frequently Asked Questions about MB Fish Oil 1000 mg _x000D_
Why is MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil Capsules 1000mg required?_x000D_
Omega 3 is a type of essential fatty acid that is not produced in the human body. A good fish oil supplement like MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil 1000mg ensures that you get your daily required intake of Omega 3 to support various metabolic functions. _x000D_
What are the primary nutrients in these omega 3 fish oil capsules?_x000D_
MuscleBlaze omega 3 fish oil capsules contain long-chain fatty acids like EPA and DHA that are good fats required for your body to function at its best abilities. These fatty acids are also necessary for your body to absorb several nutrients effectively. _x000D_
How does Omega 3 improve performance?_x000D_
Omega 3 is a powerful antioxidant. It prevents any oxidative damage and also supports faster muscle recovery for better athletic performance. It also reduces any tenderness and inflammation in the joints to ensure more mobility and flexibility of your joints. _x000D_
Does it aid muscle development?_x000D_
EPA and DHA present in MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil Capsules 1000mg boost muscle synthesis and prevent any muscle breakdown. This results in improved lean muscle development. _x000D_
Do omega 3 fish oil capsules have a fishy aftertaste?_x000D_
There is no fishy taste after consuming these omega 3 fish oil capsules. _x000D_
