 the levels of triglycerides, controlling irregular heartbeats, and maintaining healthy cholesterol levels.",fish oil supplements omega 3 capsules joint health anchovies epa dha bodybuilding hair growth,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/eeaea21d-9f23-4fc9-87be-e5c205ba2330.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",Joint Flexibility,"Bodybuilders are involved in heavy lifting that can trigger soreness, joint stiffness, and inflammation. This omega 3 fish oil 1000mg contains EPA & DHA that helps in making the joints more flexible.",fish oil supplements omega 3 capsules joint health anchovies epa dha bodybuilding hair growth,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/5b121a3c-e38a-4081-9f5d-4237ec64d9f1.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",Brain Function,These omega 3 fish oil capsules help in improving brain function. Low levels of DHA are closely related to smaller brain size and may hinder learning and memory. MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil 1000mg is fuelled with 120mg DHA to enhance brain function.,fish oil supplements omega 3 capsules joint health anchovies epa dha bodybuilding hair growth,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/118ef8f2-6a2f-4541-b902-80c0c393aef4.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",3p-module-b,,,,fish oil supplements omega 3 capsules joint health anchovies epa dha bodybuilding hair growth,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/7681f1ed-ed6e-4fe3-ac20-73419748146d.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",3p-module-b,Frequently Asked Questions about MB Fish Oil 1000 mg,,"Why is MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil Capsules 1000mg required?_x000D_
Omega 3 is a type of essential fatty acid that is not produced in the human body. A good fish oil supplement like MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil 1000mg ensures that you get your daily required intake of Omega 3 to support various metabolic functions. _x000D_
What are the primary nutrients in these omega 3 fish oil capsules?_x000D_
MuscleBlaze omega 3 fish oil capsules contain long-chain fatty acids like EPA and DHA that are good fats required for your body to function at its best abilities. These fatty acids are also necessary for your body to absorb several nutrients effectively. _x000D_
How does Omega 3 improve performance?_x000D_
Omega 3 is a powerful antioxidant. It prevents any oxidative damage and also supports faster muscle recovery for better athletic performance. It also reduces any tenderness and inflammation in the joints to ensure more mobility and flexibility of your joints. _x000D_
Does it aid muscle development?_x000D_
EPA and DHA present in MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil Capsules 1000mg boost muscle synthesis and prevent any muscle breakdown. This results in improved lean muscle development. _x000D_
Do omega 3 fish oil capsules have a fishy aftertaste?_x000D_
There is no fishy taste after consuming these omega 3 fish oil capsules.",,,,,"Customers find this fish oil supplement to be of good quality and authentic, with positive health benefits particularly for joints, heart, and brain health. They consider it good value for money and appreciate its omega-3 content, with one customer noting it contains 1000mg of omega 3 and DHA. The taste and odor receive mixed reviews - while some find it nice, others report a horrible taste and bad smell. Similarly, experiences with burping are mixed, with some reporting no fishy burps while others experience daily fishy burping.",Quality,positive,Customers find this fish oil supplement to be of good quality.,272.0,253.0,19.0,This is a good product I am using it very effective and good for body quality product,good product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R35H26RNLF38ZC,"...Overall nice product. Didn't notice any difference till now, it's been 3 days of use. Will update later",nice product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RINLMLOLU9JBG,Like the package . Delivery on time. Found that it is Genuine product using the code on the lid while opening the box ....,Genuine product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3BRW95LJVJCV4,...Great product. Good packing and on time delivery. I am using MB whey since last 2 years so have trust on this brand.,Great product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R38T5MIE0CTB1M,Health benefits,positive,"Customers report positive health benefits from this fish oil supplement, noting improvements in joint health and benefits for the heart, brain, and overall well-being.",101.0,94.0,7.0,It is good for health also helpful in maintaining your cholesterol level,good for health,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1L8RC1AC5Z5P1,This is a good product I am using it very effective and good for body quality product,very effective,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R35H26R