"MuscleBlaze Biozyme Performance Whey Protein Powder, Chocolate Hazelnut (2kg / 4.4lbs) | 25g Protein Per Scoop | Clinically Tested 50% Higher Protein Absorption",https://www.amazon.in/dp/B095SV6BBZ,B095SV6BBZ,B095SV6BBZ,6699.0,â‚¹,True,In stock  In stock,7799.0,â‚¹,MuscleBlaze,,,4.2,0.63,0.2,0.07,0.02,0.08,4214.0,,Health & Personal Care > Diet & Nutrition > Sports Supplements > Protein Supplements > Whey Proteins,0,Visit the MuscleBlaze Store,https://www.amazon.in/stores/MuscleBlaze/page/9A784926-3F81-400C-8D18-DDF7BBE45F17?lp_asin=B095SV6BBZ&ref_=ast_bln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandlogo_sto,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sRE+zUa9L._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sRE+zUa9L._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W-zHTkguL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rBo2HFW6L._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412zKVd7-RL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51V7MMIAbZL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Cv0otZPXL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s0HTuXpuL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NQ+HJ2j8L._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lvhcYKAQL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719D7udqMnL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Kbdq5unvL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZHLFdL-0L._SL1500_.jpg,Important information,Safety Information:,"Consult your healthcare professional before using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking any medication or have a medical condition. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease or health condition.",,Ingredients:,Please see the label image for ingredient information,,Directions:,Consume at your own discretion or as per labelled recommended usage.,,,,"100% Clean & Pure Concentrate Whey: Made from premium whey sourced from USA and Europe, free from artificial colors, artificial flavors, added sugar, or preservatives.","World's Only Protein with U.S. Patented Enzymes: Featuring the innovative Enhanced Absorption Formula (EAF), it delivers 50% higher protein absorption, optimizing muscle recovery and eliminating protein digestion challenges.","Most Tested Whey for Unmatched Trust: 100% blind tested by Labdoor (USA), Informed Choice (UK), and Trustified Gold (India), ensuring accurate label claims and purity. Free from heavy metals, aflatoxins, banned substances, pesticides, and steroids. Each batch is also NABL-tested, with reports published on the MuscleBlaze website for complete transparency.","India's 1st clinically proven whey protein: Biozyme Performance whey is proven for superior absorption and enhanced muscle-building efficacy. The results of the clinical study, registered with the ICMR's Clinical Trials Registry - India, highlight its effectiveness in reducing stomach discomfort commonly associated with high-protein digestion.","Globally Recognized Award-Winning Protein: Winner of the Nutra Ingredients Award 2021 for Sports Nutrition, recognized for its research, innovation, and quality. It also features the Asia Star Award-winning ""Scoop-on-Top"" packaging with a patent-granted design for convenience and hygiene.",,Brand Name,MuscleBlaze,Model Name,av2025-MuscleBlaze-lbs g protein per scoop clinically tested higher protein absorption-f7d2f964,Country of Publication,India,Item Weight,2 Kilograms,Manufacturer,"Sapiens Labs, Sapiens Labs., Village Dhana â€“ Bagbania, P.O. Manpura, Tehsil Baddi, Nalagarh, Solan, Himachal Pradesh-174101",Model Number,NUT7239-05,Manufacturer Part Number,8906116954171,Item Type Name,Biozyme Whey Protein,Importer Contact Information,"Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana-Bagbania, P.O.Manpura, Tehsil Nalagarh, Solan (Himachal Pradesh)-174101",Manufacturer Contact Information,"Sapiens Labs., Village Dhana â€“ Bagbania, P.O. Manpura, Tehsil Baddi, Nalagarh, Solan, Himachal Pradesh-174101",Age Range Description,Adult,Packer Contact Information,"Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana-Bagbania, P.O.Manpura, Tehsil Nalagarh, Solan (Himachal Pradesh)-174101",Best Sellers Rank,#41 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#1 in Whey Proteins,ASIN,B095SV6BBZ,Customer Reviews,"4.2 4.2 out of 5 stars (4,214) 4.2 out of 5 stars",Number of Items,1,Unit Count,2000.0 Grams,Recommended Uses For Product,Post-Workout,Product Dimensions,20.3 x 20.3 x 29.5 cm; 2 kg,Date First Available,2021-03-30 00:00:00,Item model number,NUT7239-05,Country of Origin,India,Packer,"Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana-Bagbania, P.O.Manpura, Tehsil Nalagarh, Solan (Himachal Pradesh)-174101",Importer,"Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana-Bagbania, P.O.Manpura, Tehsil Nalagarh, Solan (Himachal Pradesh)-174101",Item Dimensions LxWxH,20.3 x 20.3 x 29.5 Centimeters,Net Quantity,2000.0 Grams,Generic Name,Biozyme Whey Protein,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Model Name,av2025-MuscleBlaze-lbs g protein per scoop clinically tested higher protein absorption-f7d2f964,Recommended Uses For Product,Post-Workout,Number of Items,1,Net Quantity,2000.0 Grams,,,,,,,,,,,B09BHZ9ZTT,B0DZCSNCKK,Rich Chocolate 500 g (Pack of 1),https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Pl8mW8CnL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VCNAJfxbL._SL1500_.jpg,B09BHZ9ZTT,,Chocolate Hazelnut + Watermelon Kool Aid 1 kg (Pack of 1) + 30 Servings,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4160so2+WQL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e1qoByCML._SL1500_.jpg,B0DZCSNCKK,,https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B095SV6BBZ,True,"Sunday, 19 July","Sunday, 19 July",,,,Flavour Name,Chocolate Hazelnut,Bright Lifecare Private Limited,ARU24JXUG3S4L,https://www.amazon.in/sp?seller=ARU24JXUG3S4L,,,41.0,Health & Personal Care,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/ref=pd_zg_ts_hpc,1.0,Whey Proteins,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/11364606031/ref=pd_zg_hrsr_hpc,False,,,,Product Description,"Product Description_x000D_
