us-media-library-service-media/3138a60a-46b8-4bb8-ba9c-bedb38bd0e31.__CR0,0,1464,600_PT0_SX1464_V1___.jpg",premium-module-13-carousel,,,,,,,,"Customers find the protein powder effective, particularly for muscle recovery, and appreciate its fast absorption rate and easy mixing with water. The product receives positive feedback for its quality and protein content, with one customer noting its accurate percentage on a dry basis. While some customers report no digestive issues, others experience stomach aches and vomiting. The taste receives mixed reviews, with some enjoying the flavor while others find it too sweet, and opinions on value for money are divided between those who find it good value and those who consider it a waste of money.",Quality,positive,"Customers find the protein powder to be of good quality, with one customer specifically mentioning its labdoor certification.",143.0,118.0,25.0,It is a good product. Visible results but started to see those after a month of continue use of 1 scoop. No problem in digestion....,good product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1UMHJZUR61DNN,"This is very good product and very fast disole in water as well as fast recovery muscle,",very good product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2HKZ2AA8GMH9N,Yes it is nice product. Taste is not as much. But the richness and quality of protien is so nice. Highly Recommended!,nice product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R22SE44DRP6F4N,Amazing productâ€¦. No bloating No indigestion / irritation Less bowel gas Tasty ðŸ˜‹ flavour.,Amazing product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1I50CBOPTZCDP,Effectiveness,positive,"Customers find the protein powder effective, particularly for muscle recovery, with one customer noting significant improvements in their body.",57.0,45.0,12.0,Superb taste. Tried mango flavour and the taste is 10/10. Also effective. Earlier i was using ON whey,effective,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RFEN0UCRHTJIS,Good product for health supplements Taste is good and very effective,very effective,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RGZ2MOZRDH5W4,"Its my 2nd time ordering this whey. It is really effective, the results are clear, the taste is great and over-all the product is worth the money",really effective,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3ILLWIGLMZYP4,"...The downside is muscle recovery not so efficient like other protein powder like gold standard whey and also this cause more flatulence, which is not...",muscle recovery not so efficient,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R4C42PTKE24RW,Protein quality,positive,"Customers find the protein quality good, with one customer noting the accurate percentage on the dry basis and another mentioning its effectiveness in protein synthesis.",46.0,37.0,9.0,...it's affordable as well in this price range it's one of the best whey protein available along with the promising brand name of muscleblaze gives it...,best whey protein,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3928HSKAYD9FC,...I would say it's the best protein powder i have used so far.,best protein powder,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3BERAP3JYTA0C,Protein is good. Taste is good. But this company pricing is strange. They keep increasing 200 rupees every month....,Protein is good,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1TGYVZGBFQGW4,"Good protein! Good value for money! Authentic, I checked the QR!",Good protein,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R27BC2DELZQ8XL,Mixability,positive,"Customers find that the protein powder mixes well, particularly with water, and one customer notes that it requires only 10-15 seconds of shaking for a lump-free shake.",33.0,28.0,5.0,I like this product as its mixability and absorbtion rate is better than other whey which I used earlier. I feels the difference ....Taste is ok,mixability,https://www.amazo