"MuscleBlaze 100% Clean Raw Whey Protein Isolate, Unflavoured (500g) + Cyclone Blender Gym Shaker (700ml)",https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0GQTRLR1J,B0GQTRLR1J,B0GQTRLR1J,2602.14,â‚¹,True,In stock,3198.0,â‚¹,MuscleBlaze,,,4.6,0.63,0.37,0.0,0.0,0.0,3.0,,Health & Personal Care > Diet & Nutrition > Sports Supplements > Protein Supplements > Whey Proteins,0,Visit the MuscleBlaze Store,https://www.amazon.in/stores/MuscleBlaze/page/9A784926-3F81-400C-8D18-DDF7BBE45F17?lp_asin=B0GQTRLR1J&ref_=ast_bln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandlogo_sto,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411NQXO2OkL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411NQXO2OkL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418bnC-e7-L._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pYiRNIxSL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hJ6Z1h4hL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419qoETWkYL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NMcQ6ixCL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pfRa2jE2L._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613pj3PtMXL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iIydsiFGL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wrWp1YMEL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zaAPL8BzL._SL1500_.jpg,,Important information,Ingredients:,Please see the label image for ingredient information,,,,,,,,,"MuscleBlaze 100% Clean Raw Whey Isolate is the ideal choice for fitness enthusiasts and athletes looking for a versatile, high-quality protein supplement. With 27g of protein per serving and a low-carb composition, it supports lean muscle growth, aids recovery, and fits perfectly into any diet plan. Its unflavoured, neutral profile allows you to experiment with endless recipe ideas, making it a truly adaptable protein source. Whether you blend it into your shakes, mix it into yogurt, or use it in your cooking, MB Raw Whey Isolate complements your nutritional needs effortlessly. The product is rich in essential amino acids, including BCAAs and EAAs, which enhance muscle repair and reduce recovery time. Additionally, its light, digestible formula ensures itâ€™s easy on your stomach, providing a smooth experience with every use. If you're looking to take your fitness game to the next level, MuscleBlaze Cyclone Shaker is the perfect companion to fuel your inner champion mindset. MuscleBlaze Cyclone Shaker with 700ml capacity is a perfect fit as your gym accessory. Use it as a water bottle, BCAA or protein supplement bottle. It also includes measurement markings to keep track of the quantity. It is stylish and 100% safe. It is made from BPA and is plastic-free. With a leakproof cap, MuscleBlaze Gym Shaker lets you take your pre-workout/BCAA/protein shake on the go without any random spills. Enjoy smooth shakes with Cyclone blender for hassle-free mixing, helping you achieve peak performance.","Pure Whey Protein Isolate: MuscleBlaze 100% Clean Raw Whey Isolate is made from a single ingredientâ€”pure whey protein isolate. It delivers a high-protein, low-carb solution tailored for those who prioritize effective muscle recovery and lean muscle growth without unnecessary additives or fillers.","Low-Carb and High-Protein Nutrition: Each serving packs 27g of premium protein with minimal carbs, making it a perfect fit for individuals aiming to maintain a lean physique or follow a low-carb diet.","Versatile and Customizable: The unflavoured formula blends seamlessly with a variety of recipes, offering endless possibilities. Whether you add it to your smoothies, shakes, oats, or even baked goods, it complements your diet without altering taste or adding sugars. This flexibility ensures it suits different dietary preferences and goals.","SHAKER WITH CYCLONE BLENDER: Are you a fitness champion seeking the ultimate workout supplement companion? MuscleBlaze Cyclone shaker boasts of a Cyclone blender that ensures a seamless blend of your favourite supplements, helping you achieve peak performance","700ml CAPACITY: With a genero