"MuscleBlaze Raw Whey Protein Concentrate (Unflavoured, 1kg) | Light & Clean Protein | Easy to Digest",https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0BPH457FG,B0BPH457FG,B0BPH457FG,2399.0,â‚¹,True,In stock  In stock,2899.0,â‚¹,MuscleBlaze,,,4.2,0.57,0.23,0.11,0.03,0.06,1477.0,,Health & Personal Care > Diet & Nutrition > Sports Supplements > Protein Supplements > Whey Proteins,1,Visit the MuscleBlaze Store,https://www.amazon.in/stores/MuscleBlaze/page/9A784926-3F81-400C-8D18-DDF7BBE45F17?lp_asin=B0BPH457FG&ref_=ast_bln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandlogo_sto,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qEOzqBDNL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qEOzqBDNL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51w-H9hx0oL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z3BtBMtGL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pjCMsfe2L._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X0+a-0TSL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C1d9izXGL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q3EIbpEeL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AaTO1KSAL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VudQVs5CL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QPBBTvMgL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Lr+ryx3-L._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817pJIkx-UL._SL1500_.jpg,Important information,Ingredients:,"Whey Protein Concentrate, Whey Powder, Emulsifier (INS 322 (i)), Bromelain & Papain",,,,,,,,,"MuscleBlaze Raw Whey Protein 1kg with digestive enzymes is an unsweetened and unflavored whey protein powder that provides flexibility of use for its consumers. Raw Whey Protein benefits post-workout muscle recovery. Every 34 gram serving of raw whey protein powder contains 24 grams of protein, 5.2 grams of naturally occurring BCAAs, and 11.2 grams EAAs. MB raw whey goes through minimal processing which ensures that the nutrients of whey protein concentrate are preserved in their most original form. The product delivers 70% protein content and helps in building lean muscle, enhancing muscle recovery, and reducing muscle loss. Protein also keeps you satiated for longer. MB raw whey provides the highest quality protein which has gone through multiple tests to ensure high quality and purity of whey protein concentrate. It contains no artificial colours, sugars, or flavours for the calorie-conscious. The added digestive enzymes help in solving the challenge of digestion of protein so that you get the maximum benefit out of your protein powder.   Directions: Start consuming Â½ scoop (17g) of MuscleBlaze Raw Whey Protein in 100 ml chilled water for the initial 05 days then take 01 level of scoop (34g) of whey protein in 200 ml chilled water. Consume 1-2 shakes in a day for the best result.","UNFLAVOURED PROTEIN SUPPLEMENT: MuscleBlaze Raw Whey Protein is an unflavoured protein supplement with not just zero sugar, but also zero sweetener content","TOTAL FLAVOUR FLEXIBILITY: MuscleBlaze Raw Whey Protein can be consumed in a variety of ways like protein cakes, protein shakes, smoothies, protein bars, etc. You can add any flavour of your choice for a delicious treat","HIGH PROTEIN IN EACH SERVING: Get 24 g protein, 5.2 g of naturally occurring BCAAs, 11.2 g EAAs as well as digestive enzymes in every 34 g of serving of MuscleBlaze Raw Whey Protein Concentrate 70% for effective muscle gain and synthesis","SUPERIOR MUSCLE-BUILDING: Regular & optimum use (2 servings per day) of MuscleBlaze Raw Whey Protein 70% helps build lean muscle for fitness goals, enhances post workout recovery & reduces muscle loss",CLEAN & MINIMAL PROCESSING PROTEIN: MB Raw Whey Protein has gone through extremely minimal processing to ensure the whey protein nutrients are preserved in their original form. Added digestive enzymes support fast protein digestion for optimum benefit,HIGHEST QUALITY PROTEIN: Multiple tests ensure highest quality & purity of Whey Protein Concentrate in MB Raw Whey health supplement powder,Flavor,Unflavoured,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,"Faster muscle recovery, muscle growth",Protein Source,Whey,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Package Type Name,Bottle,Age Range Description,Adult,Manufacturer Part Number,8906116957912,Model number,NUT7957-01,Item Nype Name,Raw Whey Protein,Manufacturer,"Sapiens Labs, Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana-Bagbania, P.O.Manpura, Tehsil Nalagarh, Solan (Himanchal Pradesh)-174101",Country of Origin,India,Manufacturer Contact Information,"Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana-Bagbania, P.O.Manpura, Tehsil Nalagarh, Solan (Himanchal Pradesh)-174101",Packer Contact Information,"Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana-Bagbania, P.O.Manpura, Tehsil Nalagarh, Solan (Himanchal Pradesh)-174101",Best Sellers Rank,#938 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#19 in Whey Proteins,ASIN,B0BPH457FG,Customer Reviews,"4.2 4.2 out of 5 stars (1,477) 4.2 out of 5 stars",Total Servings Per Container,29,Item Weight,1 Kilograms,Unit Count,1000.0 Grams,Number of Items,1,Item Dimensions,14.5 x 14.5 x 25.9 Centimeters,Recommended Uses For Product,Post-Workout,Product Dimensions,14.5 x 14.5 x 25.9 cm; 1 kg,Date First Available,2022-12-08 00:00:00,Item model number,NUT7957-01,Packer,"Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana-Bagbania, P.O.Manpura, Tehsil Nalagarh, Solan (Himanchal Pradesh)-174101",Item Dimensions LxWxH,14.5 x 14.5 x 25.9 Centimeters,Net Quantity,1000.0 Grams,Generic Name,Raw Whey Protein,,,,,,,,,,,,,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Flavour,Unflavoured,Servings per Container,29,Item Weight,1 Kilograms,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,"Faster muscle recovery, muscle growth",Protein Source,Whey,Net Quantity,1000.0 Grams,Recommended Uses For Product,Post-Workout,Number of Items,1,B0BPH457FG,,Unflavoured 29 Servings (Pack of 1),https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qEOzqBDNL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q3EIbpEeL._SL1500_.jpg,B0BPH457FG,,,,,,,https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B0BPH457FG,True,"Sunday, 19 July","Sunday, 19 July",,,,,,Bright Lifecare Private Limited,ARU24JXUG3S4L,http