"MuscleBlaze EAA 8000 Powder (Razz Lemonade, 340g, 25 Servings) | 8000mg EAAs Blend, 1000mg Hydration Blend | 750mg L-Citrulline",https://www.amazon.in/dp/B09QX8BDBV,B09QX8BDBV,B09QX8BDBV,1459.0,â‚¹,True,In stock,1999.0,â‚¹,MuscleBlaze,,,4.1,0.59,0.21,0.07,0.02,0.11,382.0,,"Health & Personal Care > Diet & Nutrition > Vitamins, Minerals & Supplements > Amino Acids > BCAAs",1,Visit the MuscleBlaze Store,https://www.amazon.in/stores/MuscleBlaze/page/9A784926-3F81-400C-8D18-DDF7BBE45F17?lp_asin=B09QX8BDBV&ref_=ast_bln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandlogo_sto,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415gWq9QaDL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415gWq9QaDL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yU7mThbeL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KZwa-PREL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GWPjTs7zL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xv-Vrv+8L._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51x0qPSEyOL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QSGgekMkL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HtvTkJ8mL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IblevlSDL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m5zELIbAL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717mmzJ-WUL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hi+m-i82L._SL1500_.jpg,Important information,Safety Information:,"Consult your Healthcare professional before using this product if you are pregnant,nursing, taking any medication or having a medical condition.",,Ingredients:,"Branched Chain Amino Acids Powder 1L-Leucine, L-Isoleucine & Natural Flavouring Substances, Orange Fruit Powder, Acidity Regulator (INS 330), L-Citrulline DL-Malate (2:1), L-Lysine HCl, L-Threonine, Trisodium Citrate Anhydrous, Coconut Water Powder, Nature Identical Savouring Substance, L-Phenylalanine, L-Histidine NCI, Sodium Chloride, -Tryptophan, Potassium Chloride, Natural Food Colours (INS 162 and INS 150d), Sweetener (INS 955), DL-Methionine, Anti-Foaming Agent (INS 9004 BioPerine' (Black Pepper Extract) & Synthetic Food Colour (INS 124).",,Directions:,Mix one scoop of MuscleBlaze EAA 8000 powder in chilled water in volume as per your liking. (1)For an ideal taste: 300-350ml (2)For a strong taste: 250-300ml (3)For a dilute taste: 350-400ml,,,"Fast muscle recovery is one of the most important aspects of bodybuilding as it helps you stay on track and keep achieving new fitness milestones faster as compared to the long recovery time in-between the exercises. Along with ample rest and a good workout routine, your body also needs great nutritional support that can help you power through each workout session.  Get good muscle pumps, instant energy, stamina, and strength with the power of 9 Essential Amino Acids in MuscleBlaze EAA 8000, the best EAA supplement on the market. Essential Amino Acids are among the most widely used supplements as they are easily absorbed and give your body the fuel that it needs to perform at its best abilities each time.  MuscleBlaze EAA 8000 intra workout supplement is formulated especially keeping the constitution of your muscles in mind to support faster recovery. This intra workout supplement for men and women provides 8 g of EAAs comprising BCAAs (Leucine, Isoleucine, & Valine) in a ratio of 2:1:1 in each serving. The unique hydration blend keeps you hydrated and energized for longer workouts. This EAA BCAA supplement is enriched with Citrulline & Bioperine which help in enhanced pumps and absorption of nutrients respectively. It has no added sugar or trans fat & contains immunity boosters Zinc and Vitamin C. Enjoy it in two refreshing flavours - Razz Lemonade, Blue Cola, & Melon Martini.","INTRA WORKOUT SUPPLEMENT: The new MuscleBlaze EAA 8000 is a robust & intra workout supplement that enhances your muscle recovery & energy. It is available in refreshing flavours - Razz Lemonade, Blue Cola, & Melon Martini",8g OF EAAS: MuscleBlaze EAA 8000 provides 8 g of EAAs comprising BCAAs in the ratio 2:1:1 in each serving. EAAs support muscle growth & recovery and minimize catabolism during your workouts,PROVIDES ENERGY & HYDRATION: This EAA supplement for men and women provides a Unique Hydration Blend consisting of electrolytes and natural coconut powder which keeps you brimming with energy and provides hydration during intense workouts,"ENHANCES PUMP: This EAA supplement provides Citrulline which increases blood flow and stimulates nitric oxide production, which results in good workout pumps","ENHANCED ABSORPTION: This amino acid supplement provides BioPerine which induces thermogenesis, helping in enhanced absorption of nutrients",100% RDA OF IMMUNITY BOOSTERS: MuscleBlaze EAA 8000 contains 100% RDA of Zinc and Vitamin C which are potent antioxidants & support immunity,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Primary Supplement Type,Amino Acid,Item Form,Powder,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,"Promote Muscle Recovery, Helps speed recovery",Age Range Description,Adult,Container Type,Jar,Dosage Form,Powder,Country of Origin,India,Manufacturer,"Maxcure Nutravedics Ltd., Maxcure Nutravedics Ltd., Sector-13 6A.I.I.E, Haridwar,Uttrakhand-249403",Item Nype Name,EAA 8000,Manufacturer Contact Information,"Maxcure Nutravedics Ltd., Sector-13 6A.I.I.E, Haridwar,Uttrakhand-249403",Model number,NUT7661-01,Packer Contact Information,"Maxcure Nutravedics Ltd., Sector-13 6A.I.I.E, Haridwar,Uttrakhand-249403",Manufacturer Part Number,NUT7661-01,Best Sellers Rank,"#4,182 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#5 in BCAAs",ASIN,B09QX8BDBV,Customer Reviews,4.1 4.1 out of 5 stars (382) 4.1 out of 5 stars,Unit Count,340.0 Grams,Item Weight,340 Grams,Item Dimensions,18.3 x 10.7 x 5.6 Centimeters,Number of Items,1,Total Servings Per Container,25,Flavor,Razz Lemonade,Special Ingredients,"Amino Aci, L-Citrulline",Material Features,Sugar Free,Material Type Free,Sugar Free,Colour,Razz Lemonade,Product Dimensions,18.3 x 10.7 x 5.6 cm; 340 g,Date First Available,2022-01-21