"MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred, 90 Tablets, with Thermogenic, Metabolism, Weight Management, Carbohydrate Blocker and Diuretic Blends & MB Energy Pro | Supports Weight Management & Boosts Metabolism",https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0CPSX5H82,B0CPSX5H82,B0CPSX5H82,999.0,â‚¹,True,In stock,1299.0,â‚¹,MuscleBlaze,,,3.8,0.49,0.18,0.14,0.06,0.13,286.0,,"Health & Personal Care > Diet & Nutrition > Vitamins, Minerals & Supplements > Essential Fatty Acids & Oils > Fat Burners",0,Visit the MuscleBlaze Store,https://www.amazon.in/stores/MuscleBlaze/page/9A784926-3F81-400C-8D18-DDF7BBE45F17?lp_asin=B0CPSX5H82&ref_=ast_bln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandlogo_sto,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41W3VwdjHBL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41W3VwdjHBL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412U4cuUo-L._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fNDxo-BAL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+Eb8Ba30L._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sgDrvjhQL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41CksGdF44L._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612gUOSQLmL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IRT4gYHsL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dNJmBFTbL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fTM0LQ7LL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71es-KtwT9L._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F-asK+uJL._SL1500_.jpg,Important information,Safety Information:,"Consult your Healthcare professional before using this product if you are pregnant,nursing, taking any medication or having a medical condition.",,Ingredients:,"Diluent IINS 341(). Caffeine, Juniper Juniperus communis/ Leaf Extract Green Coffee ( Coffea arabica -45% Chlorogenic Acid Bean Extract. Green Tea (Camellia sinensis -95%. Polyphenols) Leaf Extract, Ginger (Zingiber officinale -5% Gingerol) Rhizome Extract, Anti-Caking Agent [INS 500 (i)). Stabilizer (INS 1202), Disintegrants (INS 468 & Sodium Starch Glycolate), Coating Agent (INS 1203), Glidant INS 553 (i)) Emulsifier [INS 322 (]. Anti-Foaming Agent (INS 1521). Synthetic Food Colour (INS 122), Natural Food Colour (INS 171), Ginseng (Panax ginseng-107. Ginsenosides) Root Extract, Disintegrant (INS 330). Vijaysar (Pterocarpus marsupium -95%. Resveratrol) Extract. Coating Agents (INS 462 & INS 464), Binding Agent (INS 1201). Anti-Sticking Agent [INS 470(i. Anti-Caking Agent (INS 551), Olive (Olea europea-10% Oleurperon) Leaf Extract, Menaquinone & Artificial Flavouring Substance (Strawberry). WEIGHT MANAGEMENT* TABLET Kidney Bean (Phaseolus vulgaris) Seed Extract, L-Carnitine, Diluent INS 460 (i. Jamun (Syzygium cumini -47. Saponin) Seed Extract, Saptrangi (Salacia reticulata-20% Saponin) Root Extract. Dandelion (Taraxacum officinate) Whole Plant Extract, Bhringraj (Eclipta prostata -0.5%. Bitters) Whole Plant Extract, Kala Jeera (Carum carvi - 0.5%. Volatile oils) Fruit Extract, Stabilizer (INS 1202). Conjugated Linoleic Acid, Coating Agent (NS 1203)",,Directions:,1 Tablet (1.15 g) Thermobolic Tablet + 2 Tablet (2.88 g) Weight Management Tablet per day,,,,"THE THERMOGENIC EDGE: MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred is powered by MB Energy Pro, a unique and potent formula to give your workouts an edge & enable faster calorie burn. It helps you get your head in the game by offering Caffeine (200 mg) equivalent to three shots of Espresso, and a bounty of natural ingredients, including Panax Ginseng Extract, Vitamin K2-7, Vijaysar Extract, Olive Extract & Juniper Leaf Extract","THE METABOLISM IGNITOR: When metabolism slacks off, it paves the way for unwanted weight gain. With MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred, you can unlock the power of your metabolism and ignite your weight management journey. Its Red Thermobolic Tablet offers powerful compounds, including 50 mg Green Coffee Bean Extract, 50 mg Green Tea Leaf Extract and 50 mg Ginger Extract","USE FAT AS FUEL: MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred offers a unique fusion of L-Carnitine (400 mg) and 100% natural Saptrangi root extract (200 mg) to enhance your weight management journey. By preventing fat accumulation and using fat as fuel to generate energy, its weight management blend will propel you towards your desired body goals. Additionally, it offers the forces of 100 mg Kala jeera extract, Vitamin B6 and conjugated Linoleic acid to unleash your potential","INHIBIT CARBS DIGESTION: MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred comes with an innovative Carbohydrate Blocker blend specifically crafted to halt the absorption of any sneaky carbs in the body. Packed with the power of 500 mg White Kidney Bean Extract and 200 mg Jamun Extract, the Grey tablets in each sachet work tirelessly to curb the breakdown and absorption of carbohydrates in the body","A DIURETIC BLEND: An unhealthy weight can often happen due to fluid buildup in the body. MB Biozyme Shred helps combat water retention and reduces body weight faster by including plant extract with diuretic properties. Its Diuretic blend contains 150 mg Bhringraj whole plant extract and 150 mg Dandelion extract, which helps flush out toxins and excess sodium and water",,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Primary Supplement Type,Caffeine & L-Carnitine,Item Form,Tablet,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,healthy life,Age Range Description,Adult,Container Type,Canister,Dosage Form,Tablet,Country of Origin,India,Manufacturer,"BACFO PHARMACEUTICALS (India) Ltd., BACFO PHARMACEUTICALS (India) Ltd., C-46, Phase-2, Noida 201305, UP, India",Item Nype Name,Biozyme Shred,Manufacturer Contact Information,"BACFO PHARMACEUTICALS (India) Ltd., C-46, Phase-2, Noida 201305, UP, India",Model number,NUT8676-01,Packer Contact Information,"BACFO PHARMACEUTICALS (India) Ltd., C-46, Phase-2, Noida 201305, UP, India",Manufacturer Part Number,8906165781483,Best Sellers Rank,"#10,097 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#29 in Fat Burners",ASIN,B0CPSX5H82,Customer Reviews,3.8 3.8 out of 5 stars (286) 3.8 out of 5 stars,Unit Count,90 Count,Item Weight,90 Grams,Item Dimensions,18.3 x 10.7 x 5.6 Centimeters,Number of Items,1,Flavor,Unflavoured,Special Ingredients,Leaf Extract Green Coffee,Material Features,Vegetarian,Colour,Multicolour,Product Dimensions,18.32 x 10.7 x 5.62 cm; 90 g,Date First Available,2023-12-08 00:00:00,Item model number,NUT8676-01,Packer,"BACFO PHARMACEUTICALS (India) Ltd., C-46, Phase-2, Noida 201305, UP, India",Item Dimensions LxWxH,18.3 x 10.7 x 5.6 Centimeters,Net Quantity,90 Count,Generic Name,Biozyme Shred,,,,,,,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Flavour,Unflavoured,Primary Supplement Type,Caffeine & L-Carnitine,Net Quantity,90 Count,Item Form,Tablet,Item Weight,90 Grams,Item dimensions L x W x H,18.3 x 10.7 x 5.6 Centimeters,Special Ingredients,Leaf Extract Green Coffee,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,healthy life,,,,,,,,,,,,,https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B0CPSX5H82,True,"Monday, 20 July",,,,,,,Bright Lifecare Private Limited,ARU24JXUG3S4L,https://www.amazon.in/sp?seller=ARU24JXUG3S4L,,,10097.0,Health & Personal Care,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/ref=pd_zg_ts_hpc,29.0,Fat Burners,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/11364684031/ref=pd_zg_hrsr_hpc,False,,,,Product Description,"Product Description_x000D_
What is MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred? _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred is a revolutionary formula meticulously crafted to help you conquer your weight management goals. This ground-breaking pill has been designed with the ideal components to torch up fat and support your quest for a shredded body. Each sachet of this product contains three tablets. The Red Thermobolic tablet offers two blends namely the Thermogenic blend and Metabolism blend responsible for igniting metabolism, physical performance and facilitating swift calorie burn. This supplement also offers two Grey tablets which consist of a Carbohydrate blocker blend, Diuretic blend and Weight Management blend with ingredients that control appetite, combat fluid retention and prevent fat accumulation. _x000D_
Why do you need MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred? _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred is the ultimate supplement for shredding that offers you the power of L-Carnitine and the best of natural ingredients all in only three tablets per day. This unique formula, supported by scientific research and enriched with our remarkable MB Energy Pro, guarantees faster and more impressive results. Whether you want to curb your appetite, supercharge your metabolism, or torch calories, MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred has got you covered. _x000D_
