blets per day. This unique formula, supported by scientific research and enriched with our remarkable MB Energy Pro, guarantees faster and more impressive results. Whether you want to curb your appetite, supercharge your metabolism, or torch calories, MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred has got you covered.",3p-module-b,,,,,,,,,,,,,,module-9,Benefits of MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred,,,,,,,,,,,,,"Customers report mixed experiences with the weight management supplement, with some finding it superior while others say it's not effective. The product receives positive feedback for its calorie reduction benefits, with customers noting it unlocks metabolic power and helps with weight loss. However, several customers consider it a waste of money.",Calorie reduction,positive,"Customers report positive results with calorie reduction, noting that the supplement helps them lose weight and unlock their metabolism, with one customer specifically mentioning the thermogenic effect that burns more calories.",12.0,10.0,2.0,...targets your fat to convert it into energy and its thermogenic effect helps burning more calories.... This is my review.... ****MOST IMPORTANT****...,thermogenic effect helps burning more calories,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1ZJD42YW5SUSC,...for a couple of days i felt so shredded even it will reduce the fat of your body and to get amazing results you have to do hood workout and cardio...,reduce the fat of your body,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1YXLJ72CEP5D9,"it did help me lost weight, just focus on diet & workout. only issue in grey tablet, that having back to back 2tabs doesnt feel good....",help me lost weight,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1C1P7BB928WI0,"Despite technically it being superior product, carb blocker and all, it didnâ€™t burn any fat Buy at your own caution",carb blocker and all,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2R8ELGO1DF1LX,Effectiveness,mixed,"Customers have mixed opinions about the supplement's effectiveness, with some finding it superior while others report it is not effective.",19.0,10.0,9.0,good results when combined with Proper exercise and diet,good results,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3QC8L1C7YH5VU,Not effective at all. Red table is not even 1% Close to Pre workout feel,Not effective at all,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R11GZY2UASZHF,Best result to product my total 117 kg today my 101 kg loss to 10kg 3 3 month,Best result,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R39NHCLV474DSD,Utter waste product. Been using this past 2weeks. Only tablet count reduced nothing else.,Utter waste product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3HY0OX9NUHCOH,Value for money,negative,Customers find the supplement to be a waste of money.,5.0,1.0,4.0,"Total waste of money, no effect after using the pack with strict diet. Total waste product",Total waste of money,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2DK840NI7DNKK,"Waste of money and time, only smells good",Waste of money and time,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3FCUVDO4NGVDL,Waste of money,Waste of money,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1DS5O46Z81TWG,...Itâ€™s not that much costly also,not that much costly,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/REF582R1OJ1HS,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,100+ bought in past month,Milton,amzn1.account.AG3LM3UOY5SPCSAJFIKKIVM4ACMQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AG3LM3UOY5SPCSAJFIKKIVM4ACMQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Great Shred,"THE THERMOGENIC EDGE: MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred is powered by MB Energy Pro, a unique and potent formula to give your workouts an edge & enable faster calorie burn. It helps you get your head in the game by offering Caffeine (200 mg) equivalent to three shots of Espresso, and a bounty of natural ingredients, including Panax Ginseng Extract, Vitamin K2-7, Vijaysar Extract, Olive Extract & Juniper Leaf ExtractTHE METABOLISM IGNITOR: When metabolism slacks off, it paves the way for unwanted weight gain. With MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred, you can unlock the power of your metabolism and ignite your weight management journey. Its Red Thermobolic Tablet offers powerful compounds, including 50 mg Green Coffee Bean Extract, 50 mg Green Tea Leaf Extract and 50 mg Ginger ExtractUSE FAT AS FUEL: MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred offers a unique fusion of L-Carnitine (400 mg) and 100% natural Saptrangi root extract (200 mg) to enhance your weight management journey. By preventing fat accumulation and using fat as fuel to generate energy, its weight management blend will propel you towards your desired body goals. Additionally, it offers the forces of 100 mg Kala jeera extract, Vitamin B6 and conjugated Linoleic acid to unleash your potentialINHIBIT CARBS DIGESTION: MuscleBlaze Biozyme Shred comes with an innovative Carbohydrate Blocker blend specifically crafted to halt the absorption of any sneaky carbs in the body. Packed with the power of 500 mg White Kidney Bean Extract and 200 mg Jamun Extract, the Grey tablets in each sachet work tirelessly to curb the breakdown and absorption of carbohydrates in the bodyA DIURETIC BLEND: An unhealthy weight can often happen due to fluid buildup in the body. MB Biozyme Shred helps combat water retention and reduces body weight faster by including plant extract with diuretic properties. Its Diuretic blend contains 150 mg Bhringraj whole plant extract and 150 mg Dandelion extract, which helps flush out toxins and excess sodium and water",2024-02-01,1.0,Reviewed in India on 1 February 2024,R2ITVRK0AYUQOQ,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2ITVRK0AYUQOQ/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,7 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/3b3c516e-229f-449f-a851-83b8e0eed8e7._CR0%2C0%2C375%2C375_UX460_SX48_.jpg,,Guru,amzn1.account.AHQ7AY6GMYXZBANU5FPIXEXL6ILQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHQ7AY6GMYXZBANU5FPIXEXL6ILQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,Good so far but plastic sachets need to go!,"Trying it from 2 weeks and like it, I see difference in weight but need to wait for a month or so to be definite.One thing is use of plastics for sachets. A product so nicely thought out and how come sachets as plastic? Please use environment friendly ways to package",2026-03-30,2.0,Reviewed in India on 30 March 2026,R18ZIQC7ETOXLA,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R18ZIQC7ETOXLA/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,,4 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,,,,,,,,,,Kanishk Hivarekar,amzn1.account.AEDLPY2EZSKRF2S7L2H6X7UML2OQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEDLPY2EZSKRF2S7L2H6X7UML2OQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Genuine customer review (not sponsored),"I have bought this product for fat loss and this is my very first day review after taking it's dosageYou will start seeing result on day 1. Take RED pill before workout on empty stomach (only this pill, do not take preworkout, coffee or any beverage that contains caffeine..just take this pill it already have 200mg caffein) do weight training you will notice you are getting focused (specifically on muscles) if you want more pump and strength take citruline or creatine with the pill.... you will feel the energy blast and you will definitely go for cardio...About black pills... take those two black pills half and hour before your lunch.. you will notice ur breathing pattern has little bit changed TIP: keep drinking water atleast 4 ltr a day... you will feel little bit thirsty... might be the effect of the pills.... the red pill targets your fat to convert it into energy and its thermogenic effect helps burning more calories.... This is my  review....  ****MOST IMPORTANT**** STICK TO YOUR DIET...",2024-03-27,3.0,Reviewed in India on 27 March 2024,R1ZJD42YW5SUSC,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1ZJD42YW5SUSC/ref=c