Rich in Fibre _x000D_
Our rolled oats also boast an impressive 10.5 g of dietary fibre to keep your digestive system happy and keep you feeling fuller for longer. _x000D_
100% Wholegrain _x000D_
We've steered clear of adding any sugar, preservatives, or artificial additives, ensuring that what you get is nothing but the goodness of wholegrain oats. Plus, these oats are 100% wholegrain, gluten-free, and low in cholesterol and trans fat, making them a wholesome addition to your daily diet.",Rolled oats instant breakfast cereals for adults kids healthy snacks diet food superfood,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/cc0e95e3-1cb1-45fe-83cb-8267a29d91b0.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",Rolled oats instant breakfast cereals for adults kids healthy snacks diet food superfood,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/4cbb8856-07ee-484f-abdf-a435e6b683ad.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",Rolled oats instant breakfast cereals for adults kids healthy snacks diet food superfood,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/acd8b1cb-e743-4707-ad85-38342fccfe55.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",Rolled oats instant breakfast cereals for adults kids healthy snacks diet food superfood,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/48375242-e382-4605-a6a3-e9b980dc8a6e.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",,,,,module-12,,Rolled oats instant breakfast cereals for adults kids healthy snacks diet food superfood,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/cc0e95e3-1cb1-45fe-83cb-8267a29d91b0.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",module-9,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,50+ bought in past month,Ritobroto Banerjee,amzn1.account.AHVEDNRA5DIB7CPGOZFFRLDT66LQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHVEDNRA5DIB7CPGOZFFRLDT66LQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Good.,Good product and taste. Fills stomach for breakfast.,2025-11-12,1.0,Reviewed in India on 12 November 2025,RMC6B3OIDQ1O6,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RMC6B3OIDQ1O6/re