uality at 1000 , nice ðŸ‘ðŸ» gym bag ðŸ’¼",2026-06-26,7.0,Reviewed in India on 26 June 2026,RB3M1SEM0EGHY,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RB3M1SEM0EGHY/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,,Colour: Camo Grey,Colour,Camo Grey,,,Anand sharma,amzn1.account.AHDBPWIADLV2B7BREPDM6JD6LYKQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHDBPWIADLV2B7BREPDM6JD6LYKQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,1.0,Money waste,"I recently purchased the Muscles Blaze Gym Bag, and unfortunately, it turned out to be a major disappointment. From the moment I received it, the quality and functionality of this bag were underwhelming.Firstly, the material used in the construction of the bag felt cheap and flimsy. It didn't seem durable enough to withstand the wear and tear of regular gym use. Within a few weeks, I noticed fraying threads and signs of the bag falling apart.Moreover, the bag's design lacked practicality. The compartments were poorly laid out, making it challenging to organize my gym essentials effectively. The zippers were constantly getting stuck or breaking, adding to my frustration.Furthermore, the shoulder straps provided minimal comfort and support. They were thinly padded, causing discomfort and strain on my shoulders, especially when carrying heavy items. The lack of proper padding made it difficult to carry the bag for an extended period.Another major drawback was the bag's size. It claimed to have ample storage space, but in reality, it was smaller than expected. It could barely accommodate my gym clothes, shoes, and a water bottle, leaving no room for additional items like a towel or toiletries.To add to the disappointment, the bag lacked any unique features or innovative elements that would justify its price. I expected better quality and functionality for the amount I paid.In conclusion, the Muscles Blaze Gym Bag failed to meet my expectations in terms of quality, design, and functionality. I would not recommend it to anyone looking for 