vings or hunger pangs. A perfectly healthy pocket snack that keeps you away from unhealthy munching to keep you right on the track of fitness.,,,,,,,"20 g PROTEIN: Want a quick and healthy protein snack? MuscleBlaze Protein Bar delivers 20 g protein from soy nugget, soy protein isolate and premium whey protein concentrate to help meet daily protein needs & promote satiety",CRUNCHY COOKIE: Shop for healthy protein snacks with MuscleBlaze 20 g Protein Bar which includes cookie crumbs & experience the ultimate crunch in every bite,DIPPED IN WHITE CHOCOLATE: Are your cravings calling out for something chocolaty but you donâ€™t want to compromise on your health goals? MB Protein Bar in Cookies & Cream flavour is protein goodness dipped in white chocolate,"MUNCH ON THE CRUNCH: Munch on the protein and fibre-packed goodness of this protein bar anytime anywhere hunger strikes. So ditch the junk and relish in the soul-satisfying crunch of rice crisps, rolled oats & flaxseeds in these protein bars","ON-THE-GO PROTEIN BAR: Donâ€™t have time for a proper meal before the office or need an energy boost before errands. MuscleBlaze Protein Bar is a wholesome treat. With a bar in your pocket, you will always have nutrition on the go",,Snack Food Bar Type,Protein,Flavor,Cookies And Cream,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,"Maintaining your daily protein intake, Helps you feel full and stay away from unhealthy munching",Brand Name,MuscleBlaze,Age Range Description,Adult,Allergen Information,Soy,Protein,20 Grams,Package Type Name,Box,Protein Source,Blend,Coin Variety 1,"Chocolate,Cream",Item Form,Bar,Part Number,8906116959947,Manufacturer Contact Information,"Numix Industries Private Limited, Plot No. 6, Himalayan Food Park, Mahuakhera Ganj, Kashipur, Udham Singh Nagar, Uttarakhand- 244713",Item Type Name,Protein Bar,Country of Origin,India,Packer Contact Information,"Numix Industries Private Limited, Plot No. 6, Himalayan Food Park, Mahuakhera Ganj, Kashipur, Udham Singh Nagar, Utt