MuscleBlaze 20 g Protein Bar: Anytime Protein Snack! _x000D_
Want a quick and healthy protein snack? MuscleBlaze Protein Bar delivers 20 g protein from soy nugget, soy protein isolate and premium whey protein concentrate to help meet daily protein needs. So ditch the junk and relish in the soul-satisfying crunch of rice crisps, rolled oats & flaxseeds in cookies & cream flavour.",Protein bar for weight loss muscle gain whey protein concentrate high protein bar snac,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/d05dedc7-5138-451e-b950-b448a8255493.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",Protein bar for weight loss muscle gain whey protein concentrate high protein bar snac,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/d0e9e715-6096-426a-bd56-7248341df620.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",Protein bar for weight loss muscle gain whey protein concentrate high protein bar snac,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/9c200f28-8b77-409f-a84b-835573fd3cfd.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",,,,,,,module-12,,Protein bar for weight loss muscle gain whey protein concentrate high protein bar snac,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/d05dedc7-5138-451e-b950-b448a8255493.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",basic-module-13-text,,"Want a quick and healthy protein snack? MuscleBlaze Protein Bar delivers 20 g protein from soy nugget, soy protein isolate and premium whey protein concentrate to help meet daily protein needs. So ditch the junk and relish in the soul-satisfying crunch of rice crisps, rolled oats & flaxseeds in cookies & cream flavour.",module-12,,,,,,,,,,,,,,module-12,,,,Protein bar for weight loss muscle gain whey protein concentrate high protein bar snac,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/9c200f28-8b77-409f-a84b-835573fd3cfd.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",,,,,,,,,"Customers find the protein bar's taste amazing and appreciate its quality, with one noting it's the best post-workout treat. However, the sugar content receives mixed reviews, with several customers reporting very high sugar levels. Moreover, customers disagree on the value for money.",Taste,positive,"Customers enjoy the taste of these protein bars, with one mentioning they have a little crispy texture.",18.0,13.0,5.0,"Best protein bar Iâ€™ve ever had, itâ€™s very tasty and easy to chew also healthy",very tasty,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RC56XUOC3JZN4,"Loved the taste , the flavour is really amazing keeps me full and gives great energy during my intense workout session",Loved the taste,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R359UHADR2R4X3,"only the outer layer is of cream and cookie rest all is the same, very bad in taste , tough 20gm protein we get in.",very bad in taste,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1ONCFGIGNDKTX,...Superb taste yes it's on sweeter side but so satisfying and protein filled,Superb taste,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2QOAOU46AAVOY,Protein quality,positive,"Customers praise the protein bar's quality, with one mentioning it's the best post-workout treat.",17.0,16.0,1.0,"The Bars are easy to chew and digest,also the taste is very good,best protein bar under this range",best protein bar,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2UVTUTH13AOZ7,"...The ingredients used are amazing, best protein bars at a very reasonable price.",best protein bars,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R23TXOB05CTWU5,...20 grams of protein for 250 calories is an awesome deal! Best post-workout treat....,Best post-workout treat,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1A85XHL8X7PR5,...Superb taste yes it's on sweeter side but so satisfying and protein filled,so satisfying,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2QOAOU46AAVOY,Value for money,mixed,"Customers have mixed opinions about the protein bar's value for money, with some finding it good, while one customer notes that the protein content is insufficient relative to the price.",6.0,4.0,2.0,Value for Money,Value for Money,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2UVTUTH13AOZ7,The protein content is insufficient vis-a-vis price.,protein content is insufficient vis-a-vis price,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2NXTUB5UCO1CA,It has good value for protein content,good value for protein content,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R24Y4XIKTWNZHK,"...The ingredients used are amazing, best protein bars at a very reasonable price.",very reasonable price,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R23TXOB05CTWU5,Sugar content,mixed,"Customers have mixed opinions about the sugar content of the protein bar, with some noting it has very high sugar levels while others appreciate its low calorie and protein content.",5.0,2.0,3.0,Too much sugar.. Won't order again,Too much sugar,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1BZSIL7U1F3VH,"...But because of the low calories 20g protein, I'm buying it again. This time have ordered almond chocolate. Let's see....",low calories 20g protein,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1TAK09FLE1R53,...Also if you check the sugar content it's very high too.,sugar content it's very high,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3IRYCOFMRQ2T6,...I'm forcefully eating it. Very dry. But this is the lowest calorie/gm of protein out there....,lowest calorie/gm of protein,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1TAK09FLE1R53,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,100+ bought in past month,Anji,amzn1.account.AHDHEADR6S5YVG3L5RRIDZSKE7FA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHDHEADR6S5YVG3L5RRIDZSKE7FA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Surprisingly very tasty!!! Will be buying again!Surprisingly very tasty!!! Will be buying again!,"I was nervous about this because of some reviews, because I'm picky about taste and textures. But I was surprised when I tasted it, it's so good! It smells and tastes similar to any cookies and cream flavoured chocolate, or milkybar white chocolate. The texture is similar to dairymilk crackle. I like that it's a little crispy and chewy, not dry and crumbly. Very solid and filling. 20 grams of protein for 250 calories is an awesome deal! Best post-workout treat. Go for it if you want to try fun (and lazy, for students like me) ways to meet your protein goals!",2024-05-28,1.0,Reviewed in India on 28 May 2024Reviewed in India on 28 May 2024,R1A85XHL8X7PR5,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1A85XHL8X7PR5/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,0.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Cookies And Cream, Size: 6 count, Flavour Name: Cookies And Cream, Size: 6 count",tad,amzn1.account.AHBD4J2SBQEFW76XRMS3A4ENADIA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHBD4J2SBQEFW76XRMS3A4ENADIA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Awesome product,"I was scared of protien bar etc. I thought this will make me gain wieght but now i changed my mind.Cautious-: if you eat  too much in one day it will make you gain wieght ... in one day 1 or 2 bars if you don't wanna gain wieght...3,4 bars if you wanna gain wieght and if your are professional gym bro.This protien bar helps me alot in mid and post workout when I'm hunger craving....Since I workout in morning with empty stomach high intensity workout for 2,4 hrs sometimes I get hungry in mid workout I used to eat banana but it doesn't make me feel full instantly but these thing instantly make you feel full and you can keep grinding but i usually take this as a post workout with muscle blaze whey protien.",2024-08-21,2.0,Reviewed in India on 21 August 2024,RJPKHCLQOHAM9,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RJPKHCLQOHAM9/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,,2 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/b1bffff2-4217-467a-99ce-20f1290141db._CR0%2C0%2C357%2C357_UX460_SX48_.jpg,"Flavour Name: Cookies And Cream, Size: 6 count",Flavour Name,Cookies And Cream,Size,6 count,,,,,Gaurav,amzn1.account.AHO2OFZJTBPMAQ6GXAXNTPCZG2NQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHO2OFZJTBPMAQ6GXAXNTPCZG2NQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,Protein Content,It has good value for protein content,2025-02-18,3.0,Reviewed in India on 18 February 2025,R24Y4XIKTWNZHK,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R24Y4XIKTWNZHK/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Cookies And Cream, Size: 6 count",hemant,amzn1.account.AF3ZSQFN3G4BPPS73UV43WULL6EQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AF3ZSQFN3G4BPPS73UV43WULL6EQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,1.0,Tastes like chemical,Tastes like chemicalThrown in dustbinWaste of money,2026-04-30,4.0,Reviewed in India on 30 April 2026,R1IXIJWSKKEKZR,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1IXIJWSKKEKZR/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Cookies And Cream, Size: 6 count",Flavour Name,Cookies And Cream,Size,6 count,Vinyas,amzn1.account.AHFNGLAFWZHIWSHQ637CDUIU7NXA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHFNGLAFWZHIWSHQ637CDUIU7NXA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,3.0,Horrible taste.,"Can't eat entire bar. Due to the low calories, the taste takes a major hit. But because of the low calories 20g protein, I'm buying it again. This time have ordered almond chocolate. Let's see. But this cookie flavour is very bad. I'm forcefully eating it. Very dry. But this is the lowest calorie/gm of protein out there. Rest are all higher 350+ calories/20g which is a lot high, compared to MB's 250kcal/20g protein.",2023-09-12,5.0,Reviewed in India on 12 September 2023,R1TAK09FLE1R53,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1TAK09FLE1R53/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,One person found this helpful,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/4c6308c7-439a-4547-b793-1be3fc90a8e0._CR83%2C0%2C333%2C333_SX460_SX48_.jpg,"Flavour Name: Cookies An