 peanut butter nutritious and suitable for any diet, with one customer noting it's a good option for people with dietary restrictions and another mentioning it's beneficial for diabetics.",24.0,23.0,1.0,"Taste was too good..... Its healthy, tasty. Muscleblaze is one of the most trustable brand ever.",healthy,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1X1BFZVQ173GL,Tasty and healthy product,healthy product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RS6ANG5QFK0IZ,"...it's easy to spread, has a yummy taste, is protein-rich, and is good for health....",good for health,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2GEV7602OSK7R,...this muscleblaze peanut butter!âš¡It's a great source of protein and healthy fats....,healthy fats,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1MFMHZC01OE5D,Value for money,positive,Customers find the peanut butter to be worth the price.,19.0,16.0,3.0,...Easy to spread and taste is also good. This is value for money.,value for money,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3ONNC1PY82Q4W,Best budget peanut butter for high protein intake!! Awesome taste and easy to digest,Best budget peanut butter,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2EPJHGG5NYPQC,Worth it.,Worth it,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3RDMF56O1K97Y,"It's my fav since I tried. Best consistency, best taste at best price .",best price,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2WI4GB0TB3O7F,Protein content,positive,"Customers appreciate the high protein content of this peanut butter, noting it contains 10 percent peanuts and is nutrient-dense.",17.0,12.0,5.0,"...It's a great source of protein, making it perfect as a pre-workout snack, post-workout meal, or simply spread on whole wheat bread or added to oats...",great source of protein,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/REM6UAL77TQJJ,It has 90 percent coco and 10 percent peanuts. It should be called coco peanut and not peanut coco..,10 percent peanuts,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R27JN8MVX02HEQ,"Worst taste, too much sugar, wast of money , chocolate flavour have not good test.",too much sugar,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RWZ4DWKONL390,HIGH PROTEIN AND HIGH CALORIE,HIGH PROTEIN,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3BR4VKDI4VHL6,700+ bought in past month,Akshay reddy,amzn1.account.AGGPJ7RVE7XTCTKETYFETT2OM3NA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGGPJ7RVE7XTCTKETYFETT2OM3NA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,"Delicious, Crunchy, and Packed with Protein","I've been using MuscleBlaze Fit Chocolate Peanut Butter (Crunchy, 750 g) for a while, and it's become one of my favorite healthy snacks. The combination of rich chocolate flavor and crunchy peanut pieces makes it delicious without being overly sweet. It's a great source of protein, making it perfect as a pre-workout snack, post-workout meal, or simply spread on whole wheat bread or added to oats and smoothies. The texture is satisfying, the ingredients are good, and it keeps me feeling full for longer. If you're looking for a tasty, high-protein peanut butter that supports your fitness goals, this is definitely worth trying.",2026-07-06,1.0,Reviewed in India on 6 July 2026,REM6UAL77TQJJ,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/REM6UAL77TQJJ/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Crunchy, Size: 750 g (Pack of 1)",Ritobroto Banerjee,amzn1.account.AHVEDNRA5DIB7CPGOZFFRLDT66LQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHVEDNRA5DIB7CPGOZFFRLDT66LQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,Good.,Good product. 1 tablespoon fills stomach. Chocolate tastes good. But sugar content is too much.,2025-11-12,2.0,Reviewed in India on 12 November 2025,R9AA12XD1TF0,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R9AA12XD1TF0/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,,,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/202ec7b1-787f-40b