"MuscleBlaze Fit High Protein Oats (Fruit & Super Seeds, 1kg) | 23g Protein | Breakfast Cereals for Weight Management",https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0CMQWC6N4,B0CMQWC6N4,B0CMQWC6N4,599.0,â‚¹,True,In stock  In stock,699.0,â‚¹,MuscleBlaze,,,4.2,0.63,0.15,0.1,0.03,0.09,169.0,,"Grocery & Gourmet Foods > Rice, Flour & Pulses > Whole Grains > Oats",0,Visit the MuscleBlaze Store,https://www.amazon.in/stores/MuscleBlaze/page/9A784926-3F81-400C-8D18-DDF7BBE45F17?lp_asin=B0CMQWC6N4&ref_=ast_bln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandlogo_sto,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gP73lM0dL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gP73lM0dL._SX38_SY50_CR,0,0,38.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c0FNnn4uL._SX38_SY50_CR,0,0,38.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hex90JCtL._SX38_SY50_CR,0,0,38.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cAW-TsbPL._SX38_SY50_CR,0,0,38.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511GalWLUzL._SX38_SY50_CR,0,0,38.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MOZcDwyOL._SX38_SY50_CR,0,0,38.jpg",https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M7H1-XDWL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OZFiUfuGL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BFPqNKesL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qdfl76PvL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810ZkIwHDtL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WDsGV3ZnL._SL1500_.jpg,Important information,Ingredients:,"Instant Oats (49.4%), Texturized Soy Protein (25.5%), Fruit & Super Seeds (13.5%), Raw Sugar, Beetroot Powder",,Directions:,"Take one serving Add 50 grams of MB Oats to 2 Cups of Milk or water. Blend into a smoothie, stir in with warm milk, toss in some dry fruits, top it off with fresh berries or simply prepare a delicious tasty delight.",,Legal Disclaimer:,"Actual product packaging and materials may contain more and different information than what is shown on our app or website. We recommend that you do not rely solely on the information presented here and that you always read labels, warnings, and directions before using or consuming a product.",,,,"SUPERIOR NUTRITION: Up your breakfast game with a brekkie that redefines the meaning of nourishment. MuscleBlaze High Protein Oats now also come with actual fruits and super seeds, which make this meal even more wholesome. Meaning more fuel to fire up your fit life","PROTEIN POWER: MB High Protein Oats Fruits and Super Seeds offers a generous 23 g protein and a lip-smacking strawberry flavour to indulge your taste buds. Ditch the boring breakfast, and switch to this absolute treat, a bowlful will have you going gaga","FRUITS AND SEEDS: Topping it off with fibre, vitamins, minerals, and antioxidant benefits, MuscleBlaze High Protein Oats 1kg have dehydrated apples and papaya as ingredients. As for super seeds, we have flax seeds, pumpkin seeds, and raisins. Not only does this meal fuel your body, but it also fulfils the nutritional requirements for an overall healthy body","NO TRANS-FAT & ARTIFICIAL COLOUR: With no trans-fat & artificial colour as well as low cholesterol & added sugar, MuscleBlaze High Protein Oats is your first class ticket to health town!","PROTEIN ON-THE-GO: Whether it's a sunrise start, a midday refuel, or a late-night snack attack, our MB High Protein Oats is the perfect energy boost to be your go-to sidekick. Nutritious & ready to rock whenever those hunger pangs hit.",,Brand Name,MuscleBlaze,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Flavor,Fruit & Super Seeds,Age Range Description,Adult,Item Form,Flaked,Specialty,High Protein,Allergen Information,Oat,Manufacturer,"H-550,551,716, Phase â€“ 1, Industrial Area, Bhiwadi, Alwar, Rajasthan-301019, VLS Food Pvt. Ltd.",Model Number,8906165781681,Part Number,8906165781681,Packer Contact Information,"VLS Food Pvt. Ltd., H-550, 551, 716, Phase-1 industrial Area, Bhiwadi (Rajasthan)-301019 India",Manufacturer Contact Information,"H-550,551,716, Phase â€“ 1, Industrial Area, Bhiwadi, Alwar, Rajasthan-301019",Country o