Bid those peek-a-boo hunger pangs a forever farewell with the classic and OG MuscleBlaze High Protein Unflavoured Oats packed with the goodness of 23 g protein per 100 g. _x000D_
Rich in Fibre _x000D_
Full of fibre and with no added flavour or sugars, MuscleBlaze High Protein is the ultimate snack break that lets you enjoy a wholesome meal just the way you like without the weight of regret. _x000D_
No Preservatives _x000D_
This high protein oats contains no preservatives, no artificial colour and no unwanted ingredients. _x000D_
Superior Nutrition _x000D_
