end that targets your brain, muscles, bones, and cellular energy systems simultaneously.","Brain Power & Cognitive Support (Magnesium L-Threonate): The only form of magnesium scientifically proven to easily cross the blood-brain barrier. It enhances synaptic plasticity, supporting memory, focus, and overall cognitive longevity.","Deep Sleep & Stress Relief (Magnesium Bisglycinate): Chelated with the calming amino acid glycine, this ultra-absorbable form relaxes the nervous system, eases evening anxiety, and promotes undisturbed sleep without a laxative effect.","Daytime Energy & Muscle Recovery (Magnesium Malate): Bound to malic acidâ€”a key player in your cellular energy cycle (ATP production)â€”it helps combat daytime fatigue while soothing muscle soreness, cramps, and spasms.","Trace Mineral-Rich Bioavailability (Aquamin Mg): Sourced from clean, sustainable Icelandic marine algae, Aquamin provides a highly bioactive magnesium base paired with 72 naturally occurring trace minerals to maximize absorption and support bone density.",,Item Form,Tablet,Primary Supplement Type,Elemental Magnesium,Flavor,Unflavoured,Product Benefits,"Stress Balance, Better Muscle Function, Quality Sleep, Enhanced Neuromuscular Connection",Unit Count,90 Count,Number of Items,1,Item Weight,90 Grams,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Age Range Description,Adult,Manufacturer,BACFO Pharmaceuticals (India) Limited,Manufacturer Part Number,8906198980198,Model number,NUT9739-02,Country of Origin,India,Packer Contact Information,"BACFO Pharmaceuticals (India) Limited, C-46, Phase 2, Gautam Buddha Nagar, Noida, Uttar Pradesh, 201305",Item Nype Name,Magnesium Matrix,Best Sellers Rank,"#3,507 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#35 in Magnesium",ASIN,B0FLDTPTVK,Customer Reviews,4.4 4.4 out of 5 stars (231) 4.4 out of 5 stars,Product Dimensions,18.32 x 10.7 x 5.62 cm; 90 g,Date First Available,2025-08-06 00:00:00,Item model number,NUT9739-02,Packer,"BACFO Pharmaceuticals (India) Limited, 