h & recovery, muscle gains, and sleep quality","ENCOURAGES MUSCLE RECOVERY- With only magnesium aspartate as the magnesium source, MB ZMA has a better bioavailability encouraging better muscle recovery while zinc supports muscle gains",BOOSTS IMMUNITY- ZMA supplements provide 100% RDA of zinc to help strengthen the immune system and improve overall health. It also functions as a potent antioxidant,"BETTER SLEEP QUALITY- Sleeping well is critical for proper recovery. These ZMA tablets enhance sleep quality by maintaining a healthy level of GABA, a neurotransmitter that boosts sleep","COST-EFFECTIVE & EASY TO CONSUME- Two tablets provide 100% RDA of zinc, magnesium aspartate, & vitamin B6 for better functioning of the body as compared to other supplements making them cost-effective","NOTE FROM AMAZON: This product is protected by Transparency, which verifies a unitâ€™s authenticity and enables you to view rich information about the product you purchased. When you receive your product, please look for the Transparency logo and code, which is printed on the productâ€™s cover. You can scan it to verify its authenticity with the Transparency app or Amazon shopping app. To download the Transparency app or Amazon shopping app, get it on the App Store or Google Play.",Brand,MuscleBlaze,Primary Supplement Type,"Zinc, Magnesium Aspartate and Vitamin B6",Item Form,Tablet,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,"Encourages Muscle Recovery , Boosts Immunity & Better Sleep Quality",Age Range Description,Adult,Container Type,Bottle,Dosage Form,Tablet,Country of Origin,India,Manufacturer,"BACFO PHARMACEUTICALS (India) Ltd., BACFO PHARMACEUTICALS (India) Ltd., C-46, Phase-2, Noida 201305, UP, India",Item Nype Name,ZMA,Manufacturer Contact Information,"BACFO PHARMACEUTICALS (India) Ltd., C-46, Phase-2, Noida 201305, UP, India",Model number,NUT7044-01,Packer Contact Information,"BACFO PHARMACEUTICALS (India) Ltd., C-46, Phase-2, Noida 201305, UP, India",Manufacturer Part Number,8906116951934,Best Sellers Rank,"#5,257 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#55 in Magnesium",ASIN,B08P3HRDKB,Customer Reviews,4.3 4.3 out of 5 stars (909) 4.3 out of 5 stars,Unit Count,60 Count,Item Weight,60 Grams,Item Dimensions,18.3 x 11 x 5.6 Centimeters,Number of Items,1,Total Servings Per Container,60,Flavor,Unflavoured,Special Ingredients,Dibasic Magnesium Aspartate,Material Features,Vegetarian,Allergen Information,Milk,Colour,Multicolour,Product Dimensions,18.32 x 11 x 5.62 cm; 60 g,Date First Available,2020-11-24 00:00:00,Item model number,NUT7044-01,Packer,"BACFO PHARMACEUTICALS (India) Ltd., C-46, Phase-2, Noida 201305, UP, India",Item Dimensions LxWxH,18.3 x 11 x 5.6 Centimeters,Net Quantity,60 Count,Generic Name,ZMA,,,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Flavour,Unflavoured,Primary Supplement Type,"Zinc, Magnesium Aspartate and Vitamin B6",Net Quantity,60 Count,Item Form,Tablet,Item Weight,60 Grams,Item dimensions L x W x H,18.3 x 11 x 5.6 Centimeters,Special Ingredients,Dibasic Magnesium Aspartate,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,"Encourages Muscle Recovery , Boosts Immunity & Better Sleep Quality",,,,,,,,,,,,,https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B08P3HRDKB,True,"Tuesday, 21 July",Today 8 pm - 11 pm,,,,,,Bright Lifecare Private Limited,ARU24JXUG3S4L,https://www.amazon.in/sp?seller=ARU24JXUG3S4L,,,5257.0,Health & Personal Care,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/ref=pd_zg_ts_hpc,55.0,Magnesium,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/11364790031/ref=pd_zg_hrsr_hpc,False,,,,Product Description,"Product Description_x000D_
MuscleBlaze ZMA _x000D_
MB ZMA is packed with zinc, magnesium, and vitamin B6. Zinc helps in strengthening immunity, producing new cells, and improving metabolism. Magnesium Aspartate has been used as the key source of magnesium to offer a higher bioavailability. Magnesium helps in enhancing sleep quality, boosting muscle, and nerve function. Vitamin B6 helps your body to store and utilize energy from the protein and carbohydrates that you consume. _x000D_
This product helps in fulfilling nutritional deficiencies, supporting muscle recovery, improving sleep quality, and enhancing strength and size. It also helps in enhancing immunity. It offers 100% RDA of zinc, magnesium, and vitamin B6 in the dosage of just 2 tablets so that you can avail of maximum benefits. _x000D_
Product Features _x000D_
100% RDA of Zinc, Magnesium & Vitamin B6 _x000D_
MuscleBlaze ZMA is a potent formulation which offers 100% RDA of Zinc, Magnesium, and Vitamin B6. RDA or Recommended Dietary Allowance manifests the required intake quantity that is considered to be adequate to meet the nutrient needs in the body. _x000D_
Magnesium Aspartate _x000D_
Magnesium Aspartate has been used as the only source of magnesium in this potent formula to get a higher bioavailability. Magnesium Aspartate is a superior source of magnesium compared to other Magnesium salts like oxide & citrate. _x000D_
Easy to Consume _x000D_
MB ZMA comes with a dose recommendation of 2 tablets only which is relatively lesser than most products available. This makes it a hassle-free way to consume the supplement. All that you need to do is take out 2 tablets from the pack and consume them with water. _x000D_
Product Benefits _x000D_
Muscle Strength & Recovery _x000D_
The supplement is packed with zinc that helps in enhancing protein synthesis and amplifying muscle strength and size. When combined with magnesium the effectiveness is enhanced. This supplement is totally safe to consume and enhances muscle mass, strength, and power. _x000D_
Sleep Quality _x000D_
Those who deal with the deficiency of magnesium are often sleep deprived or experience restless sleep or light sleep. MB ZMA helps in boosting sleep quality by maintaining a healthy level of GABA, a neurotransmitter that helps in enhancing sleep and boost recovery. It helps in relaxing the nervous system and body muscles. _x000D_
Immunity _x000D_
The product contains zinc that helps in boosting immunity. It strengthens your immune system and work as an antioxidant. It helps in activating an enzyme that works towards improving your overall health and immunity. Zinc is also helpful in promoting post-workout recovery.","zinc, magnesium, vitamin B6 vitamin C immunity immunity booster","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/0d717e78-a5b1-4c88-acc6-64dfd2f94c8a.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png",zinc magnesium Vitamin b6,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/14accb3a-deab-4755-8321-685283cca163.__CR0,0,1201,1201_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",magnesium B6 vitamin C zinc,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/0daae69c-b5fd-4614-aa5d-ae967ee29dc8.__CR0,0,1200,1200_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",easy to consume,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/dd7f7662-d945-4af9-a387-4af3f4bc7013.__CR0,0,1201,1201_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",muscle strength muscle recovery,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/f3d6fbd4-57d0-4876-aafd-ecad507243e7.__CR0,0,1201,1201_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",sleep quality,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/e58e55fb-18b4-4666-adae-82a92bdfe25f.__CR0,0,1201,1201_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",module-12,,"zinc, magnesium, vitamin B6 vitamin C immunity immunity booster","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/0d717e78-a5b1-4c88-acc6-64dfd2f94c8a.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png",launchpad-brand-description-left,,"MuscleBlaze ZMA _x000D_
