This product helps in fulfilling nutritional deficiencies, supporting muscle recovery, improving sleep quality, and enhancing strength and size. It also helps in enhancing immunity. It offers 100% RDA of zinc, magnesium, and vitamin B6 in the dosage of just 2 tablets so that you can avail of maximum benefits.",module-9,Product Features,"100% RDA of Zinc, Magnesium & Vitamin B6","MuscleBlaze ZMA is a potent formulation which offers 100% RDA of Zinc, Magnesium, and Vitamin B6. RDA or Recommended Dietary Allowance manifests the required intake quantity that is considered to be adequate to meet the nutrient needs in the body.",zinc magnesium Vitamin b6,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/14accb3a-deab-4755-8321-685283cca163.__CR0,0,1201,1201_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",Magnesium Aspartate,Magnesium Aspartate has been used as the only source of magnesium in this potent formula to get a higher bioavailability. Magnesium Aspartate is a superior source of magnesium compared to other Magnesium salts like oxide & citrate.,magnesium B6 vitamin C zinc,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/0daae69c-b5fd-4614-aa5d-ae967ee29dc8.__CR0,0,1200,1200_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",Easy to Consume,MB ZMA comes with a dose recommendation of 2 tablets only which is relatively lesser than most products available. This makes it a hassle-free way to consume the supplement. All that you need to do is take out 2 tablets from the pack and consume them with water.,easy to consume,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/dd7f7662-d945-4af9-a387-4af3f4bc7013.__CR0,0,1201,1201_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",module-9,Product Benefits,,,,,,,,,,,,,"Customers find the supplement to be of good quality and effective for recovery and deep sleep. One customer reports reduced muscle soreness after workouts. The value for money receives mixed feedback, with some customers saying it's worth the cost while others disagree.",Quality,positive,Customers find this supplement to be of good quality.,22