ed. The tablets are easy to take, and the recommended dosage is convenient. While it's not a magic supplement, it complements a balanced diet and regular exercise effectively. Overall, it's a good value-for-money product for anyone looking to support recovery, sleep, and overall fitness. I would definitely recommend it",2026-07-07,2.0,Reviewed in India on 7 July 2026,R385OQAS8EAWHF,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R385OQAS8EAWHF/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,,One person found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,,,,,,,,,,K D MATHISUTHAN,amzn1.account.AH3ATEAAOVJGGTGTICYFVPXHBWVQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AH3ATEAAOVJGGTGTICYFVPXHBWVQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Amazon service,Buy good quality products,2026-02-10,3.0,Reviewed in India on 10 February 2026,R3JRLYNUZUBJYU,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3JRLYNUZUBJYU/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,,,vijay kumar,amzn1.account.AG4U36US6RXUJ2WJWRW27OC3IH2Q,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AG4U36US6RXUJ2WJWRW27OC3IH2Q?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,.,best from others,2026-05-08,4.0,Reviewed in India on 8 May 2026,RH9KFOVB3JSLE,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RH9KFOVB3JSLE/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,,,,,,,Amaan Rangrez,amzn1.account.AG33C27FB543GYGAIMXFIBXK374Q,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AG33C27FB543GYGAIMXFIBXK374Q?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Effective For Recovery And Deep sleepEffective For Recovery And Deep sleep,Great For Athletes,2026-01-15,5.0,Reviewed in India on 15 January 2026Reviewed in India on 15 January 2026,ROJARVQDQ9ZE9,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/ROJARVQDQ9ZE9/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,0.0,0.0,,,,,,,Sagar U,amzn1.account.AFQOUWRIN3OO2IY27RJINCQQAB2A,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFQOUWRIN3OO2IY27RJINCQQAB2A?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,3.0,No effect on Deep Sleep,"Well, I used many zma and magnesium. This one i feel is less effective. I dont get such deep sleep as I get from On Zma or other magnesium supplements in market. It may be working on my body but as far as sleep is concerned I didnt feel any change as I felt while consuming other products",2026-04-21,6.0,Reviewed in India on 21 April 2026,R2OIVDWIRNH078,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2OIVDWIRNH078/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,One person found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,,Placeholder,amzn1.account.AH3THR7DPN4V5HF5MX7ELTTKN3SQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AH3THR7DPN4V5HF5MX7ELTTKN3SQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,Multivitamins and ZMA can overlap,"Multivitamins and ZMA can overlap and compete with each other.If you take both at the same time, they may compete for absorption and can cause bloating or stomach discomfort.I experienced this myself once. After checking the ingredient list, I found that the multivitamin already contains good-quality forms of zinc, magnesium, and vitamin B6, which are the key components of ZMA.So, if you are already using a good multivitamin (like MB), itâ€™s better not to take ZMA separately, as it may be unnecessary and harsh on the stomach.âš ï¸ I am not a doctorâ€”this is just my personal experience. Try both carefully and decide what works best for your body",2025-12-19,7.0,Reviewed in India on 19 December 2025,RNU1DRTCLACZE,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RNU1DRTCLACZE/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,7 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/ef310357-59e2-4d0f-bc88-f8a471089722._CR0%2C0%2C477%2C477_SX460_SX48_.jpg,,,,,,ramsey,amzn1.account.AHMCKIJWRBCMFV3V5FQ4NNRQQZ2Q,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHMCKIJWRBCMFV3V5FQ4NNRQQZ2Q?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Good product,I find this product very helpful and I do believe it help me with sleep.,2025-08-12,8.0,Reviewed in India on 12 August 2025,R2LVKD76PPZR22,htt