1kg + cyclone blender shaker bottle â€” perfect combo for post-workout protein shakes and daily supplement mixing.,"World's Only Protein with U.S. Patented Enzymes: Featuring the innovative Enhanced Absorption Formula (EAF), it delivers 50% higher protein absorption, optimizing muscle recovery and eliminating protein digestion challenges.","Smooth, Lump-Free Shake Every Time â€” Convenient cyclone blender shaker with built-in mixer ensures smooth protein mixes, no clumps, and a leak-proof design for workout bags â€” great for gym, travel, or daily hydration.","India's 1st clinically proven whey protein: Biozyme Performance whey is proven for superior absorption and enhanced muscle-building efficacy. The results of the clinical study, registered with the ICMR's Clinical Trials Registry - India, highlight its effectiveness in reducing stomach discomfort commonly associated with high-protein digestion.","BPA-Free & Durable Plastic â€” Made from high-quality BPA-free plastic, this gym shaker bottle is not only safe but also highly durable, ensuring that it can handle even the most intense workouts","Globally Recognized Award-Winning Protein: Winner of the Nutra Ingredients Award 2021 for Sports Nutrition, recognized for its research, innovation, and quality. It also features the Asia Star Award-winning ""Scoop-on-Top"" packaging with a patent-granted design for convenience and hygiene.",Brand,MuscleBlaze,Best Sellers Rank,"#12,726 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#169 in Whey Proteins",ASIN,B0GNSPBWZP,Date First Available,2023-06-16 00:00:00,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B0GNSPBWZP,True,"Wednesday, 22 July",,,,,,,Bright Lifecare Private Limited,ARU24JXUG3S4L,https://www.amazon.in/sp?seller=ARU24JXUG3S4L,,,12726.0,Health & Personal Care,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/ref=pd_zg_ts_hpc,169.0,Whey Proteins,https://www.amazon.in/gp