ref=pd_zg_hrsr_grocery,False,,,,Product Description,"Product Description_x000D_
MuscleBlaze Protein Peanut Butter to Fulfil Your Fitness Goals! _x000D_
Are you looking for irresistible peanut butter that is tasty as well as nutritious? Check out MuscleBlaze Protein Peanut Butter in creamy dark chocolate flavour that is a treat for all chocolate lovers and fitness enthusiasts. This rich peanut butter creamy offers you 30 g protein to fulfil your everyday protein requirements. You get protein from a protein blend made of pea protein & premium quality whey protein concentrate. Forget all the unhealthy spreads, get your jarful of tasty nutrition and dig in! _x000D_
Why Should You Buy MB Protein Peanut Butter? _x000D_
Peanut Butter with Added Whey Protein _x000D_
Whey protein concentrate is one of the sources of protein in this nutritious peanut butter. This protein peanut butter provides 30 g protein per 100 g serving from a protein blend made of pea protein & premium quality whey protein concentrate. _x000D_
Premium Quality Peanuts _x000D_
This high protein peanut butter is made with high-quality peanuts roasted at the right temperature to leave a tempting aroma and rich taste. Peanuts are a rich source of nutrition providing Vitamin E, protein, and essential minerals. _x000D_
High Source of Fibre _x000D_
Every 100 g of this healthy peanut butter provides 3.02 g of dietary fibre that helps in weight management and enhances the overall digestive health of the body. _x000D_
Delicious Flavours _x000D_
Satisfy your hunger pangs with spoonfuls of delicious Muscleblaze High Protein Peanut Butter in creamy dark chocolate flavour. Enjoy the delectable smooth spread with the taste of exotic dark chocolate that instantly melts in your mouth. _x000D_
Benefits of Peanut Butter _x000D_
Energy Booster _x000D_
MB Peanut Butter provides 610.14 kcal energy per 100 g of high protein peanut butter. Enjoy spoonfuls of this healthy snacking for all ages to kickstart your day or keep hunger pangs away whenever needed. _x000D_
Weight Management _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Protein Peanut Butter helps in weight management. As a rich source of protein and fibre, it keeps you satiated for long and improves overall digestive health. _x000D_
Muscle Repairing _x000D_
Peanut butter contains protein which is required for a lean & athletic body and for repairing muscles. Therefore, this high protein peanut butter is good for fitness enthusiasts and athletes to reach their fitness goals. _x000D_
