0 g protein to fulfil your everyday protein requirements. You get protein from a protein blend made of pea protein & premium quality whey protein concentrate. Forget all the unhealthy spreads, get your jarful of tasty nutrition and dig in!",module-12,,,,,,,,,,,,,,module-12,,,,High protein peanut butter dark chocolate creamy healthy bread sandwich spread fibre rich whey,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/5a81a142-d1f9-4434-95c1-7a36f5f72bc0.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",module-4,Why Should You Buy MB Protein Peanut Butter?,,,,,,,"Customers love this peanut butter's dark chocolate flavor and creamy texture, praising its high protein content with added whey protein. They find it easy to spread on bread and consider it a healthy snack that helps with muscle building. Customers appreciate its value, noting it's high protein at a low price, and one customer mentions it's ideal as a pre-workout snack.",Taste,positive,"Customers enjoy the taste of this peanut butter, particularly its dark chocolate flavor, with one customer noting it's not too sweet.",792.0,755.0,37.0,Flavour is excellent better than pintola or veeba ... tasty n healthy .. n one more thing no need to worry about authenticity bcz peanut butters do...,tasty,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R31KANOBHH5VON,...It is really good.packag is wonderful. It has a good taste. And it has high protein in it so good for body builder. Value for money.,good taste,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R11YNSEJ6PJU73,"...but lemme tell you, it has got a great taste.. something like combination of hershey's and normal creamy peanut butter....",great taste,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R22VT2OQ8GFA5X,"It is very tasty. And easy to use wherever u want to use like Bread, or protein shake becz of its thickness.",very tasty,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R4451PD6GQQ6U,Quality,positive,"Customers find this peanut bu