er  butter to have it on my meals I wanted perfect amount and protein and taste  and i must say it is perfect in taste please try this chocolate flavour and you will be in love with this. Happy' to buy this perfect tadte and it is perfect in ingredients and it is not also very thick you can easily spread it on bread and enjoy your meal.â¤ï¸,2021-03-26,5.0,Reviewed in India on 26 March 2021Reviewed in India on 26 March 2021,R2NGK8WC92A5LQ,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2NGK8WC92A5LQ/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,66 people found this helpful,0.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/78990429-93d1-4995-b888-1404fe7295d2._CR0%2C0%2C2160%2C2160_SX460_SX48_.jpg,"Flavour Name: Dark Chocolate- Creamy, Size: 750 g (Pack of 1), Flavour Name: Dark Chocolate- Creamy, Size: 750 g (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Dark Chocolate- Creamy,Size,750 g (Pack of 1),Edwin.S.Joseph,amzn1.account.AG6XL244RA3F2LEBTPU4IXAEI4UQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AG6XL244RA3F2LEBTPU4IXAEI4UQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,3.0,Bad packaging,The product is good and the taste is excellent but when I got the product it was leaking all over the thermocol box it was in and it was a very big and bad messVery hard to cleanOther than that everything is goodBut seriously the packing needs to be improvedIt could have leaked the whole content of the plastic jar it came in .,2024-05-04,6.0,Reviewed in India on 4 May 2024,R2LLIE8CY9VNW0,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2LLIE8CY9VNW0/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,One person found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Dark Chocolate- Creamy, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Sameer Patil,amzn1.account.AH35GUVWMANW3Y4RMINMGSPZCCVA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AH35GUVWMANW3Y4RMINMGSPZCCVA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,Detailed Review !,"I first bought the original flavor crunchy version of this brand and it's taste's was so pathetic to the point that I managed to eat only 2 spoons.Then gathered the courage to buy this Dark chocolate flavor with a hope that it would be just bearable that I can consume it, and alas I was right !After quick backstory, I have been using this product since last 1 week of daily consumption and stating my observations below,Pro:1. Good price, budget friendly.2. Tastes normal, not too sweet, despite the fact that its dark chocolate.3. Has medium consistency. Spreads evenly on bread, chapati. But also retains medium thick spread.4. Decent Protein content (almost 8.5g per 32g serving)5. Comparatively low on sugar.6. Quantity provided is also decent. With 2 spoons of daily consumption, it should lasts least 2-2.5 weeks.Cons: (None if you are beginner or intermediate strength trainer)1. Not apt for someone who's in cutting phase.2. Not apt for someone who's on extreme weight loss program.I am also going to try other brand in case protein content is higher and shall update if any revision needed.Hope this review helps you make sound decision :D",2022-08-12,7.0,Reviewed in India on 12 August 2022,R3HJXUUA9H1WF0,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3HJXUUA9H1WF0/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,29 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/6754801a-5633-45f2-baf0-790d719b8996._CR9%2C0%2C482%2C482_SX460_SX48_.jpg,"Flavour Name: Dark Chocolate- Creamy, Size: 340 g (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Dark Chocolate- Creamy,Size,340 g (Pack of 1),Abisheha,amzn1.account.AEFWDBHARMXRQWZENAJBHJNHM5UQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEFWDBHARMXRQWZENAJBHJNHM5UQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Quantity is not at all 2kg,But quantity is very low it's not fully 1kg,2026-06-28,8.0,Reviewed in India on 28 June 2026,R1KVMW5AY00ETJ,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1KVMW5AY00ETJ/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Dark Chocolate- Creamy, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Dark Choc