 and better workout performance with Biozyme whey proteinâ€™s superior absorption and BCAAs â€” ideal for gym enthusiasts and athletes.","Smooth, Lump-Free Shake Every Time â€” Convenient cyclone blender shaker with built-in mixer ensures smooth protein mixes, no clumps, and a leak-proof design for workout bags â€” great for gym, travel, or daily hydration.",Delicious & Versatile Flavor â€” Available in Magical Mango for an enjoyable protein intake experience.,"BPA-Free & Durable Plastic â€” Made from high-quality BPA-free plastic, this gym shaker bottle is not only safe but also highly durable, ensuring that it can handle even the most intense workouts",,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Best Sellers Rank,"#19,323 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#245 in Whey Proteins",ASIN,B0GQT8K2H4,Date First Available,2024-03-27 00:00:00,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B0GQT8K2H4,True,"Tomorrow, 18 July",,,,,,,Bright Lifecare Private Limited,ARU24JXUG3S4L,https://www.amazon.in/sp?seller=ARU24JXUG3S4L,,,19323.0,Health & Personal Care,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/ref=pd_zg_ts_hpc,245.0,Whey Proteins,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/11364606031/ref=pd_zg_hrsr_hpc,False,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Delivering to Mumbai 400001 Update location,IN,https://www.amazon.in/s?k=Muscleblaze&crid=2JII973B9FZAX&sprefix=muscleblaze%2Caps%2C253&ref=nb_sb_noss_2&s=popularity-rank&page=2,2,,False,,86,https://www.amazon.in/s?k=Muscleblaze&crid=2JII973B9FZAX&sprefix=muscleblaze%2Caps%2C253&ref=nb_sb_noss_2,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mhIpDtT+L._SS.jpg,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,