"MuscleBlaze Mb-Vite Daily Multivitamin With 51 Ingredients & 6 Blends (60 Tablets) & Omega 3 Fish Oil 1000 Mg (60 Capsules)|With 180 Mg Epa & 120 Mg Dha|Combo Pack,2 Count",https://www.amazon.in/dp/B08TC9Z9KR,B08TC9Z9KR,B08TC9Z9KR,1069.0,â‚¹,True,In stock,1199.0,â‚¹,MuscleBlaze,,,4.3,0.63,0.23,0.07,0.02,0.05,1985.0,,"Health & Personal Care > Diet & Nutrition > Vitamins, Minerals & Supplements > Vitamins > Multivitamins",1,Visit the MuscleBlaze Store,https://www.amazon.in/stores/MuscleBlaze/page/9A784926-3F81-400C-8D18-DDF7BBE45F17?lp_asin=B08TC9Z9KR&ref_=ast_bln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandlogo_sto,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4179sOwgyLL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4179sOwgyLL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FELQklIgL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Uy6X1utSL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iqPo1K1wL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cQ1O-mC+L._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DfjGLI+wL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bD4zvAJmL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eOzSQ-HSL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cBd38qveL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VFM5AkYcL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zETtC2OQL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qT3BGVnvL._SL1500_.jpg,Important information,Safety Information:,"Consult your healthcare professional before using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking any medication or have a medical condition. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease or health condition.",,Ingredients:,"MuscleBlaze MB-Vite Multivitamins- Mineral Blend, diluent (Maize Starch & INS 421), vitamin Blend, Thickener (INS 468, INS 462 & INS 464), Stabilizer (INS 1202), Disintegrant (Sodium starch glycolate), Binder (INS 1201), Enzyme Blend, Glazing agent (INS 553 iii), Anti-sticking agent (INS 470 iii) & Anticaking agent (INS 551)",,Directions:,Consume 01 capsule for 2-3 times a day preferable with meal or as directed by the dietician,,,"This fish oil and multivitamin combo includes MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil 1000 mg and MuscleBlaze MB-Vite Multivitamin.  MuscleBlaze MB-Vite Daily Multivitamin just got better and stronger with the same premium quality but an even better formulation. This multivitamin pack has all your essentials with 6 unique blends & 50+ ingredients to upkeep key micro-nutrients and amino acids in your body. These multivitamin tablets are formulated for athletes and fitness enthusiasts to help boost immunity, fill nutrient gaps, enhance energy, build stamina, support recovery, and metabolic processes. The vitamins & minerals, amino acid, prebiotic & probiotic, enzymes, antioxidant and metabolism blend helps elevate your fitness & stamina. These daily multivitamin tablets are made with premium ingredients that are FSSAI & HACCP certified which ensures great quality and safety. Take 1 multivitamin tablet a day with water, preferably with a meal.  MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil 1000 mg is now India's first & only certified Fish Oil for Purity & Accuracy by the reputed lab Labdoor, USA. These omega 3 fish oil capsules for women and men contains omega 3 essential fatty acids including 180 EPA and 120 DHA. Regular consumption of fish oil capsules or supplements helps boost immunity, muscle protein synthesis, post-workout recovery and minimizes workout-related joint stiffness. Made from top-grade omega-3, these omega 3 capsules leave no unpleasant fishy aftertaste or burps.","NEW & IMPROVED FORMULATION: MuscleBlaze MB-Vite Daily Multivitamin now has 6 powerful blends and 51 perfectly balanced ingredients. It enhances your lifestyle by upgrading your energy, strength, immunity, and recovery","EVERLASTING ENERGY & STAMINA: Elevate your fitness & stamina with each dose of a multivitamin tablet. Formulated with vitamins & minerals, amino acid, prebiotic & probiotic, enzyme, antioxidant and metabolism blend to maintain optimum energy levels","100% RDA OF IMMUNITY BOOSTERS FOR ADULTS: These daily multivitamins contain 100% RDA of immunity boosters such as Vitamin A, Vitamin C, Vitamin D, Vitamin E, Folic Acid, Zinc, Copper, Iron, and more making it a potent formula to strengthen your immunity","LABDOOR CERTIFIED FISH OIL: MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil 1000 mg is now India's first & only certified Fish Oil for Purity & Accuracy by the reputed lab Labdoor, USA. It comes with accurate label claims with each omega 3 fish oil capsule providing 180 mg EPA & 120 mg DHA","OMEGA 3 FISH OIL CERTIFIED FOR PURITY: MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil 1000 mg has been tested and cleared for heavy metals by the reputed lab Labdoor, USA. It is free of Lead, Arsenic, Cadmium, and Mercury and is safe for consumption",NO FISHY AFTERTASTE: These omega 3 fish oil capsules for men and women are enriched with top-grade Omega 3 that leaves no unpleasant fishy aftertaste and burps,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Item Form,Capsule,Primary Supplement Type,"multivitamin,vitamin a,omega 3",Diet Type,Non Vegetarian,Flavor,MB-Vite (60 Tablets) + Fish Oil (60 Capsules),Product Benefits,"Muscle Growth,Energy Management,Digestive Health Support,Immune Support",Age Range Description,Adult,Usage,"Boost Antioxidant, Immune Support, Improve Appetite",Special Ingredients,Omega 3,Number of Items,2,Model Name,MB-Vite (60 N) + Fish Oil (60 N),Container Type,Bottle,Dosage Form,"Tablet,Capsule",Country of Origin,India,Manufacturer,"Maxcure Nutravedics Ltd., Maxcure Nutravedics Ltd.,Sector-13 6A.I.I.E, Haridwar,Uttrakhand-249403",Model number,NUT7082-01,Manufacturer Part Number,8906116951774,Packer Contact Information,"Maxcure Nutravedics Ltd., Sector-13 6A.I.I.E, Haridwar,Uttrakhand-2494032",Item Nype Name,Omega 3,Manufacturer Contact Information,"Maxcure Nutravedics Ltd.,Sector-13 6A.I.I.E, Haridwar,Uttrakhand-249403",Best Sellers Rank,#511 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal