ltivitamin tablets are made with premium ingredients that are FSSAI and HACCP-certified which ensures quality and safety.","NEW & IMPROVED FORMULATION: MuscleBlaze MB-Vite Daily Multivitamin now has 6 powerful blends and 51 perfectly balanced ingredients. It enhances your lifestyle by upgrading your energy, strength, immunity, and recovery","EVERLASTING ENERGY & STAMINA: Elevate your fitness & stamina with each dose of a multivitamin tablet. Formulated with vitamins & minerals, amino acid, prebiotic & probiotic, enzyme, antioxidant and metabolism blend to maintain optimum energy levels","100% RDA OF IMMUNITY BOOSTERS FOR ADULTS: These daily multivitamins contain 100% RDA of immunity boosters such as Vitamin A, Vitamin C, Vitamin D, Vitamin E, Folic Acid, Zinc, Copper, Iron, and more making it a potent formula to strengthen your immunity",IMPROVES GUT HEALTH: Prebiotics and Probiotics are essential for supporting a healthy gut and MB-Vite Daily Multivitamin has you covered as it is packed with good bacteria. Its enzyme and metabolism blend helps with digestion and bowel movements,"ACE WORKOUTS WITH EASE: This multivitamin for men and women contains an ultimate Amino Acid Blend inclusive of BCAAs (L-Leucine, L-Isoleucine, L-Valine) along with L-Glutamine and Lysine. It fuels you for the most intense training and helps you power through workout sessions for better athletic performance","PROTECTS FROM FREE RADICAL DAMAGE: Formulated with Lycopene, Ginseng, Beetroot Extract, Grapeseed Extract & Citrus Bioflavonoids, the antioxidant blend protects our body cells from damage by removing free radicals produced during physical activity",Manufacturer,BACFO PHARMACEUTICALS (India) Ltd.,Country of Origin,India,Item model number,NUT3178-03,Product Dimensions,10.7 x 5.6 x 3.1 cm; 100 g,ASIN,B0GN9F7VBR,Packer,"BACFO PHARMACEUTICALS (India) Ltd., C-46, Phase-2, Noida 201305, UP, India",Item Weight,100 g,Item Dimensions LxWxH,10.7 x 5.6 x 3.1 Centimeters,Net Quantity,60.00 Count,Inc