h instant rehydration.,,,,"REDEFINE PERFORMANCE WITH MUSCLEBLAZE FUEL ONE SPORTS HYDR8: An instant rehydration formula that enables superior rehydration by supporting electrolyte balance, reloading essential nutrients and allowing individuals to bounce back with renewed vigour","COUNTER DEHYDRATION, OPTIMISE RECOVERY: MuscleBlaze Fuel One Sports Hydr8 replaces fluids lost via sweat, enabling you to steer clear of dehydration with its five essential electrolytes (Sodium, Potassium, Calcium, Magnesium, Chloride) and BCAAs which fuel faster and optimum recovery","SMASH FATIGUE, STRENGTHEN IMMUNITY: Keep at your athletic best by kicking fatigue to the curb and maintaining a robust immunity. This energy drink serves you Vitamin B2, B3, B6, B12, C and Zinc to enhance energy output while minimising oxidative stress","FIZZ UP, POWER UP: Available in the form of effervescent electrolyte tablets, Hydr8 is what defines convenient and smart rehydration. You just have to let its fizzy action fasten up the reloading of essential nutrients and bring you back into the game",REFRESHING FLAVOURS SANS ADDED SUGARS: Rehydrate and offer your taste buds a refreshing buzz of MuscleBlaze Fuel One Sports Hydr8 in zesty orange & lemon flavours without the guilt of any added sugars,,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Primary Supplement Type,Vitamin,Item Form,Tablet,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,"For Instant Hydration, To Smash Fatigue, For Faster Recovery, For An Immunity Boost",Age Range Description,Adult,Container Type,Tube,Dosage Form,Tablet,Country of Origin,India,Manufacturer,"Nutralike Formulation, Nutralike Formulation, A/23, Swagat-3 Industrial Park, Nr. Kothiya Busstop, Ahmedabad - Indore Highway, Kuha, Ta. Daskroi, Ahmedabad, Gujarat-382433, India",Item Nype Name,Fuel One Sports Hydr8,Manufacturer Contact Information,"Nutralike Formulation, A/23, Swagat-3 Industrial Park, Nr. Kothiya Busstop, Ahmedabad - Indore Highway, Kuha, Ta. Daskroi, Ahmedabad, Gujarat-382433, India",Model number,NUT840