MuscleBlaze Gym Bag - Great for Life On The Go! _x000D_
With the ever-challenging life and schedule, it is hard to fit exercise into the routine. Carry your compact and handy MuscleBlaze gym duffle bag everywhere with no fuss to save time. This 30-litre capacity gym bag is great for your life on the go. It also works well as a yoga bag, weekender bag, sports bag, and overnight bag. It is available in two colours - Blue and Black _x000D_
Sturdy Main Zipper _x000D_
This travel duffle bag has a secure and sturdy main zipper which provides easy access to the main compartment that is spacious enough for sports equipment, gear, clothes, and shoes. _x000D_
Side Net Pocket _x000D_
The breathable side net pocket is great for keeping your gym shaker, water bottle, masks, or sweaty gym clothes. _x000D_
Secure Outside Pocket _x000D_
The secure outside pocket has a sturdy and reliable zipper to keep your valuables like wallet, mobile, etc. safe as well as be easily accessible for you. _x000D_
Water-Resistant Fabric _x000D_
MuscleBlaze gym bag is made of high-quality fabric that is not only tough and lightweight but also water-resistant. It keeps your valuables safe even in light rain.",gym bag yoga travel weekender sports overnight shoulder crossbody duffle stylish water resistant,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/39194bd3-0326-446b-aace-5a2d54f20516.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",gym bag yoga travel weekender sports overnight shoulder crossbody duffle stylish water resistant,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/2ae3c5c3-a702-4353-991b-21f0c2d7a1b1.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX220_V1___.jpg",gym bag yoga travel weekender sports overnight shoulder crossbody duffle stylish water resistant,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/e969d25c-03e5-4651-afcc-4d1c3dbc5a7e.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX220_V1___.jpg",gym bag yoga travel weekender sports overnight shoulder crossbody duffle stylish water resistant,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/05481313-39c9-4854-b876-b776d0d942f0.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX220_V1___.jpg",gym bag yoga travel weekender sports overnight shoulder crossbody duffle stylish water resistant,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/ea343333-f8a6-4606-a284-3cd892fca08d.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX220_V1___.jpg",,,3p-module-b,MuscleBlaze Gym Bag - Great for Life On The Go!,gym bag yoga travel weekender sports overnight shoulder crossbody duffle stylish water resistant,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/39194bd3-0326-446b-aace-5a2d54f20516.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",module-4,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"Customers find the gym bag to be of good quality, with positive feedback about its appearance, storage capacity with multiple pockets, and versatility for travel. The material is well-made, and they consider it good value for money. However, the durability receives mixed reviews,