s per your liking",,,,INTRA-WORKOUT SUPPLEMENT: The new MuscleBlaze BCAA Pro + Electrolytes will maximize your gains without breaking your wallet,"100% BCAAS: With 5 g of BCAAs in each serving, this intra-workout drink helps provide rich amino acids during workout to minimize catabolism and in stimulating muscle synthesis",PREVENTS DEHYDRATION: MuscleBlaze BCAA Pro contains sodium and potassium as active electrolytes which keep you brimming with energy and prevents dehydration during intense workouts,"ZERO ADDED SUGAR: With zero added sugar, MuscleBlaze BCAA Pro + Electrolytes helps you get the most out of your workout with no unwanted calories",WATERMELON KOOL AID FLAVOUR: Let the refreshing taste of Watermelon Kool Aid cool you down during your intense workout sessions.,,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Primary Supplement Type,BCAAs,Item Form,Powder,Diet Type,Gluten Free,Product Benefits,"Instant Energy, Faster recovery, Hydration",Age Range Description,Adult,Container Type,Jar,Dosage Form,Powder,Country of Origin,India,Model Name,av2026-MuscleBlaze-g servings with g bcaas mg electrolytes-688cd434,Manufacturer,"Maxcure Nutravedics Limited, Plot No- 13, Sector- 6A, I.I.E., SIDCUL, RANIPUR, HARIDWAR, Uttarakhand-249403, India, Maxcure Nutravedics Ltd.",Importer Contact Information,"Maxcure Nutravedics Limited, Plot No- 13, Sector- 6A, I.I.E., SIDCUL, RANIPUR, HARIDWAR, Uttarakhand-249403, India",Item Nype Name,BCAA Pro,Manufacturer Contact Information,"Maxcure Nutravedics Limited, Plot No- 13, Sector- 6A, I.I.E., SIDCUL, RANIPUR, HARIDWAR, Uttarakhand-249403, India",Model number,NUT5135-33,Packer Contact Information,"Maxcure Nutravedics Ltd., Sector-13 6A.I.I.E, Haridwar, Uttrakhand-249403",Manufacturer Part Number,8906165781407,Best Sellers Rank,"#4,010 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#5 in BCAAs",ASIN,B0C8TTPQV7,Customer Reviews,4.1 4.1 out of 5 stars (504) 4.1 out of 5 stars,Unit Count,240.0 Grams,Item Weight,240 Grams,Item Dimensions,20.9 x 14.