MuscleBlaze BCAA PRO: Powerful Intra-Workout Fuel! _x000D_
Our muscles undergo microscopic tears during workouts which require a rich nutrient supply for immediate repairs, reducing muscle loss, and boosting protein synthesis. Since the human body cannot make them from other compounds, they must be taken via diet or BCAA supplements. MuscleBlaze BCAA Pro helps you replenish these amino reserves and electrolytes during and post-heavy-duty workouts. _x000D_
Benefits of MuscleBlaze BCAA Pro: _x000D_
BCAAs can reach the muscles directly bypassing the gut by virtue of their structure. Due to this faster action, they prevent catabolism and increase the energy level during the workouts. BCAAs support muscle protein synthesis and help with faster muscle recovery. Electrolytes in this intra workout supplement reduce dehydration during the workouts and keep you brimming with energy.",bcaa powder energy amino acids gym bodybuilding health drink pre post workout intra tropical fest,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/0d2bf57a-b621-4aa5-a9a9-417e0f7353fa.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",bcaa powder energy amino acids gym bodybuilding health drink pre post workout intra tropical fest,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/f69b94f7-3fd7-4ff1-8f7b-87c12690a236.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",,,,,,,,,module-12,,bcaa powder energy amino acids gym bodybuilding health drink pre post workout intra tropical fest,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/0d2bf57a-b621-4aa5-a9a9-417e0f7353fa.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",basic-module-13-text,,"Our muscles undergo microscopic tears during workouts which require a rich nutrient supply for immediate repairs, reducing muscle loss, and boosting protein synthesis. Since the human body cannot make them from other compounds, they must be taken via diet or BCAA supplements. MuscleBlaze BCAA Pro helps you replenish these amino reserves and electrolytes during and post-heavy-duty workouts.",module-12,,,,,,,,,,,,,,basic-module-13-text,,,"BCAAs can reach the muscles directly bypassing the gut by virtue of their structure. Due to this faster action, they prevent catabolism and increase the energy level during the workouts. BCAAs support muscle protein synthesis and help with faster muscle recovery. Electrolytes in this intra workout supplement reduce dehydration during the workouts and keep you brimming with energy.",,,,,,,,,,,"Custome