"MuscleBlaze CreaPRO Creatine Monohydrate Powder with Creapure, Tangy Orange (62 Servings, 250g)",https://www.amazon.in/dp/B07T1HZXTN,B07T1HZXTN,B07T1HZXTN,1529.0,â‚¹,True,In stock,1799.0,â‚¹,MuscleBlaze,,,4.2,0.6,0.22,0.08,0.04,0.06,1105.0,,"Health & Personal Care > Diet & Nutrition > Vitamins, Minerals & Supplements > Amino Acids > Creatine",1,Visit the MuscleBlaze Store,https://www.amazon.in/stores/MuscleBlaze/page/9A784926-3F81-400C-8D18-DDF7BBE45F17?lp_asin=B07T1HZXTN&ref_=ast_bln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandlogo_sto,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Rrqa1VqZL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Rrqa1VqZL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QfN8BFFKL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RrgqC5WdL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z+QZQRNZL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hSp0bHuXL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q3bZbCYJL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hWW13h+tL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810V-FLjUNL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CCl+5AQeL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815by60HGKL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814BN8KLoCL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VDYJBTIYL._SL1500_.jpg,Important information,Safety Information:,"Consult your healthcare professional before using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking any medication or have a medical condition. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease or health condition.",,Ingredients:,"Creatine Monohydrate, Orange Fruit Powder, Acidity Regulator (INS 330) & Sweetener (INS 955)",,Directions:,"Add 01 level scoop (4g), in 150 ml chilled water and shake for 15-30 secs until uniform is mixing.",,,"MuscleBlaze CreaPRO is made with the purest creatine monohydrate available named Creapure, a patented product of AlzChem, Germany. Creapure contains 99.99% pure creatine ensuring the best in quality. CreaPRO by MuscleBlaze adds vital strength to your everyday training while providing you with brimming energy for more intense workouts. Each serving of CreaPRO provides 3 g of creatine monohydrate which triggers the water retention of the muscle cells resulting in bulk and volumization during the workouts. This creatine supplement for gym and bodybuilding helps promote energy levels in the body and prevents premature muscle fatigue. Thus, it enhances the capacity to do heavy-duty workouts. It also prevents muscle protein loss and boosts the synthesis of new muscle protein. This process helps enhance muscle recovery. Creatine triggers water retention in the muscle cells and causes them to inflate making the muscles look heavier. MuscleBlaze CreaPro creatine supplement is available in an unflavoured format and three flavours - Fruit Punch, Tangy Orange, and Melon Twist to make your workouts more exciting.",Premium Creatine Monohydrate â€“ MuscleBlaze CreaPRO delivers 3g Creapure creatine monohydrate per serving for strength and endurance.,"Unflavored & Flavored Options â€“ Available in unflavored, Fruit Punch, Tangy Orange, and Melon Twist to suit all preferences.","99.99% Pure Creapure Creatine â€“ Sourced from AlzChem, Germany, ensuring high-quality, safe, and effective creatine monohydrate.","Boosts Energy & Performance â€“ Fast-absorbing creatine powder replenishes ATP levels, improving strength, stamina, and workout performance.","Prevents Muscle Breakdown â€“ Supports ATP synthesis, fuels muscle recovery, and reduces protein breakdown during intense training.",,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Primary Supplement Type,Creatine,Item Form,Powder,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,"Increase strength & power, Enhance energy, Volumizes Muscles and increase lean body mass",Age Range Description,Adult,Container Type,Jar,Dosage Form,Powder,Country of Origin,India,Manufacturer,"Sapiens Labs, Twilight Litaka Pharma Ltd., Village Dhana, Bagbania, Post Office Manpura, tehsil Baddi, Distt Solan (HP)-17410",Item Nype Name,CreaPRO Creatine,Manufacturer Contact Information,"Twilight Litaka Pharma Ltd., Village Dhana, Bagbania, Post Office Manpura, tehsil Baddi, Distt Solan (HP)-17410",Model number,NUT4605-03,Packer Contact Information,"Twilight Litaka Pharma Ltd., Village Dhana, Bagbania, Post Office Manpura, tehsil Baddi, Distt Solan (HP)-17410",Manufacturer Part Number,8906067028587,Best Sellers Rank,"#1,466 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#17 in Creatine",ASIN,B07T1HZXTN,Customer Reviews,"4.2 4.2 out of 5 stars (1,105) 4.2 out of 5 stars",Unit Count,250.0 Grams,Item Weight,250 Grams,Item Dimensions,22.9 x 16.5 x 12.7 Centimeters,Number of Items,1,Total Servings Per Container,62,Flavor,Tangy Orange,Special Ingredients,Creatine,Material Features,Vegetarian,Allergen Information,Milk,Colour,Multicolour,Is Discontinued By Manufacturer,No,Product Dimensions,22.9 x 16.5 x 12.7 cm; 250 g,Date First Available,2016-09-20 00:00:00,Item model number,NUT4605-03,Packer,"Twilight Litaka Pharma Ltd., Village Dhana, Bagbania, Post Office Manpura, tehsil Baddi, Distt Solan (HP)-17410",Item Dimensions LxWxH,22.9 x 16.5 x 12.7 Centimeters,Net Quantity,250.0 Grams,Generic Name,CreaPRO Creatine,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Flavour,Tangy Orange,Primary Supplement Type,Creatine,Net Quantity,250.0 Grams,Item Form,Powder,Item Weight,250 Grams,Item dimensions L x W x H,22.9 x 16.5 x 12.7 Centimeters,Special Ingredients,Creatine,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,"Increase strength & power, Enhance energy, Volumizes Muscles and increase lean body mass",B0BSV7FZRM,B0855SSJLF,CreaPRO Creatine- 100 g + Pre Workout- 100 g,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41D+WUvGgrL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c9K9CgKdL._SL1500_.jpg,B0BSV7FZRM,,Fruit Punch- 250 g,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41My8Yf3yzL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tciOaRhjL._SL1500_.jpg,B0855SSJLF,,https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B07T1