ustomer-reviews/srp/-/R208ZP501I61UT,Great product and good taste..,Great product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RFB9DGMYNM851,Good and authentic product. All original.,Good,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2RZHH0OE3N8XB,Effectiveness,positive,"Customers find the creatine supplement effective for muscle building and performance, with one customer noting improved recovery.",24.0,22.0,2.0,Itâ€™s effective but not as Optimum Nutrition. You can give it a try if you are a beginner....,effective,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R6KVQXJ288M3Z,Very effective if u r serious with this.,Very effective,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2UYUNTJD6AMUT,Best for muscle recovery and strength,Best for muscle recovery,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R23OUMG2OGL3UM,It's an ok product..it is the most researched and it does helps with workouts..but its only noticeable if you take it for a month or close...if you...,helps with workouts,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RFRZLGX27RNUD,Mixability,positive,"Customers like how the creatine powder mixes, with one mentioning it dissolves completely in water and another noting it works well with fruit juice.",6.0,5.0,1.0,"...This review analyzes its taste, mixability, effectiveness, and overall value based on user experiences and available information. **...",mixability,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RL3O3WVN1MF5Z,mixed with fruit juice or some other sweet beverage to make them more palatable.,mixed with fruit juice,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2KL7DGR73AVGJ,Its flavour and nicely mix with water,nicely mix with water,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R8F1H5VNYEW9J,Best ðŸ‘ðŸ’¯ results ever best Mixibility,best Mixibility,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3ULECP1WTWIK9,Value for money,mixed,Customers have mixed opinions about the supplement's value for money.,11.0,7.0,4.0,awesome product... value for money,value for money,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RES8JJ5KVQIF5,...a month or close...if you're buying it for temporary reasons..it's not worth it.,not worth it,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RFRZLGX27RNUD,"The packing was good , timely delivery, good product , worth the money except for that itâ€™s lesser than promised that is 200 grams Not 250g",worth the money,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R20HX50XWVUR7A,"...This review analyzes its taste, mixability, effectiveness, and overall value based on user experiences and available information. **...",overall value,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RL3O3WVN1MF5Z,100+ bought in past month,Chaitanya b.,amzn1.account.AFEMPHIJRCIRZ3H4OMUNI3KYAGUA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFEMPHIJRCIRZ3H4OMUNI3KYAGUA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,MuscleBlaze CreaPRO Review: Can Affordable Creatine Be Worth It?,"MuscleBlaze CreaPRO Creatine with CreapureÂ® (Flavored):MuscleBlaze CreaPRO Creatine with CreapureÂ® boasts flavored creatine sourced from CreapureÂ®, a popular German brand known for its high purity. This review analyzes its taste, mixability, effectiveness, and overall value based on user experiences and available information.**Taste:**Reviews on the taste of MuscleBlaze CreaPRO are **divided**. Some users find the flavors enjoyable, with options like fruit punch and grape being well-received. Others find the flavors artificial and unpleasant, especially when mixed with protein shakes.**Mixability:**The micronized creatine powder generally mixes **well**, leaving minimal residue in water or juice. However, some users report slight grittiness depending on the flavor and mixing method.**Effectiveness:**As with unflavored creatine, the effectiveness of MuscleBlaze CreaPRO is **individualized**. Some users experience increased strength, power, and endurance, aligning with the potential benefits of creatine supplementation. However, results can vary based on factors like training intensity, diet, and genetics.**Value:**MuscleBlaze CreaPRO is generally considered **affordable** compared to other flavored creatine options. However, some users feel the unflavored version offers better value due to its lower cost and versatility for mixing.**Additional Considerations:*** **Limited independent verification:** Similar to the unflavored version, the claims about ""CreAMPâ„¢"" technology enhancing absorption lack substantial independent verification.* **Potential side effects:** As with any supplement, consult a healthcare professional before use, especially if you have any pre-existing health conditions, as creatine can cause side effects like bloating and water retention.**Overall:**MuscleBlaze CreaPRO offers flavoured creatine at a **competitive price** with decent mixability. However, taste preferences can vary greatly, and the potential benefits remain individual-dependent. It's crucial to consult a doctor before use and remember that a balanced diet and proper training remain crucial for achieving fitness goals. If you prioritize flavor and affordability, MuscleBlaze CreaPRO might be worth trying, but keep your expectations realistic and be mindful of potential side effects.",2024-02-29,1.0,Reviewed in India on 29 February 2024,RL3O3WVN1MF5Z,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RL3O3WVN1MF5Z/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,9 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,Style Name: Tangy Orange- 250 g,Sahil qureshi,amzn1.account.AHKOHUIXEQUETZIKYOZGWN7V6ZPA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHKOHUIXEQUETZIKYOZGWN7V6ZPA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,The product is geniueThe product is geniue,I am using it from 4 months and i like the product very much.The taste of the product is amazing.It feels like drinking a juice.Till now i feel there are no side effects.Just remember drink enough water around 4-5 litres of water to flush it out.Hence recommend,2022-08-14,2.0,Reviewed in India on 14 August 2022Reviewed in India on 14 August 2022,R3SM0KG2FQ90MU,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3SM0KG2FQ90MU/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cyxm2hCZL._SY500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E0AtdyCJL._SY500_.jpg,5 people found this helpful,0.0,0.0,,"Style Name: Tangy Orange- 250 g, Style Name: Tangy Orange- 250 g",Style Name,Tangy Orange- 250 g,Style Name,Tangy Orange- 250 g,,,,,Snehashish,amzn1.account.AG5TTPC6IQXUDUQLEBNJAOLCEI7A,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AG5TTPC6IQXUDUQLEBNJAOLCEI7A?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,You sure this ain't glucon-D? ðŸ˜‚ðŸ¤§You sure this ain't glucon-D? ðŸ˜‚ðŸ¤§,"The taste is fabulous. It was tightly sealed and very hard to break. I took the first sip yesterday, and it tastes good. It doesn't feel like a supplement at all. However, I can't say much at this point since I am currently in the loading phase. It also had a spoon inside. One thing is certain, if this isn't Glucon-D, the quality is awesome. Go for it!",2024-12-09,3.0,Reviewed in India on 9 December 2024Reviewed in India on 9 December 2024,R16E2IGTBIM281,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R16E2IGTBIM281/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,4 people found this helpful,0.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/56e62ef0-dfa5-4fd9-aab0-5bc7532f2d0d._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_SX48_.jpg,"Style Name: Tangy Orange- 250 g, Style Name: Tangy Orange- 250 g",Aalka Rathod,amzn1.account.AESRDN3HN7SCPLKPCFWNI564DNCQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AESRDN3HN7SCPLKPCFWNI564DNCQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Muscle,Beast,2026-01-16,4.0,Reviewed in India on 16 January 2026,R3IPNIE1J51BNV,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3IPNIE1J51BNV/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,,Style Name: Tangy Orange- 250 g,Style Name,Tangy Orange- 2