MuscleBlaze Pre-Workout 200 Xtreme: The Sip Before You Sweat! _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Pre-Workout 200 Xtreme is a potent pre-workout formula that is crafted to let your body prepare itself for intense workouts. In just a single serving of this product, youâ€™ll feel energized and focused enough to perform heavy-duty exercises. This Pre-Workout fuel is packed with 200 mg Caffeine + 200 mg Theanine to give you an instant and sustained release of energy. This powerful Pre-Workout supplement is enriched with L-citrulline to enhance pump and Beta Alanine to add to the endurance. It is available in an exhilarating Berry Bolt flavour to let you have a refreshing experience before workouts. _x000D_
Features of MuscleBlaze Pre-Workout 200 Xtreme! _x000D_
Xtreme Endurance _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Pre-Workout 200 Xtreme is packed with 2000 mg Beta Alanine, a non-essential amino acid that is produced by the body naturally. It prevents early muscle fatigue and keeps you all fuelled up and charged when you are working out. _x000D_
Xtreme Energy _x000D_
This pre workout supplement offers 200 mg Caffeine & 200 mg Theanine in a single serve that helps in boosting your focus so that you can perform better at the gym as well as fuels you with great energy that helps you enjoy relentless workout sessions. _x000D_
Xtreme Pump _x000D_
L-citrulline is a naturally occurring amino acid that helps in improving athletic performance. It helps in minimizing the fatigue that is usually the result of a high-intensity workout. It also boosts nitric oxide output which eventually leads to greater muscle growth with time. _x000D_
Big on Power, Light on Pocket _x000D_
