 bhagat,amzn1.account.AHAUVYJUF52MBEQDWQNTVQWLWSYQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHAUVYJUF52MBEQDWQNTVQWLWSYQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,"Le's go!! :) yeah buddy!, light weight!Le's go!! :) yeah buddy!, light weight!",The previous workout is the same as other MB pre workouts but the flavour is different this time! It has the same 200 mg of caffeine and other ingredients are also the same as other pre workouts!! The flavour was really good really refreshing as I tried it today for my bicep and shoulder workout!! Can't share the photos though cuz amazon will take down the review and my photos cuz apparently my physiques photos violate their community guidlines!!:(I don't know how but no worries!!:) definitely try it out for heavy workouts but be mindful of the caffeine!! Its heafty in amount!! It gives you more focus while performing every rep and every set!! Gives you a great pump as well but beware it can drive you crazy as it did to me!! Let's go yeah buddy! Light weight!:) thanks amazon and MB once again for this beast:),2023-08-25,3.0,Reviewed in India on 25 August 2023Reviewed in India on 25 August 2023,RYE5WA913IY12,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RYE5WA913IY12/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,10 people found this helpful,0.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/a96c9eef-e475-4e0c-a3a4-a3fd82e20b54._CR0%2C0%2C449%2C449_UX460_SX48_.jpg,"Flavour Name: Berry Bolt, Size: 15 Servings (100 g) (Pack of 1), Flavour Name: Berry Bolt, Size: 15 Servings (100 g) (Pack of 1)",Manaswith,amzn1.account.AFGUFKE2WPA6TR7AWEBXWJ5YWLYA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFGUFKE2WPA6TR7AWEBXWJ5YWLYA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,3.0,The only review you need,"Actually i wanted to give it a 3.5, the hit is pretty fast but it goes down quickly too, if you workout like me for around 2 hours and pushing yourself, this is not the best pre but it works, pumpâ€™s avg, taste is also avg, I observed no redness