MuscleBlaze Liquid L-Carnitine Boosts Performance! _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Liquid L-Carnitine supplements elevate levels for enhanced performance. With 1100mg per 15ml serving, it transports fatty acids, boosting cellular energy and athletic prowess. Additionally, 5mg of Vitamin B5 supports digestive health and energy conversion. _x000D_
