1 Liquid L-Carnitine 2 Benefits of L-Carnitine _x000D_
Boosts Cellular Energy _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Liquid L-Carnitine boosts fat burning, converts fatty acids to energy for ATP production, & preserves lean muscle during intense workouts. _x000D_
Supports Weight Management _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Liquid L-Carnitine enhances fat metabolism, converting it to energy during workouts and aiding weight maintenance. _x000D_
Enhances Athletic Performance _x000D_
L-carnitine can increase endurance capacity by increasing oxygen intake and decreasing lactic acid buildup, helping enhance athletic performance. _x000D_
Rapid Absorption _x000D_
