MuscleBlaze Super Gainer XXL â€“ The High-Calorie Gainer _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Super Gainer XXL is a high-calorie sports nutrition supplement that is the perfect way to gain sturdy muscles. The unique blend of protein and complex carbs in a 1:5 ratio provides the fuel to muscles for quick recovery and muscle synthesis. MuscleBlaze gainer also contains multivitamins and minerals to enhance the bodyâ€™s workout performance and support the immune system. _x000D_
Protein and carbs in this super gainer come from quality sources. The scientifically formulated formula contains no added sugar or trans fat. It is available in various delicious flavors like chocolate, chocolate mint, chocolate cinnamon, choco coconut, cookies & cream, mango burst, kulfi, and banana. _x000D_
Product Benefits _x000D_
Gain With MuscleBlaze Super Gainer XXL! _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Super Gainer XXL fulfills the surplus calorie required for muscle mass gain. You get 375 kcal in each serving, derived from a perfect blend of fast & slow metabolizing carbohydrates. It includes macronutrients as well as micronutrients to enhance your performance and earn a lean bulk with sturdy muscles. _x000D_
Super Gainer For Muscle Growth! _x000D_
Physically active people need more protein in their diets. With Super Gainer from MuscleBlaze getting a protein-rich diet is easy. Protein contains amino acids that help enhance muscle growth and repair muscle tissue. _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Super Gainer XXL Meets High-Calorie Requirement! _x000D_
