 muscle mass, or maintaining peak performance, this combo supports your training goals with convenience and efficiency.","Complete Fitness Performance Bundle â€” Includes MuscleBlaze Micronised Creatine Monohydrate CreAMP Powder (320g, 80 servings) and a robust stainless steel gym shaker bottle (700 ml) â€” ideal for strength training, muscle building, and optimal supplement delivery.","Boost Strength & Power Naturally â€” Premium micronised creatine monohydrate enhances ATP regeneration, increases muscular strength, stamina, and explosive power â€” perfect for gym sessions, lifting, and intense workouts.","Supports Lean Muscle Growth & Recovery â€” Helps volumize muscles, supports lean body mass gains, improves workout performance and muscle recovery when used consistently with training and nutrition.","Smooth, Easy Mixing Every Time â€” Durable stainless steel shaker with a reliable leak-proof lid ensures clump-free blending of creatine, pre-workout, protein shakes, and other supplements â€” perfect for gym bags or daily hydration.","Durable & Hygienic Fitness Gear â€” Premium rust-resistant stainless steel construction is odor-free, easy to clean, and more durable than plastic alternatives â€” ensuring freshness and long-lasting use.",,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Best Sellers Rank,"#33,061 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#113 in Creatine",ASIN,B0GFNDP8J6,Customer Reviews,5.0 5.0 out of 5 stars (1) 5.0 out of 5 stars,Date First Available,2025-12-12 00:00:00,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B0GFNDP8J6,True,"Tomorrow, 18 July",,,,,,,Bright Lifecare Private Limited,ARU24JXUG3S4L,https://www.amazon.in/sp?seller=ARU24JXUG3S4L,,,33061.0,Health & Personal Care,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/ref=pd_zg_ts_hpc,113.0,Creatine,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/11364620031/ref=pd_zg_hrsr_hpc,False,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,