"MuscleBlaze Biozyme Performance Whey Protein Powder, Chocolate Hazelnut (1 kg) + Stainless Steel Gym Shaker (700ml)",https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0GFNG2DKZ,B0GFNG2DKZ,B0GFNG2DKZ,3893.1,â‚¹,True,In stock,3948.0,â‚¹,MuscleBlaze,,,4.8,0.83,0.17,0.0,0.0,0.0,3.0,,Health & Personal Care > Diet & Nutrition > Sports Supplements > Protein Supplements > Whey Proteins,0,Visit the MuscleBlaze Store,https://www.amazon.in/stores/MuscleBlaze/page/9A784926-3F81-400C-8D18-DDF7BBE45F17?lp_asin=B0GFNG2DKZ&ref_=ast_bln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandlogo_sto,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tbocc3XEL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tbocc3XEL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ca-Oi7bdL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41STk-904cL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z113J6npL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BO1mS33YL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jciVaCmuL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N9JLMIQNL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hXB+RHmaL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lCHwxKwBL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811D4UNsUDL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FhEx3flVL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mEe7s8T2L._SL1500_.jpg,Important information,Ingredients:,Please see the label image for ingredient information,,,,,,,,,"Fuel your fitness goals with this Ultimate Whey Protein & Steel Shaker Combo featuring MuscleBlaze Biozyme Performance Whey Protein Powder (1 kg) and a premium stainless-steel gym shaker â€” the perfect pairing for muscle building, post-workout recovery, and daily nutrition. Designed for athletes, gym enthusiasts, and active lifestyles, this combo delivers high-quality protein with superior absorption and a durable, leak-proof stainless shaker for smooth, lump-free shakes on the go",Complete Fitness Nutrition Bundle â€” Includes premium MuscleBlaze Biozyme Performance Whey Protein 1 kg + a durable stainless-steel gym shaker bottle â€” perfect combo for post-workout protein shakes and daily supplement mixing.,"World's Only Protein with U.S. Patented Enzymes: Featuring the innovative Enhanced Absorption Formula (EAF), it delivers 50% higher protein absorption, optimizing muscle recovery and eliminating protein digestion challenges.","Smooth, Lump-Free Shake Every Time â€” Convenient stainless-steel shaker with built-in mixer ensures smooth protein mixes, no clumps, and a leak-proof design for workout bags â€” great for gym, travel, or daily hydration.","India's 1st clinically proven whey protein: Biozyme Performance whey is proven for superior absorption and enhanced muscle-building efficacy. The results of the clinical study, registered with the ICMR's Clinical Trials Registry - India, highlight its effectiveness in reducing stomach discomfort commonly associated with high-protein digestion.","Durable & Easy-Clean Gear â€” Premium steel shaker is rust-resistant, BPA-free, and easy to wash compared with plastic alternatives â€” ensuring freshness and odor-free use daily.","Globally Recognized Award-Winning Protein: Winner of the Nutra Ingredients Award 2021 for Sports Nutrition, recognized for its research, innovation, and quality. It also features the Asia Star Award-winning ""Scoop-on-Top"" packaging with a patent-granted design for convenience and hygiene.",Brand,MuscleBlaze,Best Sellers Rank,"#22,282 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#275 in Whey Proteins",ASIN,B0GFNG2DKZ,Customer Reviews,4.8 4.8 out of 5 stars (3) 4.8 out of 5 stars,Date First Available,2025-12-12 00:00:00,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B0GFNG2DKZ,True,"Tomorrow, 18 July",,,,,,,Bright Lifecare Private Limited,ARU24JXUG3S4L,https://www.amazon.in/sp?seller=ARU24JXUG3S4L,,,22282.0,Health & Personal Care,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc