 even expensive brands have the same thing.It smells odorless with a hint of milk powder smell due to being whey in nature.Tastes horrible, but thats the thing about Raw whey.I have been using it for a month and my recovery is amazing after each session , going back to gym for more every day.Further, I can recommend it to anyone who is not buying this for price, but for quality.If you are buying for whey isolate at 1700â‚¹ , probably you will add flavour like cocoa or anything else.It is better to spend more money and buy ONN rather than adding flavour.Buy this if you will drink it as it is.10/10 would recommend.Attached photo of my latest Protein haul.",2021-10-19,3.0,Reviewed in India on 19 October 2021Reviewed in India on 19 October 2021,R39Q6W0JF1TRGI,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R39Q6W0JF1TRGI/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,5 people found this helpful,0.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Unflavoured, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1), Flavour Name: Unflavoured, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Placeholder,amzn1.account.AFX7HG6CINY5JJFSVPFIHQM7B5EA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFX7HG6CINY5JJFSVPFIHQM7B5EA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,3.0,Very bad Package quality.,"The airtight seal bag get torn even at the first use. Had to transfer the contents to a jar to preserve airtightness.The quality of the product is good, but without a solid container the quality won't be maintained.",2025-02-23,4.0,Reviewed in India on 23 February 2025,R3S56ANA186XSF,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3S56ANA186XSF/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,2 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Unflavoured, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Unflavoured,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),Joseph,amzn1.account.AGAJ2FJREFVS3L6PJKE5L7CTOQEQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGAJ2FJREFVS3L6PJKE5L7CTOQEQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Unsweetened perfect whey !,Whey was great for my diet,2026-06-28,5.0,Reviewed in India on 28 June 2026,RS