leak-proof design and included mixing mechanism ensure smooth and clump-free drinks â€” whether youâ€™re mixing pre-workout, protein shakes, BCAAs or any powdered supplement. Together, this combo makes your workout prep seamless, efficient, and more effective. Ideal for gym enthusiasts, athletes, and fitness beginners alike â€” it keeps your performance fueled and your beverages perfectly blended.","Complete Pre-Workout Performance Bundle â€” Includes MuscleBlaze Pre-Workout WrathX (340g, 20 servings) paired with a premium stainless-steel gym shaker bottle â€” the perfect combo for explosive energy, smooth supplement mixing, and hassle-free workout prep.","Explosive Energy, Focus & Endurance Support â€” Advanced pre-workout formula with 200mg caffeine, Beta-Alanine, Creapure Creatine, L-Citrulline & Nitroblaze to boost stamina, delay fatigue, enhance pumps, and improve workout performance â€” ideal for intense training sessions.","Smooth, Lump-Free Mixing Every Time â€” Durable stainless steel shaker bottle ensures effortless mixing of pre-workout, protein, or BCAA drinks with no clumps and a leak-proof design â€” perfect for gym bags, travel, and daily use.","Durable, Hygienic & Easy to Clean â€” Premium rust-resistant stainless steel shaker is odor-free, stain-resistant, and easier to clean than plastic bottles â€” maintains freshness and hygiene for everyday supplement use.",Pre Workout Supplements For Men & Womenâ€” Indulge in the refreshing & intense MuscleBlaze Pre Workout WrathX Fruit Fury flavour that makes every sip a delightful experience as well as elevates your overall athletic performance to achieve new personal bests,"Perfect Gift for Fitness & Gym Lovers â€” A ready-to-use pre-workout performance stack suitable for beginners and advanced athletes â€” delivers energy, convenience, and results in one value-packed fitness combo.",Brand,MuscleBlaze,Best Sellers Rank,"#72,357 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#184 in Pre-Work