e fabric that offers flexibility and freedom of movement. This allows the wearer to move comfortably during various activities without feeling restricted by the garment. The dry fit t shirt is crafted from microfiber material, known for its softness, lightweight feel, and durability. Microfiber fabrics in the t shirt are gentle on the skin and minimize the risk of irritation or chafing, even during prolonged wear.",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Product Care Instructions,Machine Wash,B0D499Z8FD,B0D49BBDWD,XL Teal Blue,,,B0D499Z8FD,,S Teal Blue,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dhTP-K8nL._SX38_SY50_CR,0,0,38.jpg",https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dgWKQziVL._SL1500_.jpg,B0D49BBDWD,,,,,,,,,,,Fabric Stretchability,Stretchable,Apparel Fabric Weight Class,Lightweight,Apparel Fabric Stretch,Medium Stretch,Item Length Description,Regular,Garment Size Country,India,Product Dimensions,30.48 x 22.86 x 30.48 cm; 100 g,Date First Available,2024-05-16 00:00:00,Item model number,tank top,Country of Origin,India,,,,,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717wK0-B2rL._SL1500_.jpg,,B0D49BWG8L,,,,S Nardo Grey,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Rw-G6zV8L._SX38_SY50_CR,0,0,38.jpg",https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bvc8zzdxL._SL1500_.jpg,B0D49BWG8L,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Size,M,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,tank tops sports vests t shirts for men dry fit polyester spandex black tshirt casual active wear,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/0467377b-