MuscleBlaze Creatine Monohydrate CreAMP is developed in-house using a patent-pending blend MB CreAbsorb which reduces the deterioration of Creatine Monohydrate into Creatinine (an ineffective form of creatine), which ensures its higher bioavailability resulting in better athletic performance. _x000D_
