Benefits of MuscleBlaze Creatine Monohydrate CreAMP _x000D_
Strength and Power _x000D_
MB Creatine Monohydrate CreAMP enriches you with 3 g of pure creatine to boost your strength, power, and endurance. _x000D_
Muscle Volumization _x000D_
CreAMP is extremely helpful in boosting muscle volume. It enhances the water content of your muscle cells which leads to cell volumization. _x000D_
Lean Body Mass _x000D_
Creatine is very crucial for building lean muscle mass. It enables your body to build new muscle proteins and this results in increased muscle mass. _x000D_
Brain Function _x000D_
