izable 1361 kcal and 76.5g protein from three servings with milk,"CARBS FROM MULTIPLE SOURCES: This mass gainer has the ideal ratio of quick and slow metabolising carbs, which supports in sustaining the body's calorie supply and supplies enough energy to keep your bodyâ€™s glycogen stores at optimum levels, and to contribute to muscle growth","TOP-TIER PROTEIN BLEND: MB Mass Gainer XXL helps in muscle repairing and building through its unique blend obtained from 5 sources of protein which contain slow, medium and fast-acting proteins to keep your protein tank fuelled up TOP-TIER PROTEIN BLEND: MB Mass Gainer XXL helps in muscle repairing and building through its unique blend obtained from 5 sources of protein which contain slow, medium and fast-acting proteins to keep your protein tank fuelled up",ADDED ENZYMES FOR DIGESTION: This highly potent mass gainer for mass gain not only offers healthy calories in high amounts. It also offers your body the ability to digest them and ensure optimum nutrition absorption. This is done by adding enzymes for digestion to the mix,GAINER THAT TASTES GREAT: MB Mass Gainer XXL makes gaining a lip-smacking experience with its delectable flavours. Now you can chase massive gains with a punch for your taste buds and muscles.,,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Primary Supplement Type,protein,Item Form,Powder,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,Muscle Growth,Age Range Description,Adult,Container Type,Bag,Dosage Form,Powder,Country of Origin,India,UPC,745556758400,Manufacturer,"MuscleBlaze, Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana-Bagbania, P.O.Manpura, Tehsil Nalagarh, Solan (Himanchal Pradesh)-174101",Global Trade Identification Number,8906067020956,Item Nype Name,Mass Gainer XXL,Manufacturer Contact Information,"Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana-Bagbania, P.O.Manpura, Tehsil Nalagarh, Solan (Himanchal Pradesh)-174101",Model number,NUT3599-14,Packer Contact Information,"Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana-Bagbania, P.O.Manpura, Tehsil Nalagarh, Solan (Himanchal Pradesh)-174101",Manufacturer Part Number,8906067020956,Best Sellers Rank,"#2,827 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#12 in Mass & Weight Gainers",ASIN,B01F381SAY,Customer Reviews,"3.8 3.8 out of 5 stars (10,241) 3.8 out of 5 stars",Unit Count,1000.0 Grams,Item Weight,1 Kilograms,Item Dimensions,14.5 x 14.5 x 25.9 Centimeters,Number of Items,1,Total Servings Per Container,10,Flavor,Chocolate,Special Ingredients,Whey,Material Features,Vegetarian,Allergen Information,Milk,Is Discontinued By Manufacturer,No,Product Dimensions,14.5 x 14.5 x 25.9 cm; 1 kg,Date First Available,2016-05-03 00:00:00,Item model number,NUT3599-14,Packer,"Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana-Bagbania, P.O.Manpura, Tehsil Nalagarh, Solan (Himanchal Pradesh)-174101",Item Dimensions LxWxH,14.5 x 14.5 x 25.9 Centimeters,Net Quantity,1000.0 Grams,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Flavour,Chocolate,Primary Supplement Type,protein,Net Quantity,1000.0 Grams,Item Form,Powder,Item Weight,1 Kilograms,Item dimensions L x W x H,14.5 x 14.5 x 25.9 Centimeters,Special Ingredients,Whey,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,Muscle Growth,B00ZZP0L6I,B01F381SAY,Chocolate 5kg (Pack of 1),https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41s97RSGQXL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aDgGIDNSL._SL1500_.jpg,B00ZZP0L6I,,Chocolate 1 kg (Pack of 1),https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41uy7SB3ydL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c5-Z2wdZL._SL1500_.jpg,B01F381SAY,,https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B01F381SAY,True,"Sunday, 19 July",Today 5 pm - 10 pm,,,,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),Bright Lifecare Private Limited,ARU24JXUG3S4L,https://www.amazon.in/sp?seller=ARU24JXUG3S4L,,,2827.0,Health & Personal Care,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/ref=pd_zg_ts_hpc,12.0,Mass & Weight Gainers,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/14095357031/ref=pd_zg_hrsr_hpc,False,,,,Product Description,"Product Description_x000D_
MuscleBlaze Mass Gainer XXL - The Secret to Faster Gains _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Mass Gainer XXL is crafted especially for fitness lovers who want to gain sturdy muscles. This unique formula offers you 70 g carbs per serving which helps in rapid gains. These carbs fuel your body with a sustained calorie supply and boost your energy to fuel your muscle-building throughout the day. _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Mass Gainer XXL has a perfect blend of slow, medium and fast-reacting proteins that enable speedy muscle recovery and maximize muscle size. It is also enriched with 27 essential vitamins & minerals and a great blend of digestive enzymes that help in better absorption of nutrients and achieve the best results. _x000D_
461 Calories per Serving _x000D_
With every serving of MuscleBlaze Mass Gainer XXL, you get 461 calories which are derived from a perfect blend of fast & slow metabolizing carbohydrates. This blend helps in maintaining a sustained calorie supply throughout and fuels you with a good amount of energy to boost muscle growth & recovery. _x000D_
3:1 Carbs to Protein Ratio _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Mass Gainer XXL presents carbs to protein ratio of 3:1. It has a unique blend of 5 protein sources that enhance muscle recovery and muscle size. The fast & slow metabolizing carbs are blended to offer 1383 calories with 3 servings of Mass Gainer to fuel muscle building. _x000D_
27 Vitamins & Minerals _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Mass Gainer XXL is enriched with 27 essential vitamins and minerals that fulfill the micronutrient needs of fitness enthusiasts. The product also contains a good blend of digestive enzymes that helps in better absorption and digestion of nutrients for maximum results.",imz,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/9bd364ca-1602-443b-9bee-66ff97583f4f.__CR87,0,1746,1080_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",imz,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/58aabbba-2ddc-486f-af94-750be271ae21.__CR0,0,800,800_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/40c35feb-e9c3-4edc-92ac-62ef8bd558a5.__CR0,0,800,800_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",27 Vitamins &amp; Minerals,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/1d684053-6ac1-4c64-89c4-307ef4294f45.__CR0,0,800,800_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",,,,,3p-module-b,,imz,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/9bd364ca-1602-443b-9bee-66ff97583f4f.__CR87,0,1746,1080_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",basic-module-13-text,,"MuscleBlaze Mass Gainer XXL is crafted especially for fitness lovers who want to gain sturdy muscles. This unique formula offers you 70 g carbs per serving which helps in rapid gains. These carbs fuel your body with a sustained calorie supply and boost your energy to fuel your muscle-building throughout the day. _x000D_
