ver, opinions are mixed regarding taste, effectiveness, value for money, and authenticity.",Quality,positive,"Customers find this mass gainer supplement to be of good quality, with one customer noting it's the best in the Indian supplement category.",579.0,485.0,94.0,"Good product.....As it is a authentic product, i have obtained good result.....taste is also good and mixability also well.....effective who wants...",Good product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1FCIU2K077T7R,"Nice product, well packaging. Smell is just awesome.. And Ya I checked the code & its a genuine product. Happy to know that.ðŸ˜ŠðŸ˜‚...",Nice product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R17FG3V1E3OP3G,Very good product .and it is 100 % original .it works good when your workout is hard .you will get good results it's based on your workout.and it...,Very good product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2XB9MTOPIYY4H,actually it works and its a genuine product with great performance only you have to do daily workout in gym and take so have to take proper diet for...,genuine product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3QN8QM6RFYMGZ,Weight gain,positive,"Customers report positive results with this mass gainer supplement, gaining between 4 kg and 7 kg within 12 days, and find it effective for weight training.",154.0,115.0,39.0,The best mass gainer ever it helps me for gaining weight,best mass gainer,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2JK6U0PT7CQFD,can go for it....alltotally this is a good mass gainer..shows effects quickly and it contains good protein and carbs....the only tension i have is...,good mass gainer,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1D9PHL7SEKKEE,Back of the seal is resealed.....may be unauthorised product. No weight gain even after use for 1 month....,No weight gain,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2QIL7WZUAJXZA,"For weight gainer , go ahead",weight gainer,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R32J25S0V91KR8,Healthiness,positive,"Customers find the mass gainer powder effective for muscle building, reporting improvements in their bodies.",133.0,112.0,21.0,Muscle blaze ðŸ‘Œ,Muscle blaze,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1X8SB7S3LD02U,"It is good for health and good for increasing the body musscle, and there is no side effects in body",good for health,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1JQWU5D1JGJCC,"Tasty, Healthy and Best in Indian Supplement category. Guyz, you can take it as ur first mass gainer. Value for Money!",Healthy,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1OJNYPYK5QFBD,...Like the product. Best for body building.,Best for body building,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1ZRNPLIUP7DHU,Suitable for beginners,positive,Customers find the mass gainer powder excellent for beginners.,52.0,47.0,5.0,very good product for muscle building and weight gaining and good for beginners,good for beginners,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3GJULSNTRSI0N,...Easily digestible Does not diminish the apetite Best for beginners Waiting for results Cons error 404 not found,Best for beginners,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1T2UVI1YT8UED,Good product for beginners..but they have increased the price and they have decreased the protein and carbs amt..product was gud but not now.,Good product for beginners,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RIEGUQRUE42OF,Good Supplement for beginners.,Good Supplement for beginners,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2LE8N70DRLJ9Z,Taste,mixed,"Customers have mixed opinions about the mass gainer's taste, with some finding it nice and tasty, while others consider it too sweet.",272.0,190.0,82.0,"It can be used as a normal supplement or with a workout. The taste is good. It really works, if you do a light workout and then consume....",taste is good,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3NKO3KPNNLBRZ,"Good taste but too little for someone to see results, can be used as an experimental supplement, that if it's having any side effect or not etc..",Good taste,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1TD2RO9SQ5DFR,...1KG I don't think its a good stuff for gains regarding taste it is too sweet that you will feel sweetness even after finishing the shake for one to...,too sweet,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RXX137RHE6E3Q,"Tasty, Healthy and Best in Indian Supplement category. Guyz, you can take it as ur first mass gainer. Value for Money!",Tasty,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1OJNYPYK5QFBD,200+ bought in past month,Vishnu Singh,amzn1.account.AEFK6EADITLL4IN6AJWTWCYB22QA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEFK6EADITLL4IN6AJWTWCYB22QA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Good,Good product amazon quality is very good,2026-04-24,1.0,Reviewed in India on 24 April 2026,R1U7PL3MEGNGWX,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1U7PL3MEGNGWX/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 2kg (Pack of 1)",Bittu,amzn1.account.AEBMTISTGDQ7DQQ4UFA7MV7C3DRQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEBMTISTGDQ7DQQ4UFA7MV7C3DRQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,A Worthy Product To Start With !A Worthy Product To Start With !,"Ordered it for my brother who is very lazy in having his meals and not so active too. He spends an hour daily for sports and does light workout with barbell and dumb-bells at home. He's 5'5"" with 70 kgs. He is always concerned about his upper body shape and that's why we ordered this product.Now, It may be too early to pass a verdict on the product as it's been just 10 days using it (Once or sometimes twice daily) so not much effect can be felt on body shape or muscle mass. I'll post an update after consuming the complete pack.Nonetheless, It DOES affect the energy level certainly as my brother felt a significant boost in his stamina in sports. Though his daily diet and intake is the same as before. So, we can easily assume that taking this powder regularly will definitely give good results to the overall muscle mass.Just keep in mind that you MUST follow a healthy diet chart along with moderate bodybuilding workouts daily. Taking part in sports regularly will act as a bonus, no doubt !The taste of this chocolate flavoured powder is delicious and you'll certainly love it. You can take it with a glass of milk with one or two bananas if you are concerned about your low weight. A deep plastic spoon is provided with it. Some ""Authentick"" scratch card was attached to the lid which I used to verify the authenticity of this product on it's official website.Overall, it's a worthy product to complement your daily nutrition requirements.Waiting to give it a 5 star after seeing it's effect on the overall muscle mass ! ðŸ’ª",2017-02-05,2.0,Reviewed in India on 5 February 2017Reviewed in India on 5 February 2017,RHT3QIU7YYUZQ,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RHT3QIU7YYUZQ/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vTj+LklGL._SY500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yWutNAbbL._SY500_.jpg,90 people found this helpful,0.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/ece1dc80-894a-4976-8d42-36043305ae07._CR0%2C0%2C497%2C497_SX460_SX48_.jpg,"Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1), Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Chocolate,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),Flavour Name,Chocolate,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),Ashish,amzn1.account.AHRJOWEHVUKR3ZUFIWFMO722P6MQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHRJOWEHVUKR3ZUFIWFMO722P6MQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Good,Good,2026-06-29,3.0,Reviewed in India on 29 June 2026,R2594KFH7SH1SS,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2594KFH7SH1SS/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Aidan Orton,amzn1.account.AFXMIIFUOXUBLNWSNMW6CD272XIQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFXMIIFUOXUBLNWSNMW6CD272XIQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,3.0,Cheap But Does It Worth Of?,"Here's My Full Box Experience. I'm 22 Yers Old Working Out since 10 months. This is my 3rd gainer i used in my life. & Be honest I didn't gain much at all.. I gained about 1 or maximum 1.5kg. I may feel energy but it's not efficient. It's not just about gain the weight but muscles too. Well, 1% Improvement. This thing will work for you till you taking it, Once you stopped, You're back to your old track. Also, i faced some stomach problems after drinking this.Remember, MuscleBlaze is an Indian brand. My 1st Supplement was ""Dymatize Super Mass Gainer"" It worked like a charm... So after 2 months of gap i took another... Boom It blast again... Biceps turned 10 to 13 for the first time, and now it's 15. It turned my body into a masterpiece. So another 2 months of gap, I saw an ad of MuscleBlaze with Amazing price.... I was like WOOOW Soo Cheap With Same Configuration. That was my biggest mistake for my body. I gained nothing.. Biceps are still 15 or 15.5. My 6 pack abs are gone... It gave me fat on my tummy.... Just Remember. Dymatize is An American Company ""Brock Lesnar"" represents It Check His MMA Fights, You'll see a name on his jersey. I didn't know this before. Well, Dymatize is 1000rs expensive than MuscleBlaze But Results are worth than 1000. Well, the choice is yours, I wish that someone could write this before i bought. All i read was YEEY WE GAINED 5KG OMG SUPER RESULTS... They may used it 1st time becuase no matter what gainer you use at the 1st time, i'll work perfectly. But not for the 2nd time. Here's My FULL BOX Result, Choice is yours...",2015-09-02,4.0,Reviewed in India on 2 September 2015,RF3PJH6DAVD9C,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RF3PJH6DAVD9C/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,43 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/20969d96-47ab-4008-a4e7-9c66cc2d9f1d._CR9%2C0%2C481%2C481_SX460_SX48_.jpg,"Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 3 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Chocolate,Size,3 kg (Pack of 1),Abc,amzn1.account.AFJPMCWMZVTKHPGC7RQPPO6WVJ5Q,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFJPMCWMZVTKHPGC7RQPPO6WVJ5Q?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,1.0,AS GOOD AS FRAUD,"I am writing this after perhaps 1.5 years of discontinuing it. When I joined gym my weight was 51 kg at 5â€™11 height. I thought reading these reviews that these mass gai ers must be be effective, and even a research oriented person simply WASNT WARNED.These horrible mass gainers are USELESS, that awful taste they have is of no use, u can gain just as much if u eat 3 meals to full appetite plus to fill calories u can go for dairy like 600 ml of milk, yogurt ( lAssi form) in morning evening n ull gain just as much WITHOUT the price2) advice - use ANY CALORIE tracker app n it takes 5 mins.  They will tell if ur calories are enough for weight gain or not3) these fraudster companies dont want to tell u that they use milk solids in product to give calories which is SIMPLY MILK. Fresh milk is better than dried out milk right?4) these mass gainers are frauds coz they say NO SUGAR, but most use a sugars brother like maltodextrin which i bet NO ONE KNOWS that its just as bad for teeth as regular sugar. I developed gum disease after 1.5 yrs of having thesen n had a 11000 rs procedure, curetage was it i think.NO ONE EXCEPT the dentists know  abt these NO SUGAR products that use a scientific name fr sugarâ€™s brother are JUST AS BAD As sugar. I thought since i nvr had sugar i must be fine but NO.Its ALL a money making FRAUD, track ur calories via app n ull see weight gain without these CRIMINAL companiesâ€™ help. I figure ill write it to make one aware of people like me, who started out n dont know abt scientific things like maltodextrin, sucrose etc etc. these companies deserve to be sued.",2026-05-27,5.0,Reviewed in India on 27 May 2026,R33QVLDJCGW337,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R33QVLDJCGW337/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,3 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 2kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Chocolate,Size,2kg (Pack of 1),Ashish,amzn1.account.AH5QPNIPRH6W3BYZUHN5CL6EKPZA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AH5QPNIPRH6W3BYZUHN5CL6EKPZA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Not good,I received very less Product!!,2026-06-16,6.0,Reviewed in India on 16 June 2026,R3H5Z8N3FHR1YS,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3H5Z8N3FHR1YS/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,One person found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Shailesh Kumar,amzn1.account.AGOEFFGZ2N4IJO24BAKO5GRAQTCA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGOEFFGZ2N4IJO24BAKO5GRAQTCA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Mast,Mass gainer is the best response,2026-05-23,7.0,Reviewed in India on 23 May 2026,RXZVUV6UFT5PB,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RXZVUV6UFT5PB/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,One person found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 2kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Chocolate,Size,2kg (Pack of 1),Manu naik,amzn1.account.AFE7XU5UJJ7YHBRT76HCPLVY2CZQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFE7XU5UJJ7YHBRT76HCPLVY2CZQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,MB muscleblaze mass gainer xxlMB muscleblaze mass gainer xxl,Very good productBut the scoop looks like a drum ðŸ˜†,2026-03-18,8.0,Reviewed in India on 18 March 2026Reviewed in India on 18 March 2026,R1TZ6UCNTQ8FSA,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1TZ6UCNTQ8FSA/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,0.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1), Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Chocolate,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),Delivering to Lucknow 226006 Update location,IN,https://www.amazon.in/