e â€” perfect combo for post-workout protein shakes and daily supplement mixing.,"High-Quality Protein for Muscle Gains â€” Supports lean muscle growth, enhanced recovery, and better workout performance with Biozyme whey proteinâ€™s superior absorption and BCAAs â€” ideal for gym enthusiasts and athletes.","Smooth, Lump-Free Shake Every Time â€” Convenient stainless steel gym shaker with built-in mixer ensures smooth protein mixes, no clumps, and a leak-proof design for workout bags â€” great for gym, travel, or daily hydration.",Delicious & Versatile Flavor â€” Available in Rich Chocolate for an enjoyable protein intake experience.,"Durable Stainless Steel â€“ Long-lasting, rust-resistant construction",,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Best Sellers Rank,"#66,072 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#601 in Whey Proteins",ASIN,B0GQTD12HC,Date First Available,2025-11-17 00:00:00,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B0GQTD12HC,True,"Tomorrow, 18 July",,,,,,,Bright Lifecare Private Limited,ARU24JXUG3S4L,https://www.amazon.in/sp?seller=ARU24JXUG3S4L,,,66072.0,Health & Personal Care,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/ref=pd_zg_ts_hpc,601.0,Whey Proteins,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/11364606031/ref=pd_zg_hrsr_hpc,False,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Delivering to Ajmer 305001 Update location,IN,https://www.amazon.in/s?k=Muscleblaze&crid=2JII973B9FZAX&sprefix=muscleblaze%2Caps%2C253&ref=nb_sb_noss_2&s=popularity-rank&page=3,3,,False,,113,https://www.amazon.in/s?k=Muscleblaze&crid=2JII973B9FZAX&sprefix=muscleblaze%2Caps%2C253&ref=nb_sb_noss_2,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41u1Ck34