MuscleBlaze Liquid L-Carnitine: Triple Strength Formula _x000D_
MuscleBlaze L-Carnitine PRO helps in the fat being utilized in boosting the cellular energy that helps in perpetuating lean muscles whilst training. It also helps in controlling the build-up of lactic acid which is the prime cause of fatigue. It also delivers 5mg of Vitamin B5 with each serving. _x000D_
