MuscleBlaze L-Carnitine is a good supplement for people who are into fitness and fat loss. It helps in improving workout energy and recovery....,good supplement,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R7FFJSH1OK1DB,Too good and better than other brands available in market,Too good,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/REJPOFI1RNO7P,Nice product,Nice product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3JV3H32K8WTOC,Effectiveness,mixed,"Customers have mixed experiences with the supplement's effectiveness, with some reporting positive results, while others mention it doesn't work effectively for weight loss.",10.0,6.0,4.0,"I picked up this MuscleBlaze L-Carnitine PRO to support my fat-loss and workout goals, so here's my take after using it for a few weeks....",support my fat-loss and workout goals,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2PPGOPTK3MMB2,"taste is good , but does not work effectively on weight loss if you had carb before or after having this , need to follow a very strict diet to have...",does not work effectively on weight loss,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2UKUY9WJDGRX7,...It has also supported my fat loss journey by helping me stay more active and push harder in my sessions....,supported my fat loss journey,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1XHSMJ6Z1IDKA,Not working at all Don't buy,Not working,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1V384QLUNH6UD,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,800+ bought in past month,yash,amzn1.account.AGL3WTZQESBNSI3U67KBZHNPWKGQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGL3WTZQESBNSI3U67KBZHNPWKGQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,After trying for more than few weeksAfter trying for more than few weeks,"I picked up this MuscleBlaze L-Carnitine PRO to support my fat-loss and workout goals, so here's my take after using it for a few weeks.First off, the taste is actually pretty decent - it comes in a Key Lime / lemon-lime flavour that's refreshing and not too sweet, which makes it easy to take daily.I've noticed a slight boost in energy during workouts. It doesn't feel like a pre-workout rush, but you feel a bit more ready to go, especially in morning or evening sessions. Other users have said it helps them feel more energetic and improves performance too.In terms of fat loss or weight management, it's not a magic solution - you still need proper diet and exercise. But taken consistently with a decent workout routine, it seems to help your body use fat more efficiently, which some buyers have noticed.",2026-01-15,1.0,Reviewed in India on 15 January 2026Reviewed in India on 15 January 2026,R2PPGOPTK3MMB2,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2PPGOPTK3MMB2/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,7 people found this helpful,0.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Tangy Orange, Size: 450 ml (Pack of 1), Flavour Name: Tangy Orange, Size: 450 ml (Pack of 1)",Taniya,amzn1.account.AEL53ZRALV4TGDUS6JTJPPIR42DQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEL53ZRALV4TGDUS6JTJPPIR42DQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Good product,Very good,2026-07-12,2.0,Reviewed in India on 12 July 2026,R3TKE6LQR5Z8F8,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3TKE6LQR5Z8F8/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,,,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Tangy Orange, Size: 450 ml (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Tangy Orange,Size,450 ml (Pack of 1),,,,,tanmay purohit,amzn1.account.AGGJLMSPVDTMYJAYLWFXHS32DMGA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGGJLMSPVDTMYJAYLWFXHS32DMGA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,3.0,okiesh--,"taste is good , but does not work effectively on weight loss if you had carb before or after having this , need to follow a very strict diet to have the impact of this , instead of this just focus on low carb and low suger diet and you will find result , and for energy have some pre-workout",2026-05-25,3.0,Reviewed in India on 25 May 2026,R2UKUY9WJDGRX7,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2UKUY9WJDGRX7/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,7 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/d3f74912-9f9e-4a20-9e6e-cdd00c1e8c6e._CR0%2C0%2C400%2C400_UX460_SX48_.jpg,"Flavour Name: Tangy Orange, Size: 450 ml (Pack of 1)",Ateet Chopra,amzn1.account.AG2EJNM7HCDZITHZYWT45AUNX44Q,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AG2EJNM7HCDZITHZYWT45AUNX44Q?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Effective Supplement Alongside Proper Diet & TrainingEffective Supplement Alongside Proper Diet & Training,"Been using MuscleBlaze L-Carnitine for sometime now and Iâ€™ve definitely noticed better energy levels during workouts and improved endurance, especially on longer or more intense training days. It has also supported my fat loss journey by helping me stay more active and push harder in my sessions.That said, this isnâ€™t a magic supplement. It works only when combined with proper nutrition, regular workouts, and an overall healthy lifestyle. Supplements can support the process, but consistency is what actually brings results.",2026-01-15,4.0,Reviewed in India on 15 January 2026Reviewed in India on 15 January 2026,R1XHSMJ6Z1IDKA,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1XHSMJ6Z1IDKA/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,5 people found this helpful,0.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Tangy Orange, Size: 450 ml (Pack of 1), Flavour Name: Tangy Orange, Size: 450 ml (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Tangy Orange,Size,450 ml (Pack of 1),dev chopra,amzn1.account.AGOMQ2GGO7GB2I365JF6A7JTDSPA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGOMQ2GGO7GB2I365JF6A7JTDSPA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Good product,Tastes good,2026-05-21,5.0,Reviewed in India on 21 May 2026,RGU8U5POEA2HS,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RGU8U5POEA2HS/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,One person found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Tangy Orange, Size: 450 ml (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Tangy Orang