ze Whey Protein to 180-210 ml of cold water or skimmed milk. Blend for 45-60 seconds for a thick and creamy shake. Take 1-2 protein shakes per day or follow your nutritionistâ€™s advice to build lean muscle.,,,,INTERNATIONAL GRADE WHEY: MuscleBlaze Whey Protein is made using international standard whey imported from the United States of America to help you with superior muscle gain and rapid recovery,"HIGH PROTEIN FOR SUPERIOR MUSCLE GAINS: MB Whey Protein powder is an advanced bodybuilding supplement that delivers 25 g of fast-absorbing protein, 5.5 g of BCAAs, and 11.7 g of EAAs per serving to assist superior muscle gains and fuel recovery post intense workout sessions","ENRICHED WITH DIGEZYME: This protein supplement for men and women contains DigeZyme, a digestive enzyme blend that enhances protein digestion and absorption so that you get the best out of your protein powder",WHEY PROTEIN CONCENTRATE & ISOLATE PROTEIN: This ultra-premium blend for bodybuilders and fitness champions contains Whey Protein Concentrate & Whey Protein Isolate. It supports speedy recovery post-workout,"APPETIZING FLAVOURS: This premium whey protein powder from MuscleBlaze is available in multiple appetizing flavours like Rich Milk Chocolate, Cafe Mocha, Vanilla, Strawberry, Cookies & Cream, Irish Cream, Smooth Chocolate, and Magical Mango to make a tasty health drink",,Flavor,Chocolate,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,"Build Lean Muscle, Muscle recovery, reduce fatigue, Improve protein digestion",Protein Source,Whey,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Package Type Name,Pouch,Age Range Description,Adult,Manufacturer Part Number,8906067021199,Model number,NUT1367-34,Item Nype Name,Whey Protein,Manufacturer,"Sapiens Labs || Zeon Lifesciences Ltd, Twilight Litaka Pharma Ltd., Village Dhana, Bagbania, Post Office Manpura, tehsil Baddi, Distt Solan (HP)-17410",Country of Origin,India,Manufacturer Contact Information,"Twilight Litaka Pharma Ltd., Village Dhana, Bagbania, Post Office Manpura, tehsil Baddi, Distt Solan (HP)-17410",Packer Contact Information,"Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana, Bagbania, Post Office Manpura, Tehsil Baddi, Distt. Solan (HP)-174101",Best Sellers Rank,"#4,471 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#73 in Whey Proteins",ASIN,B01H1L7I2I,Customer Reviews,"4.1 4.1 out of 5 stars (5,507) 4.1 out of 5 stars",Total Servings Per Container,29,Item Weight,1 Kilograms,Unit Count,1000.0 Grams,Number of Items,1,Item Dimensions,14.5 x 14.5 x 25.9 Centimeters,Recommended Uses For Product,Post-Workout,Is Discontinued By Manufacturer,No,Product Dimensions,14.51 x 14.5 x 25.94 cm; 1 kg,Date First Available,2016-06-14 00:00:00,Item model number,NUT1367-34,Packer,"Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana, Bagbania, Post Office Manpura, Tehsil Baddi, Distt. Solan (HP)-174101",Item Dimensions LxWxH,14.5 x 14.5 x 25.9 Centimeters,Net Quantity,1000.0 Grams,Generic Name,Whey Protein,,,,,,,,,,,Brand,MuscleBlaze,Flavour,Chocolate,Servings per Container,29,Item Weight,1 Kilograms,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,"Build Lean Muscle, Muscle recovery, reduce fatigue, Improve protein digestion",Protein Source,Whey,Net Quantity,1000.0 Grams,Recommended Uses For Product,Post-Workout,Number of Items,1,B00GWM3GSI,B01H1L7I2I,Chocolate 2 kg (Pack of 1),https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41s3+l25G8L._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71niFtvknxL._SL1500_.jpg,B00GWM3GSI,,Chocolate 1 kg (Pack of 1),https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lZ2KVr7GL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Kg39130xL._SL1500_.jpg,B01H1L7I2I,,https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B01H1L7I2I,True,"Tuesday, 21 July","Sunday, 19 July",,,,Flavour Name,Chocolate,Bright Lifecare Private Limited,ARU24JXUG3S4L,https://www.amazon.in/sp?seller=ARU24JXUG3S4L,,,4471.0,Health & Personal Care,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/ref=pd_zg_ts_hpc,73.0,Whey Proteins,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/11364606031/ref=pd_zg_hrsr_hpc,False,,,,Product Description,"Product Description_x000D_
MuscleBlaze Whey Protein â€“ Premium Protein to Fuel Your Gym Gains _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Whey Protein is a premium whey blend with whey protein isolate as the primary source of protein. This whey supplement gives you 25g of protein per serving which helps in faster muscle synthesis and muscle recovery after strenuous workouts. Your muscle gains depend upon the intensity of your everyday workouts followed by a protein-rich diet. MuscleBlaze Whey protein is made using premium quality raw materials imported from top-notch international sources to maintain high quality. _x000D_
Product Features _x000D_
25g Protein _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Whey Protein is a high protein supplement as it provides 25g of quality protein per serving. Whey Protein Isolate is the primary source of protein in this supplement, this protein when enters the body helps in the recovery of muscles undergone wear and tear during a workout. Immediate protein supplementation helps in faster recovery and boosts the muscle synthesis for lean mass gain. _x000D_
5.5g of BCAA _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Whey protein serves all three vital Branched Chain Amino Acids including leucine, isoleucine, and valine. These BCAAs help in faster muscle recovery and minimize the muscle fatigue during the workout. Fueling your muscles with apt BCAAs helps build focus and minimize catabolism for a better workout. _x000D_
4.3g Glutamic Acid _x000D_
Glutamic acid is a non-essential amino acid. Consuming glutamic acid during or before a workout helps in the synthesis of nitric oxide in the body which helps in the nerve cell volumization to facilitate transportation of nutrients rich blood to the muscles under repair. It also helps in maintaining a positive anabolic state in the body. _x000D_
Enhanced Protein Digestion with DigeZyme _x000D_
Protein digestion has always been a concern for fitness enthusiasts as if gone wrong, it can cause utter discomfort. MuscleBlaze Whey Protein is enriched with DigeZyme, a blend of five digestive enzymes including amylase, protease, lipase, cellulase, and lactase. These digestive enzymes help in enhanced digestion of protein minimizing the digestive discomfort. It also helps in maximum absorption of protein and other vital nutrients for superior lean mass gain. _x000D_
International grade quality with guaranteed authenticity _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Whey Protein is made using international grade quality raw materials imported form top-notch whey manufacturers. It helps us keep up with a quality check and maintain a safety standard to assure the best from the house of MuscleBlaze. We are also the pioneers in assuring guaranteed authenticity check for our products by providing a unique verification code with each product. It is easy to check the authenticity of the product through the official MuscleBlaze website.",whey isolate protein powder best bodybuilding supplement health drink post workout muscleblaze,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/afa79381-da00-4b78-8219-d16df8591001.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/7a5fb767-b534-4219-8b23-1776d96aa907.__CR0,0,1251,1251_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/ddc3b6ff-3342-4150-8227-e10c8f7bbbc8.__CR0,0,1251,1251_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/7a1bd070-b593-4bf2-86cd-5f2570da6290.__CR0,8,1243,1243_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",Protein digestion,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/53701133-ffdd-4e01-b541-e71af596717e.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",International grade Quality,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/d3950076-8f89-48cf-a097-016da216d426.__CR0,0,1251,1251_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",module-12,,whey isolate protein powder best bodybuilding supplement health drink post workout muscleblaze,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/afa79381-da00-4b78-8219-d16df8591001.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",basic-module-13-text,,MuscleBlaze Whey Protein is a premium whey blend with whey protein isolate as the primary source of protein. This whey supplement gives you 25g of protein per serving which helps in faster muscle synthesis and muscle recovery after strenuous workouts. Your muscle gains depend upon the intensity of your everyday workouts followed by a protein-rich diet. MuscleBlaze Whey protein is made using premium quality raw materials imported from top-notch international sources to maintain high quality.,module-9,Product Features,25g Protein,"MuscleBlaze Whey Protein is a high protein supplement as it provides 25g of quality protein per serving. Whey Protein Isolate is the primary source of protein in this supplement, this protein when enters the body helps in the recovery of muscles undergone wear and tear during a workout. Immediate protein supplementation helps in faster recovery and boosts the muscle synthesis for lean mass gain.",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/7a5fb767-b534-4219-8b23-1776d96aa907.__CR0,0,1251,1251_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",5.5g of BCAA,"MuscleBlaze Whey protein serves all three vital Branched Chain Amino Acids including leucine, isoleucine, and valine. These BCAAs help in faster muscle recovery and minimize the muscle fatigue during the workout. Fueling your muscles with apt BCAAs helps build focus and minimize catabolism for a better workout.",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/ddc3b6ff-3342-4150-8227-e10c8f7bbbc8.__CR0,0,1251,1251_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",4.3g Glutamic Acid,Glutamic acid is a non-essential amino acid. Consuming glutamic acid during or before a workout helps in the synthesis of nitric oxide in the body which helps in the nerve cell volumization to facilitate transportation of nutrients rich blood to the muscles under repair. It also helps in maintaining a positive anabolic state in the body.,i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/7a1bd070-b593-4bf2-86cd-5f2570da6290.__CR0,8,1243,1243_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",module-2,Enhanced Protein Digestion with DigeZyme,,"Protein digestion has always been a concern for fitness enthusiasts as if gone wrong, it can cause utter discomfort. MuscleBlaze Whey Protein is enriched with DigeZyme, a blend of five digestive enzymes including amylase, protease, lipase, cellulase, and lactase. These digestive enzymes help in enhanced digestion of protein minimizing the digestive discomfort. It also helps in maximum absorption of protein and other vital nutrients for superior lean mass gain.",Protein digestion,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/53701133-ffdd-4e01-b541-e71af596717e.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",module-3,International grade quality with guaranteed authenticity,,MuscleBlaze Whey Protein is made using international grade quality raw materials imported form top-notch whey manufacturers. It helps us keep up with a quality check and maintain a safety standard to assure the best from the house of MuscleBlaze. We are also the pioneers in assuring guaranteed authenticity check for our products by providing a unique verification code with each product. It is easy to check the authenticity of the product through the official MuscleBlaze website.,International grade Quality,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/d3950076-8f89-48cf-a097-016da216d426.__CR0,0,1251,1251_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",,,"Customers find this protein powder to be genuine and effective for muscle recovery, with positive feedback about its value for money and suitability for beginners. The product mixes well in water, particularly with milk, and customers appreciate its quality, with one noting it contains pure whey with amino acids. The taste receives mixed reviews, with some finding it awesome while others say it's too sweet. The authenticity of the product also gets mixed feedback, with some confirming it's genuine while others suspect it's fake.",Quality,positive,"Customers find the protein powder to be of good quality, with one customer noting it matches the quality of leading brands.",462.0,399.0,63.0,"...Itâ€™s very good. Overall, a good product as Iâ€™veu used other international brands like ON and MuscleTech. And Muscleblaze is also a very good protein",good product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3C7X8O9ICQL27,...was tightly sealed and when I checked I found out that it was a genuine product. Taste of this protein powder is somewhat okay....,genuine product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1FKFE4M2GZFWP,Nice product. I really see the difference. Other better options are present but you wont regret buying this one too.,Nice product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R24HUQY6ZSY2QS,Great product. Worth the price. Taste is good but not as good as ON. But that isn't the top most criteria when choosing a protein powder. So 5/5,Great product,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3P9K7F724YEG0,Value for money,positive,"Customers find the protein powder to be worth the price, particularly noting its value for beginners and rookies.",150.0,121.0,29.0,...Itâ€™s a excellent product with pleasant taste... value for money. Thanks to Amazon and Guardian on delivering the product within said time frame,value for money,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/ROJMSMRYSDQ9I,"Hi all, This is the best whey protein with a reasonable price. Taste is also good. It does the job. Just go for it",reasonable price,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R327LOMFAKLMEQ,Very Good.... Worth the Money. Need to be coupled with Excercise as well to reap benefits as I did.,Worth the Money,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RYPQUMQL2NF88,Very good whey protein product..it is cheap and high quality.,cheap,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3QBF5UK14ZT0G,Effectiveness,positive,"Customers find the protein powder effective, particularly for muscle recovery and fitness improvement, with one customer noting it helps bring out the results of hard work.",149.0,122.0,27.0,Nice product. Nice taste. Good results. I am feeling the pump and strength in my muscles.,Good results,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3UCV8DE9H31YJ,"...product value of money, good Price, main thing it's natural, and good result, no side effect, 100% natural products, and fast result also, my...",good result,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1O5F3ZI4FMDTU,Nice product. Very effective. Only for leaning muscles not mass gainer. Good taste/flavour... Value for money...,Very effective,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1K8WQC22XSX75,Effective and dissolve easlily in water..,Effective,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3VK03SZPMHOTW,Mixability,positive,"Customers find that the protein powder mixes well, particularly with water and milk, though one customer notes it takes time to dissolve in water.",69.0,51.0,18.0,"I give about 4 out of 5 for this product. Taste, mixability and packaging is of International standards. Comes @ a low price....",mixability,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3S7SFCQ2SKDL4,"...for a month...Had Rich Milk chocolate flavour.....tastes okay....mixability is good, can't compare to others as it's my 1st time having whey protein...",mixability is good,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2V602STZ9SE6Y,"Poor taste, poor mixability,HIGH CHOLESTEROL,HIGH PRICE..... better go for ultimate nutrition",poor mixability,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R11ELD0JAWL65J,"It tastes really good and mixes well with water, milk. I have seen good results using this product....",mixes well with water,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RRMLE0ACBHN3M,Protein quality,positive,"Customers appreciate the protein quality of this supplement, with one customer noting it contains pure whey with amino acids, while another describes it as the best option in whey protein blends.",61.0,56.0,5.0,Good protein I like it and it's good result... Everybody should take this protein.,Good protein,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R174D4P41HFGMJ,This is a good whey protein.bt i have to return cause my packaging was damaged.thanks amazon.and thanks muscleblaze for return this.very good...,good whey protein,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RT4HK6WKYBTCL,Best protein in terms of absorbency and thickness but chocolate flavour is the worst a big no for chocolate flavour but a yes for work it does.,Best protein,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2PJDQ6W8EMYE2,"Hi all, This is the best whey protein with a reasonable price. Taste is also good. It does the job. Just go for it",best whey protein,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R327LOMFAKLMEQ,100+ bought in past month,Aakashh M Revadi,amzn1.account.AEEIOQROWFZGKCV6GQVV47WLQTNQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEEIOQROWFZGKCV6GQVV47WLQTNQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Best protein powder ever used!,"I don't really understand the negative comments here! People leaving negative reviews are probably newbies and have no clue how to use this product I'm afraid!I've used Optimum Nutrition and XS Whey Protein powder (by Amway) before but they were burning a hole in my pocket, so I went for muscleblaze this time and I have absolutely no regrets! I got twice the quantity for Rs. 1000 less! I really wish I had used MB before, would have saved much more while getting the same, if not better gains! The taste, the strength it gives me, the mixability is top notch! It tastes like chocolate milk shake with cold milk! Worth every penny! MB got a fan for life!",2020-06-19,1.0,Reviewed in India on 19 June 2020,RV2DLK7HICEV0,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RV2DLK7HICEV0/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,163 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,,Sam,amzn1.account.AEUE5E5THJS3ZVA4NHZWG6QIYLDQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEUE5E5THJS3ZVA4NHZWG6QIYLDQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,Good Protein Supplement,"Mixes easily and has a pleasant chocolate flavor. Offers 25g of protein per scoop, helpful for post-workout recovery. Packaging is sturdy and convenient. Overall, a reasonable choice for daily protein intake. Occasionally, I feel some bloating after drinking, not sure why.",2025-10-10,2.0,Reviewed in India on 10 October 2025,R2RHRO8A0FZFHS,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2RHRO8A0FZFHS/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,,,3 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/602d23af-daec-4b1a-b238-667af41a05f1._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_SX48_.jpg,"Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 2 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Chocolate,Size,2 kg (Pack of 1),,,,,Amit,amzn1.account.AGV7FJSHJMK37T4CL2UMGSMCOBQA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGV7FJSHJMK37T4CL2UMGSMCOBQA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Guaranteed Genuine and Tasty.,"I have been using Optimum's 100% whey for quite sometime, however every time I bought it I was not sure whether is is genuine or counterfeit. That dilemma was always there. There enters Muscleblaze Whey Protein. I was really impressed by the way the product comes with a scratch code, whereby which you can check the genuineness of the product. Not nothings better than being sure that you are having something original. As far as the quality is concerned the taste is awesome, and the shake is really thick. Going by what it claims to have, I am sure the matches in quality to any leading brand if not surpasses it. Lastly being made in India, it does saves on the money part as there are no excise duties. Would strongly recommend it.",2017-03-26,3.0,Reviewed in India on 26 March 2017,R1TUS8S78FEIJL,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1TUS8S78FEIJL/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,6 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,,Veeresh,amzn1.account.AEUHL6RDZ2QXMLQ5SLYFXL6WAZNA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEUHL6RDZ2QXMLQ5SLYFXL6WAZNA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,3.0,Overpriced,"It's good, rich milk chocolate, at first the taste was awful & felt like spitting it out. But when i added honey, it was better. And eventually, you may get addicted for this drink.Anyways, 5-8 eggs are completely fine in replacement for this if you cannot afford it everytime.I didn't try other brands, so cannot compare.",2022-10-14,4.0,Reviewed in India on 14 October 2022,RPOO15E1PV5VP,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RPOO15E1PV5VP/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,8 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Chocolate,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),Manoj Kumar,amzn1.account.AGT5YPNPXD4J4K6WQWQ5QW6UBJXA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGT5YPNPXD4J4K6WQWQ5QW6UBJXA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Great product. Container could be designed better.,"It's a good product overall.The tub wasn't easy to open at first. But the powder inside was good and was sealed in a plastic bag with a muscleblaze ziptie.Absorbency/Mixability is good. However, there is formation of a few small lumps after mixing. They go away after some time.Make sure you check if the seller you're buying from is Muscleblaze itself and if it is fulfilled by Amazon. That's how you make sure you get the original of this. I only wrote this part because of people who got fakes and have uploaded the images in the reviews.",2019-06-12,5.0,Reviewed in India on 12 June 2019,R3L2U3N7IKUHMC,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3L2U3N7IKUHMC/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,3 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,,,,,,Obaid Imtiyazul Haque,amzn1.account.AHUQ5TCKDIQ2DEQRW3NCBNIMNKUQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHUQ5TCKDIQ2DEQRW3NCBNIMNKUQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,1.0,"Doctor's Advice: Don't buy - No customer support or accountability, allergies to biozyme.","When I first used the product, I did not pay attention that it contains biozyme. The claim that muscleblaze makes is that it contains a mixture of digestive enzymes - protease (for protein breakdown), amylase (for carbohydrates), lactase (for lactose breakdown), lipase (for lipids and fats), and cellulase (for starch).The problem that I find, as a medical professional, is that you do not need these enzymes to digest food and consuming them on a long term basis can potentially lead to developing resistance against these enzymes. These enzymes can be antigenic and body can mount immune response against them leading to gut issues.When I first started consuming the Whey, I developed loose stools, bloating, and allergies. After a thorough review, I found the culprit to be the digezyme in the Whey. I tried to contact the customer service of Muscleblaze via email several times, but got no response.I aim to warn those who consume this product for a long term basis, that it can lead to serious health issues. You do not need enzymes to digest the whey protein. The whole point of consuming ""whey"" is that it is already broken down, and is easily digestible. I work as a clinician researcher in the United States and will publish the data regarding the same. Stop consuming unnecessary supplements and ask the companies to be more accountable and responsive to customers.",2023-02-02,6.0,Reviewed in India on 2 February 2023,R3URFKPX4MCRM9,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3URFKPX4MCRM9/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,25 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 2 kg (Pack of 1)",Ahmed Mehta,amzn1.account.AHFMPFBCHZQEEKYTUUD5GVL7CN7Q,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHFMPFBCHZQEEKYTUUD5GVL7CN7Q?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,Good protein supplementGood protein supplement,"Taste is not that great, its a little powdery. The product is genuine though. The whey protein does desolve easily in water, I dont really know about milk. I got this @1816/- so its reasonably priced and provides a blend of both whey protein concentrate and whey protein isolate, 25gms of protein and 5.5gms of BCAA. I've been using this for 10 days now, so far so good. No digestion issues, no side effects. I do feel faster muscle recovery so im ready and active to go to the gym the next day after a heavy workout. Note that you consume this product only with proper diet, nutrition and with regular exercise.",2018-07-15,7.0,Reviewed in India on 15 July 2018Reviewed in India on 15 July 2018,RWSMAVK7PAZ6O,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RWSMAVK7PAZ6O/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,2 people found this helpful,0.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/d8b5ee82-b145-4619-a22b-ebad2056a51a._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_SX48_.jpg,"Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1), Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 1 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Chocolate,Size,1 kg (Pack of 1),Abhijeet D Joshi,amzn1.account.AGCGVBHMHDYO7V4TYBWC4YRWRTKQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGCGVBHMHDYO7V4TYBWC4YRWRTKQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,"Authentication check provided by company is awesome, I checked it turn out to be authenticate ...","I am a swimmer, I have purchased this product to consume post swimming. I must say, as soon as I open box (not even bottle), i could smell protein, it was so fresh. Authentication check provided by company is awesome, I checked it turn out to be authenticate and to my surprise, the manufacture was just a week earlier, as if it was delivered right after manufacturing.Usually there is fear that product may turn out to be stale dated. But here no worries.Powder mixes uniformly with water without forming any lumps and if you add the right quantity of water and shake it well, the mixture will be thick and very tasty (literally feels like not wasting a single drop). When I consume it post workout, I feel my stomach is full and dont feel hungry for almost 90min. I do not expect any dramatic improvements in my built yet as I just swim, but can feel the difference in shoulder and back. I really like the product and looking forward to purchase it next time. Not sure if I should try new flavor as Chocolate flavor (my current flavour) is so goodWell, what i do feel needs to be improved is delivery time. For God sake I am purchasing a product worth 4K so Amazon can afford a faster delivery. Rest 10 out of 10.",2016-06-13,8.0,Reviewed in India on 13 June 2016,R59QKGT1TSOGS,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R59QKGT1TSOGS/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,3 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,,"Flavour Name: Chocolate, Size: 2 kg (Pack of 1)",Flavour Name,Chocolate,Size,2 kg (Pack of 1),Delivering to Mumbai 400057 Update location,IN,https://www.amazon.in/s?k=Muscleblaze&crid=2JII973B9FZAX&sprefix=muscleblaze%2Caps%2C253&ref=nb_sb_noss_2&s=popularity-rank,1,,False,,36,https://www.amazon.in/s?k=Muscleblaze&crid=2JII973B9FZAX&sprefix=muscleblaze%2Caps%2C253&ref=nb_sb_noss_2,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Flavour Name,Chocolate,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q2F0p0izL._SL1500_.jpg,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Suitable for beginners,positive,"Customers find this protein powder suitable for beginners, particularly noting its usefulness in the gym and as a post-workout supplement.",52.0,50.0,2.0,...Taste is slightly different. Quality of protein is very low. Best for beginners....,Best for beginners,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3G3XE12PD5JP3,"This is good for beginners. If i put two scoops with more water, lumps start forming (even in my gym bottle). I dont know why....",good for beginners,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2XICM2I69M410,"Whey protein are not meant to be so sweety, but its very good for beginners",very good for beginners,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R29JULDV2RD0L9,Best protein for beginners,Best protein for beginners,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RT51I6LB0SU46,Taste,mixed,"Customers have mixed opinions about the protein powder's taste, with some finding it awesome while others say it's not good and has too much sweetness.",341.0,226.0,115.0,..