MuscleBlaze Tornado Shaker _x000D_
If you're looking to take your fitness game to the next level, MuscleBlaze Tornado Shaker is the perfect companion to fuel your inner champion mindset. _x000D_
LeakProof _x000D_
With a generous 500 ml capacity and a leakproof cap, MuscleBlaze Gym Shaker lets you take your pre-workout/BCAA/protein shake on the go without any random spills. _x000D_
Tornado Blender for Hassle-Free Mixing _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Tornado Shaker boasts of a tornado blender that ensures a seamless blend of your favourite supplements, helping you achieve peak performance. _x000D_
Supplement Storage Compartment _x000D_
