"MuscleBlaze BCAA Gold 8:1:1 Powder, Fruit Punch (60 Servings, 450g) | With Higher Leucine, Electrolytes & Glutamine",https://www.amazon.in/dp/B082MGWYRF,B082MGWYRF,B082MGWYRF,2239.0,â‚¹,True,In stock,2799.0,â‚¹,MuscleBlaze,,,4.2,0.58,0.23,0.11,0.05,0.03,205.0,,"Health & Personal Care > Diet & Nutrition > Vitamins, Minerals & Supplements > Amino Acids > BCAAs",1,Visit the MuscleBlaze Store,https://www.amazon.in/stores/MuscleBlaze/page/9A784926-3F81-400C-8D18-DDF7BBE45F17?lp_asin=B082MGWYRF&ref_=ast_bln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandlogo_sto,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-Qc1fJe3L._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-Qc1fJe3L._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41aXfg541hL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lqVP60fFL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JLxnuww2L._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PcZHDxXXL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xZfVMOXVL._SS.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611WLegSvjL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jCxCc5tiL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QTrJAQfcL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ETSpdbqLL._SL1200_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J1ESMnwkL._SL1500_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D9g-DqDEL._SL1500_.jpg,Important information,Safety Information:,"Consult your healthcare professional before using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking any medication or have a medical condition. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease or health condition.",,Ingredients:,"Branched Chain Amino Acids Powder (L-Leucine, L-Isoleucine & L-Valine), L- Glutamine, Natural Flavouring Substance, L- Citrulline DL- Malate (2:1), Orange Fruit Powder, Trisodium Citrate Anhydrous, Acidity Regulator (INS 296), Potassium Chloride, Sodium Chloride, Sweetener (INS 955), Nature Identical Flavouring Substances & Synthetic Food Colour (INS 124).",,Directions:,Add 1 level scoop in chilled water in volume as per your liking.,,,"MuscleBlaze BCAA Gold is a breakthrough intra-workout supplement with an 8:1:1 ratio of Branched Chain Amino Acids including Leucine, Isoleucine, and Valine respectively. It delivers higher Leucine content as compared to other common BCAA supplements which have a 2:1:1 ratio with 2 parts of leucine over 1 part each for the other two BCAAs. A higher leucine content in your intra-workout drink may prove a game-changer as it activates the complex muscle building pathways when the body undergoes a heavy-duty workout. It enhances the synthesis of protein in the muscles. Thus, helping in lean mass gain and faster muscle recovery.  Staying hydrated during these intense workout sessions is extremely important. Therefore, MB BCAA Gold contains electrolytes that help maintain the electrolyte and water balance in the body during workouts to prevent dehydration. To make your workouts even more exciting, this BCAA energy drink is available in refreshing flavour options like Green Apple, Raspberry Lemonade, Watermelon, and Fruit Punch.","8:1:1 BCAAs RATIO: MuscleBlaze BCAA Gold is a powerful intra-workout supplement. It contains Leucine, Isoleucine, and Valine in the ratio of 8:1:1 respectively unlike the 2:1:1 ratio that is commonly available BCAA supplements",3.5 GRAMS OF BCAAs: This BCAA supplement for men and women provides 3.5g of BCAAs. It has a higher leucine content i.e. 2.8g per serving that helps in the rapid transportation of amino acids to the muscles to prevent catabolism,SUPERIOR MUSCLE PUMP: This BCAA supplement is a good intra-workout drink that contains active ingredients for superior muscle pump to enhance the transportation and absorption of nutrients to muscles under repair for athletes and bodybuilders,ELECTROLYTES FOR HYDRATION: MB BCAA Gold contains electrolytes that help maintain the electrolyte and water balance in the body during workouts to prevent dehydration,"MULTIPLE FLAVOURS: This BCAA energy drink is available in refreshing flavour options like Green Apple, Raspberry Lemonade, Watermelon, and Fruit Punch to make your workouts more exciting.","NOTE FROM AMAZON: This product is protected by Transparency, which verifies a unitâ€™s authenticity and enables you to view rich information about the product you purchased. When you receive your product, please look for the Transparency logo and code, which is printed on the productâ€™s cover. You can scan it to verify its authenticity with the Transparency app or Amazon shopping app. To download the Transparency app or Amazon shopping app, get it on the App Store or Google Play.",Brand,MuscleBlaze,Primary Supplement Type,Amino Acids,Item Form,Powder,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,"Instant Energy, Faster recovery, Hydration",Age Range Description,Adult,Container Type,Jar,Dosage Form,Powder,Country of Origin,India,Manufacturer,"Maxcure Nutravedics Limited., Plot No-13, Sector-6A, I.I.E, Sidcul, Ranipur, Hardwar, Uttarakhand-249403, Maxcure Nutravedics Ltd.",Item Nype Name,BCAA Gold,Manufacturer Contact Information,"Maxcure Nutravedics Limited., Plot No-13, Sector-6A, I.I.E, Sidcul, Ranipur, Hardwar, Uttarakhand-249403",Model number,NUT5941-04,Packer Contact Information,"Maxcure Nutravedics Limited., Plot No-13, Sector-6A, I.I.E, Sidcul, Ranipur, Hardwar, Uttarakhand-249403",Manufacturer Part Number,NUT5941-04,Best Sellers Rank,"#11,963 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#19 in BCAAs",ASIN,B082MGWYRF,Customer Reviews,4.2 4.2 out of 5 stars (205) 4.2 out of 5 stars,Unit Count,450.0 Grams,Item Weight,450 Grams,Item Dimensions,22.9 x 16.5 x 12.7 Centimeters,Number of Items,1,Total Servings Per Container,30,Flavor,Fruit Punch,Special Ingredients,L-Leucine,Material Features,Vegetarian,Usage,"Energy Management, Hydration",Colour,Multicolour,Is Discontinued By Manufacturer,No,Product Dimensions,22.9 x 16.5 x 12.7 cm; 450 g,Date First Available,2019-01-30 00:00:00,Item model numb