coop (100g) in 300ml chilled milk and blend for a minute to get rich chocolate shake. Recommended 02 servings a day (Morning & Evening) or as suggested by your dietitian,,,,HIGH-QUALITY PROTEIN: MuscleBlaze High Protein Gold Gainer is exquisitely formulated for bodybuilders and athletes with high-quality protein for both quick and slow delivery of energy. It contains whey protein concentrate and whey protein isolate & provides 69 g protein in 2 servings with milk,"FUELS THE BODY WITH SUPERIOR CARBS: With superior carbohydrate sources such as Palatinose, Oat Fiber and Oat flour the energy is delivered to the body in a more balanced and effective manner. It contains no added sugars and fuels the body with 909 clean calories",PROPRIETARY ENZYME BLEND: MB High Protein Gold Gainer also has a proprietary enzyme blend proven to improve the efficiency of the gainer by better digestion and absorption,BOOSTS PERFORMANCE: This mass gainer provides 3000 mg of creatine monohydrate that helps increase strength & power and 2000 mg of MCT that helps burn fat to deliver more energy to the body. MCT also helps increase appetite,TASTE THE GAINS: This muscle mass gainer is available in scrumptious Chocolate flavour.,"NOTE FROM AMAZON: This product is protected by Transparency, which verifies a unitâ€™s authenticity and enables you to view rich information about the product you purchased. When you receive your product, please look for the Transparency logo and code, which is printed on the productâ€™s cover. You can scan it to verify its authenticity with the Transparency app or Amazon shopping app. To download the Transparency app or Amazon shopping app, get it on the App Store or Google Play.",Brand,MuscleBlaze,Primary Supplement Type,Protein,Item Form,Powder,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Product Benefits,Muscle Growth,Age Range Description,Adult,Container Type,Jar,Dosage Form,Powder,Country of Origin,India,Manufacturer,"Sapiens Labs, Sapiens Labs, Village Dhana-Bagbania, P.O.Manpura, Tehsil N