se,,,,Product Description,"Product Description_x000D_
MuscleBlaze Gold Gainer â€“ The Gold Standard of Mass Gainers _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Gold Gainer XXL is a unique formula that is formulated to cure your affiliation for mass gains. With each serving of this unique mass gain formula you get 445 calories and 37.5g protein. The calories are derived from the cleanest sources. The product also fuels you with 6.5g BCAAs per serving that helps in muscle growth. _x000D_
It delivers 1500mg Creatine Monohydrate that helps in boosting your performance. 2000mg MCTs per serving helps in burning more fat and energize. The product is free from any added sugar or trans fats. _x000D_
Product Features _x000D_
445 Calories per serve _x000D_
Each serving of MuscleBlaze Gold Gainer XXL fuels you with 445 calories. These calories are sourced from a blend of simple & complex carbs that provide a steady supply for energy to fuel your workout. The product has zero added sugar which implies that the calories are garnered from the cleanest sources. _x000D_
37.5g Protein per serve _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Gold Gainer XXL fuels you with 37.5g protein that helps you with your goal of muscle building and helps with mass gains. The protein in this unique formula is derived from whey and micellar casein to serve you nothing but the best. _x000D_
6.5g BCAAs per serve _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Gold Gainer XXL offers you 6.5g BCAAs per serving that helps in muscle growth. These BCAAs help in triggering muscle protein synthesis that assists in muscle recovery and helps reduce fatigue and muscle soreness. _x000D_
1500mg Creatine per serve _x000D_
With every serving of MuscleBlaze Gold Gainer XXL you get 1500mg of Creatine Monohydrate that works as a performance booster. Creatine also helps in enhancing the strength and helps your muscles to generate energy during heavy-duty workout. _x000D_
2000mg MCTs per serve _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Gold Gainer XXL provides you with 2000mg of MCT (Medium Chain Triglycerides) with every serving. It helps in enhancing the fat burning and helps you attain your goal of mass gain. It also helps in reducing muscle catabolism (breakdown of muscles) and enhances protein synthesis. _x000D_
Digestive Enzyme Blend _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Gold Gainer XXL presents a perfect blend of various digestive enzymes that help in better digestion and absorption of nutrients and reduces the digestion-related discomfort so that you can meet your goal of mass gain effortlessly.",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/45503628-4a1f-4df2-b341-3818fc73d708.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",imz,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/d7493205-6848-41cc-9303-2b1a8e616edc.__CR0,0,576,576_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/64188250-3fa1-4c46-8ef9-4387d6998b0f.__CR0,0,576,576_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/5c69da8b-ccf6-41cb-b61a-f537651509e8.__CR0,0,576,576_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/8dd24b1e-89b8-4b27-891e-b804bd030b24.__CR0,0,576,576_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media/sc/8b16c12f-8bcc-47b8-97c0-646c673cb150.__CR1,0,576,576_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",3p-module-b,,i,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/45503628-4a1f-4df2-b341-3818fc73d708.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",basic-module-13-text,,"MuscleBlaze Gold Gainer XXL is a unique formula that is formulated to cure your affiliation for mass gains. With each serving of this unique mass gain formula you get 445 calories and 37.5g protein. The calories are derived from the cleanest sources. The product also fuels you with 6.5g BCAAs per serving that helps in muscle growth. _x000D_
