ergonomic carry loop and the lightweight of the bottle make it easy to carry. The mixing ball ensures lump-free protein and BCAAs supplement shakes. The measurement markings on the bottle help in keeping a track of your portions. The blender bottle has a round base to make it easy to clean so that there is no odour or residue. Because of its multiple features, you can also carry this sipper bottle with you while hiking, camping, biking, travelling, or to work.","PERFECT GYM ACCESSORY: MuscleBlaze Phirse Zidd Kar Shaker with 600 ml capacity is a perfect fit as your gym accessory. Use it as a water bottle, BCAA or protein supplement bottle. It also includes measurement markings to keep track of the quantity",LEAKPROOF & ERGONOMIC CARRY LOOP: This shaker bottle for gym is 100% leakproof and has an ergonomic carry loop to easily carry it around,HASSLE-FREE MIXING: MuscleBlaze shaker comes with a plastic whisk ball for consistent and lump-free drinks enhancing supplement absorption,SPOUT GUARD & EASY CLEANING: This shaker bottle has a spout guard to protect the drinking nozzle from dirty hands. It is dishwasher safe and has a round base for ease of cleaning,"BPA-FREE MULTIPURPOSE BOTTLE: The shaker is made of safe, durable, and BPA- free plastic for everyday use. As it is easy to carry, it can be used for hiking, camping, biking, travelling, etc",,Brand Name,MuscleBlaze,Country of Publication,China,Manufacturer,"Bright Lifecare Pvt. Ltd., Plot No. 132, Sector 5, IMT Maneswar, Gurugram (Haryana)-122052, MuscleBlaze",Model Number,NUT7307-01,Manufacturer Part Number,NUT7307-01,Item Type Name,Bottle,Manufacturer Contact Information,"Bright Lifecare Pvt. Ltd., Plot No. 132, Sector 5, IMT Maneswar, Gurugram (Haryana)-122052",Included Components,Bottle,Age Range Description,Adult,Packer Contact Information,"Bright Lifecare Pvt. Ltd., Plot No. 132, Sector 5, IMT Maneswar, Gurugram (Haryana)-122052",Best Sellers Rank,"#152,508 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Pe