MuscleBlaze Wrist Support for Better Strength & Stability! _x000D_
We at MuscleBlaze believe that you need to push beyond your limits, limits that you never imagined existed. Introducing MB Wrist Support for men and women to provide comfortable and optimum support to push you above and beyond. _x000D_
Features of MuscleBlaze Wrist Support _x000D_
18â€ of Premium Cotton Blend Elastic _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Wrist Support is 18 inches in length, long enough to provide you with added support & stability while you train harder to become stronger! _x000D_
Long Lasting Velcro _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Wrist Support also comes with high-grade velcro to provide complete support while maintaining flexibility during physical activities. _x000D_
