aturing the innovative Enhanced Absorption Formula (EAF), it delivers 50% higher protein absorption, optimizing muscle recovery and eliminating protein digestion challenges.","Smooth, Lump-Free Shake Every Time â€” Convenient cyclone blender shaker with built-in mixer ensures smooth protein mixes, no clumps, and a leak-proof design for workout bags â€” great for gym, travel, or daily hydration.","Most Tested Whey for Unmatched Trust: 100% blind tested by Labdoor (USA), Informed Choice (UK), and Trustified Gold (India), ensuring accurate label claims and purity. Free from heavy metals, aflatoxins, banned substances, pesticides, and steroids. Each batch is also NABL-tested, with reports published on the MuscleBlaze website for complete transparency.","BPA-Free & Durable Plastic â€” Made from high-quality BPA-free plastic, this gym shaker bottle is not only safe but also highly durable, ensuring that it can handle even the most intense workouts","India's 1st clinically proven whey protein: Biozyme Performance whey is proven for superior absorption and enhanced muscle-building efficacy. The results of the clinical study, registered with the ICMR's Clinical Trials Registry - India, highlight its effectiveness in reducing stomach discomfort commonly associated with high-protein digestion.",Brand,MuscleBlaze,Best Sellers Rank,"#6,155 in Health & Personal Care (See Top 100 in Health & Personal Care)#100 in Whey Proteins",ASIN,B0GNS675V8,Customer Reviews,4.2 4.2 out of 5 stars (3) 4.2 out of 5 stars,Date First Available,2023-06-16 00:00:00,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,https://www.amazon.in/product-reviews/B0GNS675V8,True,"Sunday, 19 July",,,,,,,Bright Lifecare Private Limited,ARU24JXUG3S4L,https://www.amazon.in/sp?seller=ARU24JXUG3S4L,,,6155.0,Health & Personal Care,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/ref=pd_zg_ts_hpc,100.0,Whey Proteins,https://www.amazon.in/gp/bestsellers/hpc/11364606031/ref=pd_zg_hrsr_h