u do not rely solely on the information presented here and that you always read labels, warnings, and directions before using or consuming a product.",,,,12 g PROTEIN: Sort out your healthy breakfast and guilt-free snacking with high protein content in MB Fit Instant Oats. Protein is a macronutrient that is needed for muscle repair & growth & keeps you satiated for longer,HIGH-FIBRE ROLLED OATS: MuscleBlaze Fit Instant Oats provides 10.51 g of dietary fibre per 100 g of serving so that you enjoy greater satiety and stay active for longer. Fibre also improves digestion,"NUTRIENT-RICH BREAKFAST AND SNACKING: This natural superfood is nutrient-rich to provide a healthy and balanced start to your day with essential minerals like Iron, Magnesium, and Zinc. Rolled oats are also loaded with antioxidants and help enhance immunity and skin health","NO ADDED SUGAR OR PRESERVATIVES: In this jarful of 100% rolled oats, you get pure nutrient-rich oats with no added sugar and preservatives","VERSATILE TREAT: Choose a healthy lifestyle and rediscover taste with the versatility that rolled oats have to offer. Whip up some flavourful oats pancakes, oats idli, oats upma, oats dosa, porridge, and more","WARNING: Oats is naturally gluten-free, but since our instant oats are processed in a facility that process wheat and tree nuts, it might contain traces of the same",Brand Name,MuscleBlaze,Diet Type,Vegetarian,Item Form,Flakes,Specialty,"Gluten Free, High Protein, No Added Sugar",Coin Variety 1,Breakfast Cereal,Allergen Information,Oat,Manufacturer,"H-550,551,716, Phase â€“ 1, Industrial Area, Bhiwadi, Alwar, Rajasthan-301019, VLS Food Pvt. Ltd.",Part Number,8906116956243,Model Number,8906116956243,Country of Origin,India,Item Type Name,Instant Oats,Packer Contact Information,"VLS Food Pvt. Ltd., H-550, 551, 716, Phase-1 industrial Area, Bhiwadi (Rajasthan)-301019 India",Container Type,Jar,Importer Contact Information,"VLS Food Pvt. Ltd., H-550, 551, 716, Phase-1 industrial Area, Bhiwa