High Protein _x000D_
Packed with a remarkable 12 g of protein, MuscleBlaze Instant Rolled Oats are a go-to choice for a protein-packed breakfast or snack _x000D_
Rich in Fibre _x000D_
Our rolled oats also boast an impressive 10.5 g of dietary fibre to keep your digestive system happy and keep you feeling fuller for longer. _x000D_
100% Wholegrain _x000D_
We've steered clear of adding any sugar, preservatives, or artificial additives, ensuring that what you get is nothing but the goodness of wholegrain oats. Plus, these oats are 100% wholegrain, gluten-free, and low in cholesterol and trans fat, making them a wholesome addition to your daily diet.",Rolled oats instant breakfast cereals for adults kids healthy snacks diet food superfood,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/cc0e95e3-1cb1-45fe-83cb-8267a29d91b0.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",Rolled oats instant breakfast cereals for adults kids healthy snacks diet food superfood,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/4cbb8856-07ee-484f-abdf-a435e6b683ad.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",Rolled oats instant breakfast cereals for adults kids healthy snacks diet food superfood,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/acd8b1cb-e743-4707-ad85-38342fccfe55.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",Rolled oats instant breakfast cereals for adults kids healthy snacks diet food superfood,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/48375242-e382-4605-a6a3-e9b980dc8a6e.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg",,,,,module-12,,Rolled oats instant breakfast cereals for adults kids healthy snacks diet food superfood,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/cc0e95e3-1cb1-45fe-83cb-8267a29d91b0.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg",module-9,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"Customers find these oats to be a great breakfast option with high nutritional value, particularly for achieving daily protein intake. They appreciate the taste and consider it good value for money. The carbohydrate content receives positive feedback, with one customer noting it's a good source of complex carbohydrates. Customers have mixed opinions about the included scoop.",Quality,positive,"Customers find these oats to be of good quality and suitable for breakfast, wit