MuscleBlaze Fish Oil Gold - Premium Triple Strength Formula! _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Fish Oil Gold with triple strength formula is here to meet your ultimate need for good fats and level up your overall well-being. Because of its enhanced potency, it meets your dietary requirements of consuming as much as three fatty fish every week. It is a necessary health supplement as the body is not capable of making Omega 3 on its own. _x000D_
Features of MuscleBlaze Omega 3 Fish Oil Gold! _x000D_
500 mg EPA & 400 mg DHA _x000D_
This omega 3 fish oil supplement offers 500 mg EPA & 400 mg DHA in each fish oil capsule which is equivalent to almost triple the strength of an ordinary omega 3 fish oil supplement. _x000D_
Molecularly distilled _x000D_
These triple strength fish oil capsules have been processed via a high-vacuum molecular distillation to get a pure and premium quality omega 3 fish oil. _x000D_
Sourced from Sardines _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Fish Oil Gold presents the gold standard of fish oil. This premium fish oil is extracted from cold water fishes, Sardines. It is filtered to be offered in the purest form so that the bodybuilders get maximum benefits. _x000D_
Better Bioavailability _x000D_
These omega 3 fish oil capsules for women and men have better bioavailability which makes them an effective fish oil supplement. Better bioavailability of Triglyceride (TG) form of Omega 3 in it results in better absorption and less fishy burps or aftertaste. _x000D_
Free from Mercury _x000D_
Fish and other marine animals may contain impurities that may harm our health if consumed. Therefore, these omega 3 fish oil capsules are purified to provide completely safe and mercury-free omega 3 fish oil for you. _x000D_
Choose MuscleBlaze Fish Oil Gold for Better Health! _x000D_
Joint Health _x000D_
MuscleBlaze Fish Oil Gold is a boon for all bodybuilders involved in heavy-duty workouts. EPA and DHA in Omega 3 fish oil help strengthen bones and joints by enhancing their flexibility & soothing joint inflammation. _x000D_
Heart Health _x000D_
Omega 3 fatty acids help in boosting heart health. 400 mg DHA & 500 mg EPA present in this omega 3 fish oil supplement help in minimizing inflammation, reducing triglyceride levels, and keeping your cholesterol level in control. _x000D_
Brain Function _x000D_
The human brain comprises 60% of fats out of which a majority is omega 3 fatty acids. The omega 3 fatty acids contain EPA & DHA which are crucial for normal brain function and development through various stages. _x000D_
FAQs _x000D_
Why should you consume MuscleBlaze Fish Oil Gold softgel capsule?_x000D_
MuscleBlaze Fish Oil Gold (500 mg EPA and 400 mg DHA) has higher quantities of omega 3 compared to most of the other fish oil supplements. Omega 3 helps prevent the breakdown of muscle cells by the body and maintain a positive anabolic state. Omega 3 also regulates good heart, brain, eye, bone and joint health. _x000D_
What are the primary nutrients in this omega 3 supplement?_x000D_
MuscleBlaze Fish Oil Gold contains long-chain fatty acids like EPA and DHA that are good fats required for your body to function at its best abilities. These fatty acids are also necessary for your body to absorb several nutrients effectively. _x000D_
How does Omega 3 improve performance?_x000D_
Omega 3 is a powerful antioxidant. It protects the body from oxidative damage, supports faster muscle recovery and joint flexibility. _x000D_
Does omega 3 fish oil support muscle recovery?_x000D_
EPA and DHA present in MuscleBlaze Fish Oil Gold (1300 mg) boost muscle synthesis and prevent any muscle breakdown. This results in improved lean muscle development. _x000D_
