,"FAQs _x000D_
Why should you consume MuscleBlaze Fish Oil Gold softgel capsule?_x000D_
MuscleBlaze Fish Oil Gold (500 mg EPA and 400 mg DHA) has higher quantities of omega 3 compared to most of the other fish oil supplements. Omega 3 helps prevent the breakdown of muscle cells by the body and maintain a positive anabolic state. Omega 3 also regulates good heart, brain, eye, bone and joint health. _x000D_
What are the primary nutrients in this omega 3 supplement?_x000D_
MuscleBlaze Fish Oil Gold contains long-chain fatty acids like EPA and DHA that are good fats required for your body to function at its best abilities. These fatty acids are also necessary for your body to absorb several nutrients effectively. _x000D_
How does Omega 3 improve performance?_x000D_
Omega 3 is a powerful antioxidant. It protects the body from oxidative damage, supports faster muscle recovery and joint flexibility. _x000D_
Does omega 3 fish oil support muscle recovery?_x000D_
EPA and DHA present in MuscleBlaze Fish Oil Gold (1300 mg) boost muscle synthesis and prevent any muscle breakdown. This results in improved lean muscle development.",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Navaf Paraparambil,,,5.0,original genuine,High dha and epa very good,2026-02-12,1.0,Reviewed in the United Arab Emirates on 12 February 2026,R2RMF72LJKV1VS,,,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/eb327fa8-b356-4428-9c61-60b9f050d3cb._CR0%2C0%2C375%2C375_UX460_SX48_.jpg,Size: 60 count (Pack of 1),Size,60 count (Pack of 1),,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/94a23372-b4de-48da-8df5-0eba1913bf78.__CR0,0,150,300_PT0_SX150_V1___.jpg",,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/658c5388-a714-4071-b2a7-50ec988060cb.__CR0,0,150,300_PT0_SX150_V1___.jpg",MB Fish Oil,https://www.amazon.in/dp/B08KDCKSGK?ref=emc_s_m_5_i_atc,"4.3 out of 5 stars 1,524",â‚¹559.00,1000 mg,180 mg,120 mg,âœ“,âœ“,,"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/94a23372-b4de-48da-8df5-0eba1913bf78.__CR0,0,150,300_PT0_SX150_V1___.jpg",MB Fish Oil Gold,https://www.amazon.in/dp/B08KZTVPC6?ref=emc_s_m_5_i_atc,"4.3 out of 5 stars 3,694","â‚¹1,049.00",1250 mg,500 mg,400 mg,âœ“,âœ“,,,,
