a on 31 August 2021,R2USG060MF2JUT,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R2USG060MF2JUT/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,6 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/ce16ef49-7b0a-4e52-b521-096c9cc1359e._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_SX48_.jpg,,,,,,(0w0),amzn1.account.AG3B2ETVYU4B2Z223ZF4EVIY36XA,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AG3B2ETVYU4B2Z223ZF4EVIY36XA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,5.0,Noticeable changes in health. Worth the price.,"I recently got some kind of deficiency that made my left eye red, swollen, tearing up, couldn't see properly.I think it might be related to B vitamins because the eye was, overall, light sensitive or photosensitive.Ate a lot of non veg foods, greens, etc, but this supplement made a really noticeable change really fastly.Last time I got the eye issue, it went away in 4-5 days, because I only had natural sources of nutrients (food).When I got the eye issue again recently, it went away in 2 days, on 2nd day afternoon this supplement arrived home in delivery, I took only one pill in afternoon, by next morning I was able to see properly. Ever since then, every day I take one pill, with food, avoid taking this with coffee or caffeinated drinks, it blocks certain mineral absorption.Worth the price, will buy again very soon.",2022-02-28,6.0,Reviewed in India on 28 February 2022,R3TG1R9UB15PWV,https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3TG1R9UB15PWV/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&ie=UTF8,6 people found this helpful,1.0,0.0,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/30d3b2f4-5a69-4628-a011-15c08d130d21._CR106%2C0%2C288%2C288_SX460_SX48_.jpg,,Y DHANA SOWJANYA,amzn1.account.AGZKHX6WDNQBDOFD737ISBJB6CZQ,https://www.amazon.in/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGZKHX6WDNQBDOFD737ISBJB6CZQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top,4.0,GoodGood,Feeling just better after usage of this medicine....not completely pains disappear...but slightly feeling active...it sai